<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="h">BAKA I</para>
  <para style="toc1">BAKA KUKŨ KASALE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Baka I</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bak I</para>
  <para style="mt2">BAKA KUKŨ KASALE</para>
  <para style="mt1">BAKA</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKIOTUO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Baka Kukũ Kasale nwu</char> lɛkyɛ sitũ kuodiki Israel batii sekofolaa di sɛka suoto diayɔ ni di <char style="bk">Samuel </char> Akũ kamɛ. Baafuo kukũ nwu ɔsɛ di akyuu atiɛ kamɛ: (1) Solomon osiɛ di lekpomii suoto fɛ Israel ku Yuda ɔka, ku ote Dawid kukpi. (2) Solomon sɛka ole ku asaa ya aafuo ni ɔbla. Kyenkye Olekatakɔ nwu finle otofo di Yerusalem. (3) Kale nwu ɔsɛ di katoo kasɔ ku kala kasɔ sɛka nlekɔ nwu, ku baka ba niale ni sɛka di suoto lɛma, suoto sɛlaa diesifi ni alɛɛ alafa-anaasĩ diɔwa ni alafa anɛ fiɛ baalofo ni <char style="sc">Kristo</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Di <char style="bk">baka kukũ kasale</char> ku kukũ <char style="bk">nnyɔɔfa</char> kamɛ yi, baakanko ɔka biala di onukwale nɔɔ ole ɔta Yaa, ku kale sitũ ɔkyɛ di onukwale ole nwu suoto. Afiɔ ɔtɔ ku otokopĩ, di kakyɛ bamba, nkpaa ma ninkpee di dibuo kamɛ. Baka bamuu di katoo kasɔ sɛka kalekɔ ditafuo ɔsɔ onyu nwu nkpo olenkee. Di obe nwu kamɛ Yuda baka bawo ɔsaabla lalɛ, bawo ɔsaabla kafɔɔ ditalɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Di <char style="bk">Baka kuku kasale</char> kamɛ Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lale SAATE nwu kanya badikitɛ nwaa, ba niawɛ ni sɛkambi, baasĩ ɔlaa baata ni batii alɛ batantɔ ni afiɔ, batambla ni otokopĩ kafɔɔ di Yaa suoto. Kyenkye nwɔ baatofo ni ninle Elia ku Baal afiɔ olebatatɛ suoto ɔlaa, aananfiko ma ni ɔlaa di (disi lefosi nɛnle kamɛ 18).</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Dawid sɛka ole kalookɔ 1.1-2. 12</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon labakple ɔka 2.13-46</para>
  <para style="io1">Solomon sɛka ole 3.1-11.43</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Alɛɛ ya niale ni katũ 3.1-4.34</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Baatofo Olekatakɔ 5.1-8.66</para>
  <para style="io2">ɔ. Alɛɛ ya sɛɛmaa 9.1-11.43</para>
  <para style="io1">Sɛka kalekɔ ka niasɛ nii 12.1-22.53</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Katoo kasɔ ana kudu okpee 12.1-14.20</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Yuda ku Israel baka 14.21-16.34</para>
  <para style="io2">ɔ. Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ Elia 17.1-19.21</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Israel Ɔka Ahab 20.1-22.40</para>
  <para style="io2">e. Yuda Yehosafat ku Israel Ahasia 22.41-53</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Obe Wɔ Di Ɔka Dawid Labe Ni Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1" />Obe wɔ di Ɔka Dawid labe aafũ ni alɛɛ aakyɛ ni sitũ nwaa yi, kuntɛ baatĩtĩi nwɔ ku abula yi, atasintoonu difila. <verse eid="1KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2" />Nioso bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Ta wo bumiɛ kakpeelebitɛ buta ɔka, aasiɛ atoonyu nwɔ. Aafuo ni ote di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɔɔ alɛ, saate loo ɔka kawɛ ni difila.”<verse eid="1KI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3" />Nioso baamiɛ ɔsankobi wɔ ninlɛ ni sekpeele di Israel kasɔ kamuu ni baawɛ Abisag, Sunami otii nɛ. Ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4" />Ɔsankobi nwu latɛ aalɛ sekpeele; aatoonyu ɔka nwu, aatɔɔtɔɔ alesaa, kafɔɔ ɔka ditakpanko nwɔ.<verse eid="1KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5" />Ninfɛ di Adonigya latakatɛsa suoto katoo, nnwɔ di ɔya niale ni Hagit, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Kamale ɔka.” Nioso aamiɛ bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ, ku batii afosi anɔɔ alɛ bale nwɔ katũ. <verse eid="1KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6" />(Diidii ote ditakaalɛ nwɔ ɔlaa di lɛsalɛsaa kuninwii suoto alɛ, “Obe oso fɔɔbla nle mmle ku nninkpo?” Aatɛ aalɛ sekosopo kafɔɔ, nnwɔɔ baalofo baatikasako Absalom nɛ.)<verse eid="1KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7" />Adonigya lakakatɛko Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab ku oletatɛ Abiatar nwu, ni baayila nwɔ kamaa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8" />Kafɔɔ oletatɛ Sadok, Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia, ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan, Simei ku Rei ku Dawid bakpɛtɛ biene ditatikanko Adonigya.<verse eid="1KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9" />Ninfɛ di Adonigya lata ole ku bafoso, banankyue ku banankyue abi ya niasiɛ ni ala di Sohelet difuɔ nwu niatɛɛtɛɛ ni En Rogel. Ninfɛ aalɛɛ babilɛma-suɔtɔbi bamuu, ɔka babisuɔtɔbi ku Yuda basuɔtɔ ba bamuu niale ni ɔka banɔɔfotii, <verse eid="1KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10" />kafɔɔ atalɛɛ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan ee Benaia ee bakpɛtɛ biene nwu ee obilɛma-suɔtɔbi Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11" />Ninfɛ di Natan lakaalɛ Solomon ɔya Betseba alɛ, “Fadinu falɛ Hagit obisuɔtɔbi Adonigya nwu ntookple ɔka di obe wɔ di saate loo Dawid dieye nwu ni ole? <verse eid="1KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12" />Ta nkpo oso, tɛɛ nka fɔ di mmle okle faafuo ni nkpa lɛfɔ ofũ ku obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Solomon nkpa ofũ. <verse eid="1KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13" />Kyɛ Ɔka Dawid nfũ faalaatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Saate nii ɔka, fataka ntam faata ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ falɛ: “Nwaako obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Solomon nimale ɔka di sɛmaa nii, ni nnwɔɔ nimasiɛ di lɛkakpomii nii suoto”? Ni obe oso nfɛ di Adonigya nintɔbakple ɔka?’  <verse eid="1KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14" />Obe wɔ feekple fakpe ni ninfa fɔɔkakatɛko ni ɔka yi, kamawa nfa mayila ɔlaa wɔ fatoobuɛ ni kamaa.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15" />Nioso Batseba lakyɛ aalaanya ɔka nwu nintoobe ni di leyo nɔɔ kamɛ, di nfũ di Abisag, Sunam otii nwu latoonyu nwɔ nii. <verse eid="1KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16" />Ninfɛ di Batseba lawa kasɔ aapɛ akunkyi di ɔka nwu anu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:16">Ni di ɔka nwu lakaalɛ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Obe ninle lɛsaale foomiɛ ni?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17" />Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Saate nii, afɔ omu lɛfɔ niaka ntam faata ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ di SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ nwu suoto falɛ: ‘Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Solomon nimale ɔka di sɛmaa nii, ni nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ nimasiɛ di lɛkakpomii nii suoto nɛ.’  <verse eid="1KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18" />Kafɔɔ nunua Adonigya ntɔbakple ɔka, di afɔ ɔka saate nii, fanan-ye nwu ni ole. <verse eid="1KI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19" />Atoolo banankyue, banankyue abi ya ninsi ni ala ku bafoso kpinwu ɛɛta ole, atɔɔlɛɛ ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu, Abiatar oletatɛ ku Yoab bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ, kafɔɔ atalɛɛ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20" />Ɔka saate nii, Israel omuu anu ntika fɔ di suoto alɛ, baatofo mankyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ alɛ owe nimasiɛ di ɔka, saate nii lɛkakpomii nwu suoto di nnwɔɔ kamaa. <verse eid="1KI 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21" />Nse diele nkpo, dibawa alɛ, nse ɔka, saate nii lesifi bate nɔɔ nfũ, ni ami ku obisuɔtɔbi nii Solomon bababla wo fɛ batii kpile bule.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22" />Obe wɔ di ɔsanko nwu leekple ayɛ ɔɔkakatɛko ni ɔka yi, ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan lawa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan nkpe ninfũ.” Nioso aakyɛ ɔka anu, ni aawakasɔ aase disi kaasɔ aatɔɔ dibu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24" />Ninfɛ di Natan lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔka saate nii, afɔ niebuɛ falɛ, Adonigya kale ɔka di sɛmaa lɛfɔ, ni nnwɔɔ nimasiɛ di lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ suoto? <verse eid="1KI 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25" />Miɛ wɔ mmle atoosoo ɛɛkyɛ ɛɛlaalo banankyue, banankyue abi ya ninsi ni ala ku bafoso kpinwu ɛɛta ole. Atɔɔlɛɛ ɔka babisuɔtɔbi bamuu, bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ ku oletatɛ Abiatar. Kanunua ka mmle boole manwee, mannyi ku nnwɔɔ, mantaa siwidi mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Ɔka Adonigya asiɛ nkpa aklɛ!’  <verse eid="1KI 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26" />Kafɔɔ aalɛɛ ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, ku oletatɛ Sadok ku Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia ku kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Solomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27" />Nle mmle ninle lɛsaa le di saate nii ɔka lɛbla ni nɛ, fiɛ ananta bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ batofo nnwɔ nimasiɛ ni di saate nii ɔka lɛkakpomii suoto di kamaa nɔɔ nɛ?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lase Solomon Sɛka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Bilɛɛ Batseba biwako.” Nioso Batseba lawa ɔka nfũ aabayila di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="1KI 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu laka ntam aabuɛ alɛ, “Di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu nkpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ niadiki mi aakyeko ni dibuo biala kamɛ, <verse eid="1KI 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30" />nwaako miɛ dii le mmle kamabla nle laka ntam lata fɔ ni di SAATE Israel Yaa nwu suoto nlɛ: Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ Solomon nimale ɔka kaamaa nii, nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ nimayila mi kaanya, ansiɛ di lɛkakpomii nii suoto nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31" />Ninfɛ di Batseba lawakasɔ, aawakosa disi kasɔ, ni aapɛ akunkyi di ɔka anu aabuɛ alɛ, “Ɔka saate nii Dawid asiɛ nkpa dinaa ni kaloo!”<verse eid="1KI 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Dawid labuɛ alɛ, “Bilɛɛ oletatɛ Sadok ku Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan ku Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia bitɛɛ.” Obe wɔ baawa ni ɔka anu yi, <verse eid="1KI 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33" />ni aatɔkɔ ma alɛ: “Bikpaa saate lee kpɛmblatɛ bikyakaa di suoto, biɛta obisuɔtɔbi nii Solomon asiɛ di ami omu nii bɔkɛɛ wɔ ninte ni fɛ pɔnkɔ suoto, biɛkpaa nwɔ bisooko bisifiko Gihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34" />Di oletatɛ Sadok ku Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan bapɛ Solomon ɔfɔɔ ninfa base nwɔ sɛka di Israel suoto. Bifɛ dikyukyoo, biɛtaa siwidi kafɔɔ bilɛ, ‘Ɔka Solomon asiɛ nkpa kaanale!’  <verse eid="1KI 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35" />Nni kamaa, bietikanko nwɔ bikata bisifi, aalaasiɛ di lɛkakpomii nii suoto, aale sɛka kasiɛkɔ nii. Ami niediki nwɔ nlɛ aale sɛka di Israel ku Yuda suoto.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36" />Ninfɛ di Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Diwa kaanya! SAATE nwu, ninle ni saate nii ɔka, Yaa nwu abuɛ nkpo. <verse eid="1KI 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37" />Fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu lasiɛko nii saate nii ɔka, nkpo aasiɛko Solomon nɛ, aata bia lɛkakpomii nɔɔ ditaka katoo dilenkee saate nii Ɔka Dawid lele!”<verse eid="1KI 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38" />Nioso oletatɛ Sadok, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan, Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia, Kereti batii ku Peleti batii lasoo baakyɛ, ni baakɛnkɛ Solomon baatika di Ɔka Dawid bɔkɛɛ wɔ ninte ni fɛ pɔnkɔ suoto, ni baakpaa nwɔ baasifiko Gihon nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39" />Nfa di oletatɛ Sadok layɔ bɔkɛɛ lɛkya le di nnɔnyi nsi nii, di akpanta klekle nwu kamɛ ni aapɛ Solomon ɔfɔɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ baafɛ dikyukyoo nwu nɛ, ni di batii nwu bamuu lataa siwidi alɛ, “Ɔka Solomon asiɛ nkpa kaanale!” <verse eid="1KI 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40" />Nioso batii nwu bamuu lakple baatikanko nwɔ baakata baasifi, baatɔɔfɛ kukyukyue, baatɔɔnya suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ. Nioso kudu lɛma nwu lata alɛ kasɔ latũkũ.<verse eid="1KI 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41" />Obe wɔ di Adonigya ku batii ba bamuu aalɛɛ ni lawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ lanu nwu ni ole, di obe wɔ baaloo oloo alesaa ole. Di Yoab lanu ni dikyukyoo nwu sɛlɔ yi, ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Kɔmɛndu ninkpe di okpoo kplɛ nwu nkpo?”<verse eid="1KI 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42" />Bia di obe wɔ anadiloo ni ɔkakatɛ yi, ni di oletatɛ Abiatar obisuɔtɔbi Yonatan lalaabuo nɛ. Ni di Adonigya labuɛ alɛ, “Buo fawa. Diekye otii finle fɛle afɔ okle kamawako ɔlaa biene.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43" />Ninfɛ di Yonatan ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kpawoo! Saate loo Ɔka Dawid ntoose Solomon sɛka. <verse eid="1KI 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44" />Ɔka nwu ntookpee oletatɛ Sadok, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan, Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia, Kereti batii ku Peleti batii bɛɛlaakyakaa di nnwɔɔ, bɛɛyɔ nwɔ beesiɛsa di ɔka bɔkɛɛ wɔ ninte ni fɛ pɔnkɔ suoto, <verse eid="1KI 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45" />ni di oletatɛ Sadok ku Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Natan lɛpɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ beese nwɔ ɔka di Gihon nɛ. Beekye ninfa bɔɔkata mansifi ku suoto lɛyɔɔ, nni niɛta alɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu lekitikiti nɛ. Nni ninle kudu ko bionu ni nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46" />Diɛkyakaa nii, Solomon nfɛ nsi di lɛkakpomii nwu suoto. <verse eid="1KI 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47" />Mmia nwu kafɔɔ, ɔka banɔɔfotii nwu ntɔɔwa bɛɛbakpee saate loo Ɔka Dawid kɔnɛɛ, beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Yaa lɛfɔ ata Solomon leyooto dikyɛ kakyonkɔ dilenkee lele fɔ, di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ kafɔɔ ditaka katoo dilenkee lele fɔ!’ Ninfɛ di ɔka lawakasɔ di atensaa nɔɔ suoto aasumu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ ‘Baatansa SAATE Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ niɛta anu nii lɛnya ni otii wɔ nimasiɛ ni di lɛkakpomii nii suoto miɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49" />Ninfɛ di ɔfɔɔ lasifi batii ba bamuu di Adonigya lalɛɛ nii, ni baataka baasamii nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50" />Kafɔɔ Adonigya layɛkɛ Solomon, ni aasifi aalaataniko di oleɔta akyikye nwu akyɛɛ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Solomon alɛ, “Adonigya kɔyɛkɛ Ɔka Solomon, nioso ɛɛtaniko di oleɔta akyikye nwu akyɛɛ suoto nɛ. Oobuɛ alɛ, ‘Bita Ɔka Solomon aka ntam atɛɛ miɛ wɔ mmle alɛ, alɔbalo kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ku kapamii.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52" />Ninfɛ di Solomon ladiki kanya alɛ “Nse ɛɛbla asaa di osuku kanya yi, ni bia disi nɔɔ onwini onwii dilɔbakpa kupɛ kaasɔ; kafɔɔ nse bɛɛnya okpile di suoto nɔɔ yi, ni abakpi.” <verse eid="1KI 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Solomon lakpee batii baakyɛ baalaakpaa nwɔ di oleɔta akyikye nwu katũ baawako nɛ. Ninfɛ di Adonigya lawa aabapɛ akunkyi di Ɔka Solomon katũ nɛ, ni di Solomon latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ leyo lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Dawid Laka Solomon Lɛyɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1" />Di obe nfɛ kɔtɛɛtɛɛ ni di Dawid makpi nii yi, ni aaka obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Solomon nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2" />Aabuɛ alɛ, “Nfɛ kamasifi kafa ka di otii biala kaasɔ ka mmle nwu kamakyɛ nii. Nioso wɛ osie, faadiki suoto lɛfɔ fatuo fɛ osuɔtɔ, <verse eid="1KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3" />faabla lɛsaa le di SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ nwu komiɛ ni: Faakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto, faaklee asaa otuo nɔɔ ku ablasaa, afiofa nɔɔ ku abiesaa nɔɔ, fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di Mose Kufiofa kamɛ, alɛ dialɛ ninta fɔ di ɔsaabla lɛfɔ omuu kamɛ ku kakɔ lele fɛɛkyɛ, <verse eid="1KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4" />alɛ SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ aatɛ aatɛɛ nii alɛ: ‘Nse banantii lɛfɔ lelolaa nkpa beesiɛ, nse bɛɛkyɛ kafɔɔ di anu nii di onukwale kanya ku otu lɛma omuu ku ɔkla lɛma omuu yi, ni batii lɛfɔ ba nimasiɛ ni di Israel lɛkakpomii nwu suoto dilɔbaloo diidii.’<verse eid="1KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5" />“Nunua, afɔ omu faye lɛsaa le di Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab labla mi nii- lɛsaa le aabla ni Israel bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ banyɔ nwu, Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner ku Yeter obisuɔtɔbi Amasa. Aalo ma, aayɔ ntɔ lɛma aawii di atoko ɔkyɛ ole obe kamɛ fɛ le kakpɛ kamɛ diale, ni di ntɔ nwu nkpo lakpekpete di ofiamɛ wɔ aatika ni di ɔtɔ ku ntokota be ninkpaa nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6" />Blako nwɔ suoto ɔkpɛ di ninumbe lɛfɔ kanya, kafɔɔ tantɔɔ aasifi ɔkya kamɛ ku disi fututu nɔɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7" />“Kafɔɔ diki sifutulɛ fatuo Barsilai babisuɔtɔbi ba niekye ni Gilead, faata ma kafɔɔ basiɛ di mba ninle ni alesaa di opunu lɛfɔ suoto kamɛ. Diekye nkpo baabla baatɛɛ di obe wɔ latoso ni di obilee-suɔtɔbi Absalom nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8" />“Nyuma kafɔɔ falɛ, Gera obisuɔtɔbi Simei nkpe, Benyamin otii nwu niekye ni Bahurim, nnwɔ niakpaani mi ni osie kanya di dii le lakyɛ ni Mahanaim. Obe wɔ aasoo aabakyakako mi ni di Yordan okle kotoko, laka ntam di SAATE nwu suoto latɔɔ nlɛ: ‘Namalo fɔ ku kapamii.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9" />Kafɔɔ nunua, tannyu nwɔ fɛ otii wɔ ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ. Osuɔtɔ wɔ niebe ni anu fale; fabatofo lɛsaa le fababla nwɔ nii. Ta disi fututu nɔɔ nwu dibuo di ɔkya kamɛ di ntɔ nɔɔ owii kaasɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10" />Ninfɛ di Dawid latɛ ɔnyɛɛ di bate nɔɔ anɛ nfũ nɛ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11" />Aale sɛka di Israel suoto alɛɛ afosi ana. Alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ di Hebron suoto, alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-atiɛ kafɔɔ di Yerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12" />Nioso Solomon lasiɛ di ote Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto, sɛka ole nɔɔ kafɔɔ layila osie kanya.<verse eid="1KI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lalo Adonigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13" />Ninfɛ di Hagit obisuɔtɔbi Adonigya lakyɛ Solomon ɔya Betseba nfũ nɛ. Ni di Batseba lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya fɛɛwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Ninfɛ di Adonigya ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yii, atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya nkyɛ.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14" />Ninfɛ aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, “Nkpe ɔlaa onwii nlɛ kɔtɔkɔ fɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Ninfɛ di Solomon ɔya labuɛ alɛ, “Faafuo obuɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15" />Ni di Adonigya labuɛ alɛ, “Fɛ mmle faye nii, sɛka kalekɔ nwu sele mi siale. Israel batii bamuu latɔɔnyɛɛ fɛ ɔka lɛma. Kafɔɔ asaa lakyi, ni di sɛka kalekɔ nwu ntoosifi obiloo-suɔtɔbi nfũ nɛ; diekye SAATE nwu nfũ siekye siɛtɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16" />Nunua lɛsaa ninwii lete kɔkaalɛ nkyeko ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ. Tansĩ mi ɔta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Ninfɛ di Solomon ɔya labuɛ alɛ, “Afɔ kaalɛ ni.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17" />Nioso aakyɛ sitũ aabuɛ alɛ, “Lekoto kaalɛ Ɔka Solomon-ɔlabasĩ ata fɔ- aayɔ Abisag, Sunami otii nwu atɛɛ fɛ ɔsɔfɔ nii.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18" />Ninfɛ di Batseba ladiki kanya alɛ, “Kulɛ, kamakakatɛko ɔka nta fɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19" />Obe wɔ di Batseba lakyɛ ni Ɔka Solomon nfũ alɛ ɔɔlaakakatɛko ni Ɔka anta ni Adonigya yi, ɔka lataka aayila abakyakako ɔya Betseba, ni aawa kasɔ aatɔɔ, ni aakple aasiɛ di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto nɛ. Ni di ɔka lata baayɔ lɛkakpomii bamba baawako ɔya, ni aasiɛ di oletanɛɛkyɛ nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ɔya labuɛ alɛ, “Nkpe lɛsaa biibii ninwii nlɛ kɔkaalɛ nkyeko ni ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ. Tansĩ mi ɔta.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Yaami, kaalɛ; namasĩ fɔ ɔta.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21" />Nioso Batseba labuɛ alɛ, “Ta bayɔ Abisag, Sunami otii nwu bata obilee-suɔtɔbi Adonigya ayɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22" />Ni di Ɔka Solomon lakaalɛ ɔya alɛ, “Obe oso fɔɔkaalɛ Abisag, Sunami otii nwu fanta Adonigya? Ni kaalɛ ɔkaalɛ sɛka kalekɔ nwu fatɔɔ, nnwu mɔɔ, obiloo-suɔtɔbi nɔɔfole ale, yii, oletatɛ Abiatar ku Seruia obisuɔtɔbi Yoab kafɔɔ n-yɛ nwɔ kamaa!”<verse eid="1KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Solomon laka di SAATE nwu aabuɛ alɛ: “Yaa ananfi mi kootoko, aata bia diwɛ osie nwaa, nse Adonigya diɛyɔ nkpa nɔɔ ata koto di nle mmle ɔɔkaalɛ ni nkpo suoto! <verse eid="1KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24" />Nunua, di SAATE nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, di nnwɔ niesiɛsɛɛ ni di teemi Dawid lɛkakpomii suoto kpinkpĩ, ɛɛta banantii nii kafɔɔ kole ni sɛka fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ nii, miɛ wɔ mmle babalo Adonigya!” <verse eid="1KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25" />Nioso Ɔka Solomon lakpee Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia aakyɛ aalaasafɔ Adonigya aatɛ kaasɔ, ni aakpi nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abiatar Otososa Ku Yoab Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ oletatɛ Abiatar alɛ, “Kple fasifi afe lɛfɔ di Anatot. Feesiɛko faakpi nii, kafɔɔ namalo fɔ nunua, diekye faatuka SAATE Kplɛ nwu lɛlakaa di teemi Dawid anu, faafe kafɔɔ di asaa siene ya amuu kamɛ di teemi lafe ni kamɛ.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27" />Nkpo oso Solomon latososa Abiatar alɛ atansinle SAATE nwu oletatɛ, mmle okle di SAATE nwu ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ ni di Silo di Eli leyo suoto kawa ni kaanya.<verse eid="1KI 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28" />Obe wɔ di ɔlaa nwu ladu ni Yoab, nnwɔ niakũ ni kanwumbe ku Adonigya, nu atabla onwii ku Absalom yi, aatoso aasifi SAATE nwu lɛkpaayo kamɛ, aalaamufũ oleɔta akyikye nwu akyɛɛ aaklee. <verse eid="1KI 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29" />Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Ɔka Solomon alɛ Yoab ntootoso eesifi SAATE nwu lɛkpaayo kamɛ, ayɛ kafɔɔ di oleɔta akyikye nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ. Ninfɛ di Solomon lakpee Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia alɛ, “Kyɛ falaasafɔ nwu fatɛ kaasɔ!”<verse eid="1KI 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30" />Nioso Benaia lakyɛ aalaabuo SAATE nwu lɛkpaayo nwu kamɛ, ni aabuɛ aatɔkɔ Yoab alɛ, “Ɔka alɛ, ‘Die fawa!’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Kafɔɔ aadiki kanya alɛ, “Oowo, kamakpi ninfũ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Ninfɛ di Benaia lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Nnya mmle okle di Yoab lɛtɔkɔ mi ni.”<verse eid="1KI 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Benaia alɛ, “Bla fɛ mmle eebuɛ ni. Safɔ nwɔ ninfa fatɛ, faakookaa nwɔ, ni faatoodiki ami ku teemi leyo di okpile ntɔ be ninankpi ni lɛpɔɔ di Yoab lawii ni kaasɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32" />SAATE nwu kamatɔɔ ntɔ be aawii ni koto, diekye teemi Dawid ditatofo nwu ole fiɛ aadieko basuɔtɔ banyɔ, ni aalo ma ku kapamii nɛ. Banyɔ lɛma nwu, Ner obisuɔtɔbi Abner, Israel bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ, ku Yeter obisuɔtɔbi Amasa, Yuda bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ-lale bakpɛtɛ nwaa ku baklekletɛ baalenkee nwɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33" />Ntɔ lɛma nwu okpile kutika nwɔ diisi ku banantii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo. Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu atoko ɔkyɛ ole ditika di Dawid ku banantii nɔɔ, leyo nɔɔ ku lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34" />Nioso Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia lakyɛ aalaasafɔ Yoab, ni aalo nwɔ nɛ. Ninfɛ baakookaa nwɔ di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ kasɔ di ɔfaafuu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35" />Ninfɛ di ɔka layɔ Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia aase di bakpɛtɛ kanya di Yoab kayilakɔ, aayɔ kafɔɔ Sadok aase oletatɛ di Abiatar kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36" />Ninfɛ di ɔka lakpee baalaatɔkɔ Simei alɛ, “Tofo leyo fata suoto di Yerusalem faasiɛ ninfa, kafɔɔ tandie faakyɛ kakɔkaakɔ. <verse eid="1KI 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37" />Dii lele feedie fɛɛtaalɛ Kidron Ɔtaata nwu, ni faatofo falɛ fabakpi; ntɔ lɛfɔ kamatika di afɔ omu lɛfɔ disi.<verse eid="1KI 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38" />Ninfɛ di Simei latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Ɔlaa wɔ feebuɛ ni nlɛ. Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamabla fɛ mmle di saate nii ɔka lebuɛ nii.” Nioso Simei lasiɛ di Yerusalem diaklɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39" />Kafɔɔ di alɛɛ atiɛ sɛmaa, Simei balanle banyɔ latoso baasifi Maaka obisuɔtɔbi Akis, Gat ɔka nfũ. Ninfɛ baatɔkɔ Simei alɛ, “Balanle lɛfɔ nwu nkpe di Gat.” <verse eid="1KI 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40" />Ta nle mmle oso Simei lalolaa bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo, aasiɛ nwɔ di suoto aasifi Akis nfũ aalaawolaa balanle nɔɔ nwu di Gat. Nioso Simei lakyɛ aalaakpaa balanle nwu di Gat aawako.<verse eid="1KI 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41" />Obe wɔ baatɔkɔ Solomon alɛ Simei ladie di Yerusalem aakyɛ ni Gat, atookple ni kafɔɔ yi, <verse eid="1KI 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42" />ninfɛ di ɔka lakpee baalɛɛ Simei ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ami nlɛ lata fɔ faaka di SAATE nwu leyooto, lasĩ ɔlaa lata fɔ nlɛ, ‘Di dii le feedie ninfũ fɛɛkyɛ ni kakɔ lele, ni faatofo nwaa falɛ fabakpi’? Di obe nwu faatɔkɔ mi falɛ, ‘Ɔlaa wɔ feebuɛ ni nlɛ. Kamakyɔɔ kotoko.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43" />Ni obe oso fananle ntam lɛfɔ be faaka faata ni SAATE nwu, fale kufiofa ko kafɔɔ lakpee fɔ ni?”<verse eid="1KI 2:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44" />Ninfɛ di ɔka latɔkɔ Simei alɛ, “Faye di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ asaa lɛlaale ya amuu faabla faakpee ni teemi Dawid. Nunua SAATE nwu kamata fɔ koto di ɔsaabla lalaale lɛfɔ nwu suoto. <verse eid="1KI 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45" />Kafɔɔ babawii Ɔka Solomon lɛyɔɔ, Dawid kafɔɔ lɛkakpomii nwu kamate osie kanya di SAATE nwu anu dinaa ni kaloo.” <verse eid="1KI 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia osuku, ni aadie aakyɛ aalaasafɔ Simei aatɛ kaasɔ, aalo nwɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:46">Nioso sɛka kalekɔ nwu nfɛ labayila kpinkpĩ di Solomon nnɛɛ.<verse eid="1KI 2:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lakaalɛ Ninumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1" />Solomon lanii kanya ku Egipte ɔka Farao, ni aayɔ obisankobi nɔɔ nɛ. Ni aakpaa nwɔ aawako Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu dialaase di obe wɔ aaloo ni lɛkayo nɔɔ ku SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku oyoyiɛ otofo okyisa Yerusalem nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2" />Di obe nwu nkpo kamɛ yi, batii nwu lakple baatɔɔta oleɔta di ntakalekɔ nwu, diekye baditofo olekatakɔ bata SAATE nwu Leyooto. <verse eid="1KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3" />Solomon ladiki lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ aatuo SAATE nwu, aakyɛ di ote Dawid afiofa kanya, diediki alɛ aata oleɔta ku olufui ofiɛ di ntakalekɔ nwu.<verse eid="1KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4" />Ni di ɔka nwu lakyɛ Gibeon alɛ ɔɔlaata oleɔta ninfa, diekye nfa niale katakalekɔ finle nɛ. Ninfɛ di Solomon lata ofiɛ asaaɔta kakpe di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5" />Di Gibeon yi, SAATE nwu ladiki suoto aatuo Solomon kakyɛ nwu di kɔlaafɔ kamɛ, ni di Yaa labuɛ alɛ, “Kaalɛ mi lɛsaa lele foomiɛ falɛ nta fɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6" />Ninfɛ di Solomon ladiki kanya alɛ, “Fatootuo teemi, kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Dawid sifutulɛ kplɛ, diekye aale onukwale aata fɔ, aate tinini, aakpa kafɔɔ di otu kamɛ. Ni feekple fɛɛkyɛ sitũ feediki sifutulɛ kplɛ se mmle feetuo nwɔ, ni fɛɛtɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi asi di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto miɛ dii le mmle nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7" />“Oo SAATE Yaa nii, nunua, fatɔɔyɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ feese ɔka di teemi Dawid kanya. Kafɔɔ obisɔ biibii ko nle, nin-ye mmle kafɔɔ kabla ni sɛkpɛ nii nfenko nii. <verse eid="1KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8" />Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nsi di batii lɛfɔ ba feediki ni kamɛ ninfũ, kale kplɛ, beesii ni ɔpɔ, manamafuo ma ni ɔka ee batɛ ma ni nsũ. <verse eid="1KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9" />Nkpo oso ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lɛsaatofo otu kayɔ nkpa ni batii lɛfɔ, ntofo ni dibiene ku lɛlalaale. Diekye owe nikamafuo kale kplɛ batii lɛfɔ ba mmle ɔkpa?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10" />Suoto layɔɔ SAATE nwu alɛ Solomon lakaalɛ lɛsaa le mmle. <verse eid="1KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11" />Nioso Yaa latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Di obe wɔ fɛɛkaalɛ ni lɛsaa le mmle oso, ninanle ni nkpa kaanale ee lɛsaawɛ fata ni suoto ee fakaalɛ ni kukpi fata ni balo lɛfɔ, kafɔɔ fɛɛkaalɛ ni ninumbe alɛ faaka ni lɛka tinini yi, <verse eid="1KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12" />kamabla lɛsaa le fɛɛkaalɛ ni nta fɔ. Kamata fɔ ninumbe ku lɛsaatofo otu, di mmle di otii kuonwii diiwɛ nini diidii fɛle afɔ okle, ee otii kuonwii kafɔɔ dilɔbawɛ ni diidii. <verse eid="1KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13" />Diɛkyakaa nii, kamata fɔ lɛsaa le fanankaalɛ nii, lɛsaawɛ ku dibu, akyuu nwu anyɔ-alɛ di nkpa lɛfɔ kamɛ, ɔka kuonwii dilɔbawɛ abakyɛkyɛ ni ku afɔ. <verse eid="1KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14" />Nse fɛɛkyɛ di sisuku nii suoto, feeklee ɔsaabla nii, feele kafɔɔ afiofa nii fɛ mmle di teefɔ Dawid labla ni yi, kamata fɔ nkpa kaanale.” <verse eid="1KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lasɛnkɛ nɛ- ni aatofo alɛ kɔlaafɔ kule aasɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:15">Ni aakple aasifi Yerusalem, aalaayila di SAATE nwu kanya ninnii lɛlakaa anu, aata ofiɛ asaaɔta ole ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta nɛ. Nni kamaa, aatũ opunu aata banɔɔfotii nɔɔ bamuu.<verse eid="1KI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Laka Lɛka Siene Ninwii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16" />Dii ninwii, basanko-basɔnɔkpeetɛ banyɔ bawĩi lakyɛ baalaayila di ɔka anu. <verse eid="1KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17" />Ninfɛ di onwii lɛma labuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii, ami ku ɔsanko wɔ mmle ninsi di leyo ninwii kamɛ. Ami ku nnwɔɔ niawɛ ninfa fiɛ lalofo obi. <verse eid="1KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18" />Lalofo obi nii laloo nii, dii tiɛfa suoto, ɔsanko wɔ mmle kafɔɔ lalofo obi. Lete loo niawɛ; kuonwii ditawɛ di leyo nwu kamɛ, kafɔɔ batii loo banyɔ lete.<verse eid="1KI 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19" />“Kakyɛ nwu yi, ɔsanko wɔ mmle obisuɔtɔbi lakpi, diekye aate nwɔ di suoto. <verse eid="1KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20" />Nioso aataka di nkyɛntɛɛ, aaklee obisuɔtɔbi nii aayɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ nii, di obe wɔ di ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ late latɔɔkyɔsĩi nii. Ni aayɔ obisuɔtɔbi nwu aalaatɛ di lɛnyɛɛ nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ, ni aayɔ obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu nintookpi ni kafɔɔ aabatɛ di lɛnyɛɛ nii ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21" />Koleesɛ kuyitatũ, lataka nlɛ kɔta obisuɔtɔbi nii nnyɛɛfu- ni lanya nlɛ atookpi nɛ! Kafɔɔ obe wɔ lalolaa nwɔ lanyu ni di kale ntɔɔkpa ni ku olesɛ yi, lanya nlɛ diele obisuɔtɔbi wɔ lalofo ni diale.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nyɔɔfa nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Kpawoo! Nnwɔ ninkpe ni nkpa ninle obisuɔtɔbi nii; nnwɔ niekpi ni ninle ole fɔ nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:22">Kafɔɔ ɔsanko kasale labensa kanya alɛ, “Kpawoo! Nnwɔ nintookpi ni ninle fɔ ole; nnwɔ ninkpe ni nkpa ninle mi ole.” Nioso baananfi nwu di ɔka anu.<verse eid="1KI 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nnwɔ mmle kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Obisuɔtɔbi nii ninkpe nkpa nɛ, ni ole fɔ niekpi nɛ,’ nnwɔ kafɔɔ kobuɛ alɛ, ‘Kpawoo! Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ niekpi nɛ, ole mi ninkpe nkpa nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24" />Ninfɛ di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Biwakoe kapamii.” Nioso baawoko ɔka nwu kapamii. <verse eid="1KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25" />Ninfɛ aadiki kanya alɛ, “Biblasa obisɔ nwu ninkpe ni nkpa di akyuu anyɔ, biɛyɔ kakyɛ bita onwii, biɛyɔ kakyɛ nyɔɔfa bita ɔnyɔɔfa.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26" />Nioso kafutu lanyinyi ɔsanko wɔ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lawɛ ni nkpa aata obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ, ni aabuɛ aatɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Saate nii, lekoto, yɔ obifɔɔle nwu ninkpe ni nkpa fatɔɔ! Tanlo nwɔ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Kafɔɔ ɔsanko nwu nyɔɔfa labuɛ alɛ, “Kuonwii loo dilɔbawɛ obi nwu. Blasa nwɔ di akyuu anyɔ!”<verse eid="1KI 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ladiki lɛbɛ ku lɛpɔɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Biyɔ obifɔɔle nwu ninkpe ni nkpa bita ɔsanko nwu kasale. Bitanlo nwɔ; nnwɔɔ ninle obi nwu ɔya nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii bamuu lanu ni mmle di ɔka nwu ladiki ni lɛbɛ ku lɛpɔɔ yi, baayɔ dibu baata ɔka nwu, diekye baanya alɛ akpe ninumbe le niekye ni Yaa nfũ, ɔɔyɔ anka ni aka tinini.<verse eid="1KI 3:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Banɔɔfotii Ku Kanyabayilatɛ Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1" />Nioso Ɔka Solomon lale sɛka di Israel omuu suoto. <verse eid="1KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2" />Nnya mba mmle niale banɔɔfotii nɔɔ finle nɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:2" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:2">Sadok obisuɔtɔbi Asaria niale- oletatɛ;<verse eid="1KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3" />Sisa babisuɔtɔbi Elihoref ku Ahiya niale kukũ- bakpanatɛ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:3">Ahilud obisuɔtɔbi Yehosafat niale- asaa nsũtɛtɛ;<verse eid="1KI 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4" />Yehoiada obisuɔtɔbi Benaia niale- bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ-nɔɔfo;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:4">Sadok ku Abiatar niale- olebatatɛ;<verse eid="1KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5" />Natan obisuɔtɔbi Asaria niale- kale bɛɛsɛ ni kukudi, kukudi kanya banɔɔfotii;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:5">Natan obisuɔtɔbi Sabud niale- oletatɛ ku otii wɔ ninka ni ɔka;<verse eid="1KI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6" />Ahisar- niayila di lɛkayo kanya;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:6">Abda obisuɔtɔbi Adoniram- niayila di osie sɛkpɛ ɔbla kanya.<verse eid="1KI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7" />Solomon kafɔɔ lawɛ kale bɛɛsɛ ni kukudi, kukudi kanyabayilatɛ lefosi-banyɔ di Israel omuu suoto, mma ninkyɛnko ɔka ku ɔka leyo batii alesaa nɛ. Obiala lɛma nkyɛnko alesaa nfa kɔwɛntɛ kunwii di lɛlɛɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8" />Nnya ayooto lɛma ninle n-ya mmle nɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 4:8" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 4:8">Ben-Hur- lawɛ di Efraim lekpenkpe kale;<verse eid="1KI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9" />Ben-Deker- lawɛ di Makas, Saalbim, Bet Semes ku Elon Bet-hanan;<verse eid="1KI 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10" />Ben-Hesed- lawɛ di Arubot (Soko ku Hefer nsɔ mmuu lale nwɔ nle);<verse eid="1KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11" />Ben-Abinadab- lawɛ di Nafot Dor (Solomon obisankobi Tafat aayɔ);<verse eid="1KI 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12" />Ahilud obisuɔtɔbi Baana- lawɛ di Taanak ku Megido, ku Bet San ntɛɛ nwu omuu niɛtɛtɛɛ ni Saretan di Yesreel nkpaalɔ, diayɔ ni di Bet San diasifi ni Abel Mehola diataalɛ diasifi ni Yokmeam;<verse eid="1KI 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13" />Ben-Geber- lawɛ di Ramot Gilead (nkpayotũ be niawɛ ni di Gilead lale Manasse obisuɔtɔbi Yair nle, diɛkyakaa ni di Argob kale dikudi di Basan ku ekpoo kplɛ afosi-akuɔ be baatofo seyoyiɛ baakyisa ni baakpee ni abɔɔsaa sewoso n-yoko);<verse eid="1KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14" />Iddo obisuɔtɔbi Ahinadab- lawɛ di Mahanaim;<verse eid="1KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15" />Ahimaas- lawɛ di Naftali (aayɔ ni Solomon obisankobi Basemat);<verse eid="1KI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16" />Husai obisuɔtɔbi Baana- lawɛ di Aser ku Alot;<verse eid="1KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17" />Parua obisuɔtɔbi Yehosafat- lawɛ di Isakar;<verse eid="1KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18" />Ela obisuɔtɔbi Simei- lawɛ di Benyamin;<verse eid="1KI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19" />Uri obisuɔtɔbi Geber- lawɛ di Gilead (kale ka niale ni Amori batii ɔka Sihon ku Basan kale ɔka Og kale). Lete nɔɔ niale kale nwu bɛɛsɛ ni dikudi, dikudi kanyayilatɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lɛlɛ Di Sɛka Ole Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20" />Yuda ku Israel batii lapɔ fɛ lekpo ɔtɛnsĩa; baale baanyi, baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21" />Nioso Solomon lale sɛka di sɛka nlekɔ nwu mmuu, diayɔ ni di Eufrate Okle dialaase di Filisti batii kasɔ, dialaadu bia Egipte kasɔ kɔmɛ. Nnle be mmle lawako Solomon kɔsɔsĩ, ni baasiɛ nwɔ kaalɔ di nkpa nɔɔ mmuu osiɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22" />Dii ninwii alesaa ya manta ni Solomon niale nnaafũ muɛmuɛ bakankyi alafa atiɛ ku nnaafũ kakyakakya bakankyi kɔlafa afosi-anɔɔ, <verse eid="1KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23" />banankyue sele bɛɛta alesaa beele basi ni lɛla lefosi, banankyue afosi-anyɔ beekyeko ni sɛfa kaweekɔ ku bafoso ku batie kɔlafa, diɛkyakaa nii, nfɛ, nkpini, bakuɔ ku bakɔɔkɔ ba ninsi ni lɛla. <verse eid="1KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24" />Diekye aale sɛka di sɛka nlekɔ mmuu di Eufrate Okle kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ lɛkyɛ, diayɔ ni di Tifsa diasifi ni Gasa, aawɛ atoko ɔkyɛ ole kafɔɔ ku nnle be niamana nwɔ diakyi nii. <verse eid="1KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25" />Di Solomon nkpa obe kamɛ yi, Yuda ku Israel, diayɔ ni di Dan dialaase ni di Beerseba, baasiɛ di otu ote kamɛ, otii biala lasiɛ di nta awosobi ku abue awoso nɔɔ kalɔ.<verse eid="1KI 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26" />Solomon lawɛ kɔba aakpee aakyisa ni bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni nkpe nna ku bapɔnkɔ lefosi nkpe nnyɔ.<verse eid="1KI 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27" />Kale bɛɛsɛ ni kukudi, kukudi kanya bayilatɛ banɔɔfo biala, nnyu alɛ nse kɔwɛntɛ nɔɔ lewo, anwako Ɔka Solomon alesaa ku mba bamuu ninkonko ni di opunu nɔɔ suoto. Mannyu alɛ balaamiɛ lɛsalɛsaa banɔ. <verse eid="1KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28" />Manwako kafɔɔ akpaa ku babɔkɛɛ alesaa ya bɛɛtɔkɔ ma alɛ bawako ni mamatɛ di katɛkɔ ninya, man-yɔ manta bapɔnkɔ ba ninanfi ni bakeke ku bapɔnkɔ bule.<verse eid="1KI 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Ninumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29" />Yaa lata Solomon ninumbe ku lɛsaatofo kplɛ, ku lɛsɔnu le niapɔ ni manamafuo ni ɔka fɛ lekpo ɔtɛnsĩa. <verse eid="1KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30" />Solomon ninumbe lataka katoo dialenke batii ba niawɛ ni di Kufĩ Kantunkɔ, diataka katoo dialenke kafɔɔ Egipte ninumbe nimuu. <verse eid="1KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31" />Aabe anu aalenkee osuɔtɔ biala, kuɛ Etan, Esra otii nwu- aabe anu aalenkee Heman, Kalkol ku Darda, Mahol babisuɔtɔbi nwu. Leyooto nɔɔ kafɔɔ lakpɛ dialaadu nnle mmuu niamana nwɔ diakyi nii. <verse eid="1KI 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32" />Aapɛ akpa nkpe-ntiɛ, sinu nɔɔ kafɔɔ lawo kakpe ku ɛnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33" />Aakakatɛ di awoso ku sɛfa suoto, diayɔ ni di Lebanon sida awoso kplɛ diɛlaase ni di ɔfa biibii wɔ ninkɔntɔ ni di oyoyiɛ suoto. Aakakatɛ kafɔɔ di babɔkɛɛ ku bakansiɛ suoto, asaa ya ninkpɔkɔ ni kaasɔ ku kɔkpaku suoto. <verse eid="1KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34" />Nnle mmuu batii nwa mamanu Solomon ninumbe sɛlaa, di kayi ka baka bamuu ba nintoonu nwɔ ni ninumbe niakyesee ma nii.<verse eid="1KI 4:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Suoto Ololaa Ɔta Olekatakɔ Otofo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1" />Obe wɔ di Tiro ɔka Hiram lanu alɛ batɔɔpɛ ni Solomon ɔfɔɔ alɛ ale ni ote Dawid atesaa fɛ ɔka yi, ni aakpee batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ baakyɛ Solomon nfũ nɛ. Diekye obe lele aale siɛwo nwaa aata Dawid. <verse eid="1KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lakplesa kanya ka mmle aata Hiram alɛ:<verse eid="1KI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3" />“Faye falɛ, ta nkpɛ be niamana teemi Dawid diakyi ni oso, atafuo olekatakɔ otofo ɔta SAATE, Yaa nɔɔ nwu Leyooto diɛlaase di obe wɔ di SAATE nwu layɔ balo nɔɔ aakpee ni di nkpaa nɔɔ kalɔ. <verse eid="1KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4" />Kafɔɔ nunua SAATE, Yaa nii nwu ntɔɔtɛɛ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di nnle be niɛmana mi diekyi nii, nioso balo ee ɔlaa kpile kuonwii nsinnaa. <verse eid="1KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5" />Nioso ntɔɔtɛ nlɛ, kotofo olekatakɔ nta SAATE, Yaa nii nwu Leyooto, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni teemi Dawid, di obe wɔ aabuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ wɔ kamayɔ nsiɛsa ni di lɛkakpomii nwu suoto di kanya lɛfɔ nimatofo olekatakɔ nwu anta Leyooto nii.’<verse eid="1KI 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6" />“Nioso diki kanya alɛ baabudi Sida awoso di Lebanon mantɛɛ. Bakpɛmblatɛ nii kamabla ɔkpɛ ku balefɔ, kamata bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ koto di kɔya lele feetika ntafɔ. Diekye faye falɛ bunaa batii ba niɛtɛ baye ni awoso obudi nwaa fɛ Sidon batii.<verse eid="1KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7" />Obe wɔ di Hiram lanu ni Solomon kanya ka mmle yi, suoto latɛ siayɔɔ nwɔ ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Baatansa SAATE nwu miɛ dii le mmle, diekye atɔɔta Dawid obisuɔtɔbi numbentɛ nwu alɛ aale sɛka di kale kplɛ ka mmle suoto.”<verse eid="1KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8" />Nioso Hiram lata Solomon kanya alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 5:8">“Lefũ kanya ka feekyesee mi nii, kamata fɔ kafɔɔ asaa ya amuu foomiɛ ni di Sedar ku sidum awoso nwu suoto. <verse eid="1KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9" />Bakpɛmblatɛ nii kamananfi sĩ mansooko mankyeko Lebanon manwako lekpo nwu, ami kafɔɔ kamanii sĩ, nta sinfe di lekpo nwu suoto sinwa lɛba le feetuo nii. Nfa kamafukuti sĩ fanwa famayɔ fansifiko nɛ. Lɛsaa le fababla fantɛɛ ni ninle alɛ, fabatɛɛ alesaa nta batii ba di lɛkayo nii kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10" />Osuku wɔ mmle suoto di Hiram lafe aata Solomon Sedar ku sidum sewoso se simuu aakaalɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11" />Ninfɛ di Solomon kafɔɔ lata Hiram akpaa bakankyi nkpe kɔlafa fɛ alesaa di lɛkayo nɔɔ nɛ. Diɛkyakaa nii, aatɔɔ nnɔnyi biene baadiki ni di nnɔnyi awosobi nnɔnyi kamɛ bakalon nkpe kɔlafa-lefosi nɛ. Solomon lakple aatɔɔbla nle mmle aatɔɔta Hiram lɛlɛɛ biala. <verse eid="1KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12" />SAATE nwu lata Solomon ninumbe fɛ mmle aabuɛ aatɛ aatɔɔ nii. Atoko ɔkyɛ ole onwii ɔbla lawɛ di Hiram ku Solomon ntɛɛ, ni di akyuu lɛma anyɔ nwu lanii kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13" />Ɔka Solomon ladiki bakpɛmblatɛ di Israel omuu- baabla batii nkpe afosi-atiɛ. <verse eid="1KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14" />Ninfɛ aayɔ ma aakyesee Lebanon nɛ. Aasɛ ma di akyuu atiɛ, kɔwɛntɛ kunwii nkpe lefosi nwɛ di Lebanon, mankple manwa leyo awɛntɛ anyɔ. Adoniram niayila di bakpɛmblatɛ nwu kanya. <verse eid="1KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15" />Solomon lawɛ afuɔ babiɛtɛ nkpe afosi-anɛ batukatɛ kafɔɔ nkpe afosi-akuɛnsĩ di akpenkpe nwu suoto, <verse eid="1KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16" />diɛkyakaa nii, aawɛ batii nkpe ntiɛ-alafa-atiɛ niatoonyu ni ɔkpɛ nwu, mantuo ma ni kafɔɔ lɛsaa le baabla ni. <verse eid="1KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17" />Di ɔka kufiofa kanya yi, baadiki afuɔ biene kplɛ di afuɔ kabiɛkɔ nwu, baasiɛsiɛsa nya baata olekatakɔ nwu nkpo lɛsɔse. <verse eid="1KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18" />Solomon bayotofotɛ ku Hiram bayotofotɛ ku Gebal batii labɛbɛɛ sewoso ku afuɔ nwu, baaloolaa nya baata olekatakɔ nwu otofo.<verse eid="1KI 5:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Latofo Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1" />Di alɛɛ alafa-ana-afosi-anɛ sɛmaa di Israel batii ladie ni di Egipte, di Solomon lɛlɛɛ naafa di sɛka ole kamɛ di Israel batii suoto yi, di Siw kɔwɛntɛ kamɛ, ninle ni kɔwɛntɛ nyɔɔfa di Israel batii awɛntɛ kanya yi, ni aakyekasɔ aatootofo SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2" />Olekatakɔ ka di Ɔka Solomon latofo aata ni SAATE nwu lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-anaasĩ, lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-ana-nnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3" />Fiɛ bababuo ni olekatakɔ nwu kamu kamɛ, sitũ nɔɔ lɛkpata lɛkaana labla nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, diɛblɛfɛ diɛkyɛkyɛ ku olekatakɔ nwu sitũ. <verse eid="1KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4" />Akpee basɛfle maamaa di olekatakɔ nwu, basɛfle nwu lamaamaa di kayi lɛkyɛ baalenke kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5" />Di leyo nwu nkpo kakyɛ ka ku kakyɛ ka ku leyo nwu disi seyoyiɛ yi, aatofo ayo aakyisa sĩ, di koyoee lasisiɛ ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6" />Ayo nwu labla sitika sitiɛ. Kasɔ leyo nwu lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, ntɛɛ lele labla nkpaa nnaasĩ, ni di osi lele kafɔɔ lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa lefosi ku dikuu nɛ. Olekatakɔ nwu osi seyoyiɛ labiibii sialenkee ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ, nkpo kafɔɔ di ntɛɛntɛɛ seyoyiɛ labiibii sialenkee kalɔ ditika kasale nɛ. Nle oso baabla ni nkpo ninle alɛ ayo nwu kafuo oyila di kalɔ seyoyiɛ suoto, mmle dinamafĩ alɛ baayɔ sewoso mansũ sĩ nii.<verse eid="1KI 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7" />Di obe wɔ baatootofo ni olekatakɔ nwu yi, afuɔ ya baawola baasiɛsiɛsa ni di afuɔ kabiɛkɔ nwu baablako ɔkpɛ, nkpo oso batanu ɔmankyĩ ee kafɛ ee lɛbɔɔsaa lɛkpɛmblasaa bamba kuninwii sɛlɔ di olekatakɔ nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ di obe wɔ baatootofo ni nii.<verse eid="1KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8" />Kayokontũ ka manfe mambuo ni kalɔ leyo nwu lawɛ di olekatakɔ nwu kala kasɔ lɛkyɛ; nkatakɔ lawɛ diasifi ntɛɛ lele kamɛ, diayɔ ninfa kafɔɔ diasifi ditika tiɛfa kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9" />Nioso Solomon latofo olekatakɔ nwu aaloo, ninfɛ aaba ni ku sewoso ku sedar selenle nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10" />Ninfɛ aatofo ayo aatika baawo aakyisa olekatakɔ nwu nɛ. Ayo nwu dibiala lɛtaka lawo nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ. Baatofo nya baakaasa di olekatakɔ nwu ku sedar sewoso.<verse eid="1KI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Solomon alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12" />“Di olekatakɔ ka mmle footofo nii, nse feetikanko sɛsaabla nii, fɛɛkyɛ di sisuku nii suoto, fɛɛbla kafɔɔ di afiofa nii amuu kanya yi, ni ntam be laka lata ni teefɔ Dawid yi, kamabla mi nfenko di suoto lɛfɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13" />Ni kamasiɛ di Israel batii kamɛ, namadiɛ kafɔɔ batii nii Israel ntɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14" />Nioso Solomon laloo olekatakɔ nwu otofo.<verse eid="1KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lalolaa Olekatakɔ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15" />Ninfɛ di Solomon layɔ sedar ntaaboo aapɛ aakaasa di kamɛ seyoyiɛ nwu, aapɛ mi aakyeko olekatakɔ nwu kayesɔ aalaase di osi selenle suoto. Ni aatĩtĩi olekatakɔ nwu kayesɔ kafɔɔ ku odum ntaaboo nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16" />Di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ di sɛmaa lɛkyɛ yi, aatofo kamɛ leyo le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Kakleklekɔ kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ. Lɛkaana nini labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ. Ninfɛ aayɔ sedar ntaaboo aakaasa di leyo nwu seyoyiɛ diayɔ ni di kayesɔ dialaadu ni osi selenle nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17" />Lɛkpata nwu di leyo le mmle anu lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-akuɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18" />Di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, sedar ntaaboo baawola baadiki kukuiikuii ku atoto ya nikofukuti nii baatika. Lɛsaa biala ninfa latĩi ku sedar ntaaboo; alɛ flaanya difuɔ kuninwii di seyoyiɛ nwu.<verse eid="1KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19" />Aalolaa kamɛ kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ alɛ aayɔ SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa nwu anse ninfa. <verse eid="1KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20" />Kamɛ, kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu lɛkaana labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-atiɛ. Aayɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa aakakaasa ni kaamɛ, ni aayɔ sedar ntaaboo kafɔɔ aakakaasa di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21" />Solomon layɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa aatĩi olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, ninfɛ aakpee koto sɛɛle anyɛnɛ aabudi kamɛ kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu anu, n-ya aayɔ koto sɛɛle aatĩi ni nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22" />Nioso aatĩi kamɛ nwu kamuu ku koto sɛɛle. Aayɔ kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle aatĩi oleɔta akyikye nwu niayila ni di kamɛ kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu.<verse eid="1KI 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23" />Di kamɛ kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu yi, aayɔ nnɔnyi owoso aawola bakerubim banyɔ, onwii lɛtaka lawo nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24" />Kerub kasale kofoko kunwii lɛkaana lawo nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, kɔnyɔɔfa kafɔɔ lɛkaana lawo nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ. Nkpo oso afoko nwu anyɔ, diadie ni di disi ninwii dialaase ni di disi nyɔɔfa labla nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25" />Kerub nyɔɔfa nwu kafɔɔ lɛtaka lawo nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ, bakerubim nwu banyɔ ladie bawo di nimuɔ ku letembi kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26" />Kerub biala lɛtaka lawo nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27" />Ninfɛ aayɔ bakerubim nwu nkpo aase di kamɛ kaamɛ leyo nwu di olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ, ni baablɛfɛsa afoko lɛma nɛ. Kerub onwii kofoko lasũ di oyoyiɛ onwii, di obe wɔ di ɔnyɔɔfa kofoko kafɔɔ lasũ ni di oyoyiɛ bamba suoto. Ninfɛ di afoko lɛma nwu lasũ baawo di leyo nwu nkpo ntɛɛntɛɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28" />Ninfɛ aayɔ koto sɛɛle aakakaasa di bakerubim nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29" />Di seyoyiɛ simuu se niamana siakyi ni olekatakɔ nwu yi, di kayi ku kamɛ koyoe suoto yi, aawola kerubim awɔsɔ ku atoto ya nikofukuti ni aatika. <verse eid="1KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30" />Aatĩi kafɔɔ olekatakɔ nwu kayi ku kamɛ koyoe n-yosɔ ku koto sɛɛle. <verse eid="1KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31" />Di kamɛ kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu kayoko yi, aayɔ nnɔnyi sewoso aabla akoloo, osi lɛkyɛ labla nkyakɔ nnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32" />Ninfɛ aawola kerubim, awɔsɔ ku atoto ya ninkofukuti ni aatika di nnɔnyi sewoso n-yoko nwu nnyɔ suoto, ni aayɔ koto sɛɛle aakakaasa di kerubim nwu ku awɔsɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33" />Nkpo kanya kafɔɔ aayɔ nnɔnyi sewoso aabla nkyakɔ nna kayoko aata lɛkpata kplɛ nwu kabuokɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34" />Aabla kafɔɔ odum akloo anyɔ, kabiala akloo anyɔ nka baawo, manfuo ni ofee otika baawo. <verse eid="1KI 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35" />Aawola bakerubim, awɔsɔ ku atoto ya niefukuti ni aatika nya di suoto, aayɔ koto sɛɛle bɛɛbɛntɛ ni kyɛkyɛ aakakaasa nya di suoto aatĩi awolansaa nwu.<verse eid="1KI 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36" />Ninfɛ aatofo kamɛ nwu kaflɔnkɔ kɔba nɛ. Aayɔ afuɔ bɛɛkyɛkyɛsa ni aatɛ asɔse atiɛ, ni aayɔ sedar sewoso aase nya di suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37" />Baase SAATE nwu olekatakɔ lɛsɔse di lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ di Siw kɔwɛntɛ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ ninwii kamɛ di Bul kɔwɛntɛ kamɛ, dile ni kɔwɛntɛ nɛnle di Israel batii awɛntɛ kanya, baaloo olekatakɔ nwu niimu otofo, di mmle okle baatɛ alɛ dite ni kanya. Aayɔ alɛɛ akuɛnsĩ aatofo ni.<verse eid="1KI 6:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Latofo Lɛkayo Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1" />Solomon latofo lɛkayo nɔɔ, lefosi alɛɛ atiɛ diafũ fiɛ aaloo otofo. <verse eid="1KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2" />Aatofo leyo nwu baatɔɔlɛɛ ni alɛ Lebanon Lepoo Lɛkayo, lɛkaana labla nkpaa kɔlafa-afosi-anɔɔ, lɛblɛfɛ labla nkpaa afosi-akuɛnsĩ-nnɔɔ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-ana-nnɔɔ. Aase sedar sewoso akpaka ele ɛna di sedar sewoso bɛɛkyɛkyɛsa ni lasana nya ni di suoto. <verse eid="1KI 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3" />Baaba leyo nwu ku seda di selenle se baasana ni di akpaka nwu osi, diabla selenle afosi-ana-ɛnɔɔ, lefosi-ɛnɔɔ di ole onwii suoto. <verse eid="1KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4" />Di leyo nwu seyoyiɛ kakyɛka ku kayɛka, baakpee basɛfle takale batiɛ, batiɛ lakyɔɔ bawo anu. <verse eid="1KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5" />Nyokontũ nwu mmuu sɛlɔɔkɔ sewoso lakaana sialenkee osi sele; siawɛ siitũ, di kakyɛ biala sele lɛbla ni etiɛ, etiɛ, siakyɔɔ ni bawo anu.<verse eid="1KI 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6" />Aatofo lɛkpata bamba di lɛkaana nini labla ni nkpaa afosi-akuɛnsi-nnɔɔ, lɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ labla nkpaa afosi-ana-nnɔɔ. Di leyo nwu anu, aabla kasiɛkɔ, aase akpaka, ni aaba ni aasakasa nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7" />Aatofo kafɔɔ lɛkakpomii lɛkpata, baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Lɛkanko Lɛkpata, lɛba le abakanko ni batii, ni aatĩi seyoyiɛ nwu ku sedar ntaaboo, diayɔ ni kayesɔ dialaase ni di osi nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8" />Di lɛkayo nwu, nfũ di Solomon kasiɛ nii, baatofo ni di sɛmaa fɛ nni nkpo okle. Solomon kafɔɔ latofo lɛkayo fɛle lɛkpata nwu okle aata Farao obisankobi wɔ aayɔ nii.<verse eid="1KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9" />Ayo ya mmle nkpo amuu, diayɔ ni kaayi dialaase ni di kaflɔnkɔ kplɛ nwu, diayɔ kafɔɔ di ayo nwu lɛsɔse dialaadu ni sewoso ntikakɔ yi, afuɔ ya niafũ ni kɔya baawola ni di letembi okle onwii kanya, baayɔ afuɔ lewolasaa baakyɛkyɛsa ni kayi ku kamɛ, baayɔ baatofo. <verse eid="1KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10" />Baase asɔse nwu ku afuɔ kplɛ biene nwaa, awo kanɛ lawo nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ, awo kafɔɔ kanɛ lawo nkpaa lefosi-nnyɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11" />Afuɔ ya niafũ ni kɔya baabudi kanya kanwii ku sedar sewoso latika di osi. <verse eid="1KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12" />Baayɔ afuɔ ya baakyɛkyɛsa ni baatofo seyoyiɛ sitika sitiɛ baakyisa kaflɔnkɔ kplɛ nwu ku sedar sewoso baasiɛsiɛsa ni ditika ninwii, fɛ mmle diate ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ kaamɛ kaflɔnkɔ nwu anu.<verse eid="1KI 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Kamɛ Asaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13" />Ɔka Solomon lakpee batii baakyɛ Tiro baalaakpaa Hiram baawako, <verse eid="1KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14" />nnwɔ ɔya niale ni kpisɔfɔ, aakye ni Naftali kɔna kamɛ, di ote lale ni Tiro otii, aale ni abɔɔsaa kpɛmblatɛ. Hiram lale otii wɔ niabe ni anu, aatɛ aatofo ni mmle man-yɔ abɔɔsaa mamblako ni asaa ate ate kpinwu. Ni aawa Ɔka Solomon nfũ aababla sɛkpɛ se simuu baatɔɔ ni nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15" />Hiram labla abɔɔsaa akpaka anyɔ, dibiala lɛtaka lawo nkpaa afosi-anyɔ-nkuɛnsĩ, dibiala nimunumunu labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ ku dikuu, nse beekpee okũ. <verse eid="1KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16" />Aabla kafɔɔ osi atikasaa anyɔ ku aabɔɔsaa aatika di abɔɔsaa akpaka nwu anyɔ osi. Osi atikasaa nwu anyɔ, dibiala lɛtaka labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17" />Aaloso abɔɔsaa anyɛnɛ aasakasa di osi atikasaa nwu suoto di abɔɔsaa akpaka nwu suoto, aakpee anyɛnɛ akuɛnsĩ, di osi atikasaa nwu dibiala suoto. <verse eid="1KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18" />Aabla awosobi ya ninte ni fɛ goowa ele ɛnyɔ aakpee lɛkpankyila di osi atikasaa nwu suoto di abɔɔsaa akpaka nwu osi aaloolaa ni. Aabla nkpo okle kafɔɔ di osi ditikasaa biala suoto. <verse eid="1KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19" />Osi atikasaa di akpaka ya niayila ni di lɛkpata nwu kamɛ yi, aabla nya fɛ atoto letembi, lɛtaka lɛnya lawo nkpaa nkuɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20" />Di akpaka nwu anyɔ osi atikasaa suoto yi, nfũ niadie ni di kamunumunukɔ baakpee ni anyɛnɛ nwu yi, awosobi ya ninte ni fɛ goowa alafa-anyɔ lakpee ɛkaa diakyi nimuu. <verse eid="1KI 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21" />Hiram layɔ akpaka nwu aase di olekatakɔ nwu kabuokɔ anu. Lɛkpaka le niayila ni di kala kasɔ lɛkyɛ, aatika ni leyooto alɛ Yakin,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yakin lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, Yaa lese ni kpinkpĩ</char></note> nle kafɔɔ niayila ni di katoo kasɔ lɛkyɛ, aatika ni leyooto alɛ Boas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Boas lɛsɔdiki ninle alɛ, Yaa osie</char></note> <verse eid="1KI 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22" />Baabla atoto letembi baatika di akpaka nwu osi. Nkpo oso akpaka nwu ɔkpɛ laloo.<verse eid="1KI 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abɔɔsaa Bɛɛsi Wɔ Ninte Ni Fɛ Lekpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23" />Ninfɛ di Hiram layɔ lɛbɔɔsaa aabla bɛɛsi munumunu fɛle Lekpo, atokosi nimunumunu labla nkpaa lefosi-nnɔɔ, lekyofo labla nkpaa nkuɛnsĩ-anɛɛkpa-akuɔ, nse bɛɛklapoosa ni beekyi kafɔɔ, dibabla nkpaa afosi-ana-nnɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24" />Di bɛɛsi nwu atokosi kalɔ yi, baabla kukuiikuii baakyisa- di lefosi biala obo kɔkpaa kunwii late nii. Baabla kukuiikuii nwu ɛɛkaa ɛnyɔ diakaa di bɛɛsi nwu suoto.<verse eid="1KI 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25" />Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu latika di banankyue-suɔtɔ lefosi-banyɔ suoto, batiɛ lakyɔɔ anu katoo kasɔ, batiɛ lakyɔɔ anu kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, batiɛ lakyɔɔ anu kala kasɔ, batiɛ kafɔɔ lakyɔɔ anu kufĩ katunkɔ. Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu latika ma di suoto, akyeke lɛma kafɔɔ lawɛ kaamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26" />Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu opĩ lawo anɛɛkpa atiɛ, atokosi nɔɔ kafɔɔ late fɛle opũ ku atoto ya niefukuti nii. Diaklee ntu bakpoko nkpe lefosi-onwii-alafa anɔɔ.<verse eid="1KI 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiram Labla Bakeke Ba Mananfi Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27" />Hiram kafɔɔ labla abɔɔsaa sɛɛle atikasaa ya mankyisa ni lefosi, obiala lɛkaana labla nkpaa nkuɔ, lɛblɛfɛ nkpaa nkuɔ, lɛtaka kafɔɔ labla nkpaa nna ku dikuu. <verse eid="1KI 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28" />Nnya mmle baabla ni bakeke nwu: Baakpee asaa blɛfɛɛ di sɛlɔɔkɔ baakpee sewoso kaamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29" />Di asaa blɛfɛɛ nwu nkpo suoto yi, baawola nya baadiki bakyata, banankyue-suɔtɔ ku kerubim baatika di suoto. Di bakyata nwu ku banankyue nwu osi ku kalɔ yi, baawola atoto ɔkaa baadiki baatika. <verse eid="1KI 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30" />Keke biala lawɛ abɔɔsaa nkpaa nna ku abɔɔsaa kplɛ anyɔ ninkle ni nkpaa nwu nna. Dibiala lawɛ lɛkpaayo latika ni di suoto di aba ana lamufũ diaklee nii. Baabla atoto ɔkaa baatika di dibiala suoto. <verse eid="1KI 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31" />Di keke nwu nkpo kamɛ yi, baadiki sɛfle munumunu niatuunii diadie ni kɔkpaa kuniwii ku dikuu. Katikitikɔ nwu labla kyilankyila, di kalɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ labla ni nkpaa nnyɔ ku dikuu. Di katikitikɔ nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ yi, baawola asaa baadiki baatika. Keke nwu atĩisaa asi nwu ana lakyɛkyɛ, ditate kyilankyila. <verse eid="1KI 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32" />Nkpaa nna lasiɛ di nkpaa atĩisaa nwu kalɔ, nkpaa aklesaa nwu kafɔɔ laklee di keke nwu suoto. Kɔkpaa kunwii biala nimuɔ labla lɛklapoosaa nkpaa nnyɔ ku dikuu. <verse eid="1KI 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33" />Baabla nkpaa nwu fɛle keke wɔ di pɔnkɔ nnanfi ni nkpaa; nkpaa nsiɛkɔ, nkpaa, nkpaa kɔbɔsɛɛ nkleekɔ ku nkyasakɔ, amuu abɔɔsaa baayɔ baabla.<verse eid="1KI 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34" />Keke biala lawɛ nkleekɔ nna, kakyakɔ biala kakleekɔ lawɛ, kaayila kaadie ni di keke nwu suoto. <verse eid="1KI 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35" />Di keke nwu osi yi, niniisaa kyilankyila lawɛ diawo ni anɛɛkpa anaasĩ lɛtaka. Amufũsaa nwu ku atĩisaa nwu laklee di keke nwu osi. <verse eid="1KI 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36" />Aawola bakerubim, bakyata ku awɔsɔ aadiki aatika di mmufũkɔ nwu ku atĩisaa nwu suoto, kakɔ lele di obo late, atoto lamana amuu aakyi. <verse eid="1KI 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37" />Osuku wɔ mmle suoto di Hiram lafe aabla bakeke lefosi nwu nɛ. Aabla bamuu di letembi ninwii kanya, bamuu ladie bawo di nimuɔ ku letembi kanya.<verse eid="1KI 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38" />Ninfɛ di Hiram labla abɔɔsaa babɛɛsi lefosi, di obiala nkle ni ntu bakpoko alafa-anyɔ-afosi-anyɔ, di obiala lablɛfɛ ni fɛ nkpaa nkuɔ, ni aayɔ onwii, onwii aakaasa di bakeke lefosi nwu suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39" />Ni aayɔ bakeke nwu banɔɔ aase di olekatakɔ nwu kala kasɔ lɛkyɛ, aayɔ banɔɔ kafɔɔ aase di katoo kasɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ aayɔ Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu kafɔɔ aase di kala kasɔ lɛkyɛ di olekatakɔ nwu koletanɛɛkyɛ di kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40" />Hiram kafɔɔ labla abukii, basoofi ku babɛɛsi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:40">Nkpo di Hiram laloo sɛkpɛ nwu simuu aabla aata ni Ɔka Solomon di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ nɛ:<verse eid="1KI 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41" />akpaka nwu anyɔ;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">osi atikasaa anyɔ nwu aabla aatika ni di akpaka nwu anyɔ osi;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:41">abɔɔsaa anyɛnɛ nwu anyɔ aasakasa ni di osi atikasaa nwu suoto di abɔɔsaa akpaka anyɔ nwu suoto;<verse eid="1KI 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42" />awosobi ya ninte ni fɛ goowa alafa-ana (ele ɛnyɔ nwu aakpee ni lɛkpankyila di osi atikasaa nwu suoto di abɔɔsaa lɛkpaka nwu osi aaloolaa nii);<verse eid="1KI 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43" />bakeke lefosi nwu ku babɛɛsi lefosi lɛma nwu;<verse eid="1KI 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44" />Lekpo bɛɛsi nwu ku banankyue lefosi-banyɔ nwu kaalɔ nini;<verse eid="1KI 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45" />abukii, basoofi ku babɛɛsi nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 7:45" />
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 7:45">Asaa ya mmle amuu di Hiram labla aata ni Ɔka Solomon di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ yi, abɔɔsa biene kamɛ baabla nya baakyeko. <verse eid="1KI 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46" />Ɔka nwu lata baabla nya baakyeko kɔtɛ atembi ya baabla ni kamɛ di Yordan ɔtaata di Sukot ku Saretan obo. <verse eid="1KI 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47" />Solomon ditata baaklaapoosa abɔɔsaa nwu, diekye aatɛ aapɔ; nioso batatofo abɔɔsaa nwu onutũ.<verse eid="1KI 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48" />Solomon kafɔɔ labla asaa ya niayila ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nwu kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1KI 7:48" />
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">koto sɛɛle oleɔta akyikye;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:48">koto sɛɛle opunu wɔ suoto di bloblo wɔ di SAATE nwu Anu, ntika ni;<verse eid="1KI 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49" />koto sɛɛle nwaa kandiɛ atikasaa kowesee nwu (kɔnɔɔ di oletanɛɛkyɛ, kɔnɔɔ kafɔɔ di ɔmɛntunɛɛkyɛ, di kamɛ, kaamɛ kakleklekɔ nwu sitũ);</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:49">koto sɛɛle atoto ɔkpɛ nwu ku bakandiɛ ku kɔmaasa;<verse eid="1KI 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50" />koto sɛɛle nwaa babɛɛsi, kandiɛ sikũ, abukii, nsɛfɛ ku olufui afiɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="1KI 7:50">ku koto sɛɛle amufũsaa diɛta ni akloo di kamɛ kaamɛ leyo nwu, Kakleklekɔ kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ nwu ku olekatakɔ lɛkpata nwu nimu akloo.<verse eid="1KI 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51" />Obe wɔ di ɔkpɛ wɔ omuu di Ɔka Solomon labla ni di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ laloo ni yi, ni aayɔ asaa ya amuu di ote Dawid lakleklesa ni- niale ni koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle ku akpɛnsaa, aabase di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ asaa katɛkɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 7:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Baayɔ Kanya Ninii Lɛlakaa Nwu Baawako Olekatakɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lalɛɛ Israel banɔɔfo, ana nwu amuu batunletɛ ku Israel batii ayo kamɛ kanyabayilatɛ di anu nɔɔ di Yerusalem, alɛ balaayɔ SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ Sion bawako nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2" />Nioso Israel batii bamuu labasi di Ɔka Solomon nfũ di Etanim Dii olebee kamɛ di kɔwɛntɛ kuɛsinle kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3" />Obe wɔ di Israel banɔɔfo bamuu labuo nii, olebatatɛ nwu lakɛnkɛ lɛlakaa nwu, <verse eid="1KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4" />ni baayɔ SAATE nwu lɛlakaa ku Lɛkpaayo le Mansi ni ku asaa klekle amuu di kamɛ nini baawako nɛ. Olebatatɛ ku Lewi batii niatuka nya. <verse eid="1KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5" />Ni di Ɔka Solomon ku Israel batii bamuu ba niamasi ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ labayila di lɛlakaa nwu anu, baatɔɔta ole ku bafoso ku banankyue kpinwu ba batafuo ni nsũ ɔtɛ ee baaka nii.<verse eid="1KI 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6" />Ninfɛ di olebatatɛ nwu layɔ SAATE nwu kanya ninii lɛlakaa baawako di olekatakɔ kamɛ, kakleklekɔ nwu, niale ni Kakleklekɔ kaamɛ Kakleklekɔ di kayilakɔ nini, ni baayɔ ni baase di bakerubim afoko kalɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7" />Bakerubim nwu lafukuti afoko lɛma baatĩi lɛlakaa lɛba nwu, diata lɛlakaa nwu ku sewoso se mantuka nini oyududu. <verse eid="1KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8" />Sewoso se mmle latɛ siakaana alɛ baatɔɔnya sɛnya nisĩ mankyeko Kakleklekɔ, kamɛ Kakleklekɔ sitũ. Kafɔɔ batatɔɔnya sĩ di Kakleklekɔ nwu kayi lɛkyɛ; siate ninfa dialaadu obe wɔ baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle. <verse eid="1KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9" />Lɛsalɛsaa ditasiɛ di lɛlakaa nwu kamɛ diediki afuɔ nkyɛ nnyɔ be baakpana ni afiofa lefosi ya di Mose layɔ aakpee ni kaamɛ di Horeb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Horeb, nnwɔɔ nwu kafɔɔ ninle Sinai nɛ</char></note> Kobokote osi, nfũ di SAATE nwu lanii ni kanya ku Israel batii di obe wɔ baadie ni di Egipte kasɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10" />Obe wɔ di olebatatɛ nwu ladie ni di Kakleklekɔ nwu yi, ni di alokonkyɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">alokonkyɛ ya mmle kotuo alɛ Yaa nsi di batii nɔɔ kamɛ</char></note> layii SAATE nwu olekatakɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11" />Nkpo oso olebatatɛ nwu ditasinfuo ɔkpɛ lɛma ɔbla ta alokonkyɛ nwu oso, diekye SAATE nwu lɛkpa layii olekatakɔ nɔɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12" />Ninfɛ di Solomon labuɛ alɛ, “SAATE nwu labuɛ alɛ, nnwɔɔ abasiɛ di alokonkyɛ tunutunu kamɛ; <verse eid="1KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13" />ntootofo olekatakɔ ka nikɔlɛ ni onyu lɛta fɔ, lɛba le fabasiɛ ni dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lakakatɛ Aata Batii Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14" />Di Israel batii bamuu lasi dikudi baayila ni ninfa, ɔka Solomon lamunikĩi, aata ma lɛtɔtrɔ. <verse eid="1KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15" />Ninfɛ aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 8:15">“Baatansa SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ niɛyɔ kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kumu ɛɛbla ni ntam be aaka ni ku kanya nɔɔ kamu aata ni teemi Dawid. Diekye aabuɛ alɛ, <verse eid="1KI 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16" />‘Diayɔ ni di dii le lakpaa ni batii nii Israel ladieko ni di Egipte kasɔ, nindiki okpoo kplɛ kuonwii di Israel kɔna kukunwii kamɛ nlɛ baatofo olekatakɔ alɛ Leyooto nii kate ninfa. Kafɔɔ lediki Dawid nlɛ ale sɛka di batii nii Israel suoto.’<verse eid="1KI 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17" />“Diasiɛ di teemi Dawid otu kamɛ alɛ ootofo olekatakɔ anta SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu Leyooto. <verse eid="1KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ teemi Dawid alɛ, ‘Ta diakye ni di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ falɛ footofo olekatakɔ fanta ni Leyooto nii yi, feelolaa fɛɛbla alɛ fɛɛwɛ nle mmle di otu lɛfɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19" />Kafɔɔ, diele afɔ ninle otii wɔ nimatofo ni olekatakɔ nwu, kafɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ, nnwɔ ninle fɔ ni suoto sina ku ntɔ mmu- nnwɔɔ ninle otii wɔ nimatofo ni olekatakɔ di Leyooto nii kamɛ nɛ.’<verse eid="1KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20" />“Nwaako, SAATE nwu ntɔɔbla di ntam be aaka ni kanya: Nfɛ n-yɛ di teemi Dawid kanya fɛ ɔka, nioso kanunua nfɛ nsi di Israel lɛkakpomii suoto, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu laka ni ntam kanya. Ntootofo olekatakɔ nwu lɛta SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu Leyooto. <verse eid="1KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21" />Ntɔɔbla lɛba lɛta SAATE nwu lɛlakaa, ninle ni SAATE nwu kanya ninii le aanii ni ku bate loo, di obe wɔ aakpaa ma aadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lataka aayila di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye katũ, di Israel batii dikudi nimuu anu, aablɛfɛsa nnɛɛ nɔɔ aakyɔɔ osi, <verse eid="1KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23" />ni aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 8:23">“Oo SAATE, Israel Yaa, Yaa kuonwii nnaa di osi kaatoo ee kasɔ kaalɔ- afɔ wɔ nimbla ni di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ kanya ninii suoto ku bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ba niekple bakyɛ ni di osuku lɛfɔ suoto ku situ lɛma simuu. <verse eid="1KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24" />Fatɔɔbla di ntam lɛfɔ be faaka faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ teemi Dawid; ku kanya lɛfɔ faaka ntam, ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ fatɔɔta diɛwa kaanya- fɛ mmle dite ni miɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25" />“Nioso kanunua, SAATE, Israel Yaa, bla ni fata kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ teemi Dawid, di ntam be faaka faatɔɔ ni, di obe wɔ faabuɛ ni falɛ, ‘Diidii Israel lɛkakpomii dilɔbayila difukuti alɛ flɔbawɛ otii asiɛ nini di suoto di anu nii, nse babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ leloolaa beenyu di asaa ya amuu bɔɔbla ni, bɛɛkyɛ di anu nii fɛ mmle faabla nii.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26" />Nioso kanunua, Oo Israel Yaa, ta ɔlaa lɛfɔ ntam be faaka faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ teemi Dawid diwa kaanya.<verse eid="1KI 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27" />“Kafɔɔ nwaako, Yaa kamasiɛ di kasɔ ka mmle suoto? Osi, bia osi, osi katakalekɔ nwu dilabafuo fɔ oklee. Ni lɛ nfɛ di olekatakɔ ka mmle letofo ni kamafuo! <verse eid="1KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28" />Oo SAATE, Yaa nii, kafɔɔ kyɔɔ atoko di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku nyaami nɔɔ ɔnya ɔlaa suoto. Nu kaku ku ɔlaa ɔpɛ wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kɔpɛ anta ni di anu lɛfɔ miɛ dii le mmle. <verse eid="1KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29" />Ta anu lɛfɔ atika di olekatakɔ ka mmle kakũ ku kakyɛ, lɛba le mmle faabuɛ ni falɛ, ‘Leyooto nii kamate ni ninfa,’ di mmle fabanu ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ wɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nkyɔɔ ni anu di lɛba le mmle ampɛ ni. <verse eid="1KI 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30" />Nu kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ku Israel batii lɛfɔ diwi-lɛɛ nse bɛɛkyɔɔ anu lɛba le mmle bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa. Nu di osi, di kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu, nse feenu kafɔɔ, faayɔ fakyɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31" />“Nse otii lɛbla owo nɔɔ okpile, dikaatɛ alɛ ɛɛka ntam, ɛɛwa ɛɛbaka ntam nwu di oleɔta akyikye lɛfɔ suoto di olekatakɔ ka mmle yi, <verse eid="1KI 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32" />ni faanu di osi, faadiki kɔkpaa. Ka lɛka di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntɛɛ, faasĩ ɔlaa fata nnwɔ niekpi ni lɛpɔɔ, faata kafɔɔ nle ɛɛbla ni ditika di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ disi. Diki nnwɔ ninakpi ni lɛpɔɔ lɛbɛ nɔɔ fatuo, faadiki lɛbɛ nɔɔ ole kasɔ.<verse eid="1KI 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33" />“Nse balo lelenkee batii lɛfɔ Israel, ta bɛɛbla fɔ ni okpile oso, ni nse beekple bɛɛwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, bɛɛlɛɛ Leyooto lɛfɔ, bɔɔpɛ ɔlaa, manwi manlɛɛ fɔ di olekatakɔ ka mmle yi, <verse eid="1KI 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34" />ni faanu di osi, faayɔ batii lɛfɔ Israel sikpile fakyɛ ma, faakplesa ma fawako kasɔ ka faata ni bate lɛma suoto.<verse eid="1KI 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35" />“Nse osi lɛsɛɛ, di kanto dilɔɔnɔɔ ta batii lɛfɔ lɛbla ni okpile di suoto lɛfɔ oso yi, bɛɛkyɔɔ anu di lɛba le mmle bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa, bɛɛlɛɛ leyooto lɛfɔ, beediɛ sikpile lɛma nwu, ta fɛɛnanfi ma ni kootoko oso yi, <verse eid="1KI 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36" />ni faanu di osi, faayɔ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, batii lɛfɔ Israel sikpile fakyɛ ma. Faatuo ma osuku biene wɔ kanya baasiɛ ni nkpa, faata kanto kafɔɔ anɔɔ akpete di kasɔ ka faata ni batii lɛfɔ fɛ atesaa.<verse eid="1KI 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37" />“Nse kɔka ee ɔfiɛ kpile lɛwa di kasɔ nwu suoto ee alesaa lɛlalaa ee kabiene lɛkpɛ ee balososo ee atroee ee balo lɛbamana sekpoo kplɛ lele lɛma beekyi, di ɔlaa kpile lele ee ɔfiɛ owo lɛwa, <verse eid="1KI 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38" />di obe wɔ di batii lɛfɔ Israel lele lɛpɛ ɔlaa ee eetikiti lekoto- di obiala lɛma letofo letoko nnanfi nɔɔ nimu di otu nɔɔ kamɛ, ɛɛtakatɛsa nnɛɛ nɔɔ ɛɛkyɔɔ olekatakɔ ka mmle yi- <verse eid="1KI 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39" />ni faanu di osi wɔ ninle ni kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ. Faayɔ fakyɛ ma, faadiki kɔkpaa; blako otii biala ɔkpɛ di n-ya amuu ɛɛbla ni kanya, diekye faye otu nɔɔ kamɛ, (diekye lete lɛfɔ nin-ye batii bamuu situ kamɛ), <verse eid="1KI 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40" />alɛ babayɛkɛ fɔ obe lele basi di kasɔ ka faata ni bate loo.<verse eid="1KI 8:40" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41" />“Ɔfɔɔ wɔ ninanle ni Israel lɛfɔ otii, kafɔɔ eekye ni kasɔ fanfa suoto ɛɛwa ni, ta leyooto lɛfɔ oso- <verse eid="1KI 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42" />ta batii kamanu ni leyooto kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ osie ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛnanfi oso- nse ɛɛwa ɛɛbapɛ ɔlaa di olekatakɔ ka mmle, <verse eid="1KI 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43" />ni faanu di osi, dile ni kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ, faabla kafɔɔ lelele di ɔfɔɔ nwu lɛkaalɛ fatɔɔ, alɛ batii bamuu di kasɔ suoto katofo ni Leyooto lɛfɔ man-yɛkɛ fɔ, fɛ mmle di batii lɛfɔ bamu Israel kɔbla ni, mantofo ni alɛ Leyooto lɛfɔ nintika ni di leyo le mmle letofo ni suoto.<verse eid="1KI 8:43" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44" />“Nse batii lɛfɔ lɛtaka bɛɛkyɛ kakpɛ di balo lɛma suoto, di kakɔ lele feekpee ma, nse kafɔɔ bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa bɛɛta SAATE nwu di okpoo kplɛ wɔ feediki ni ku olekatakɔ ka letofo lɛta ni Leyooto lɛfɔ yi, <verse eid="1KI 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45" />ni faanu ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku lekoto otikiti lɛma nwu di osi, faabla fata ma.<verse eid="1KI 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46" />“Nse bɛɛbla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ- diekye kuonwii nnaa alɛ ambla ni okpile oso- fɛɛnya ɔblɔ feekpeeko ma, fɛɛyɔ ma feekpee di lo lɛma nnɛɛ, eemufũ ma eesifiko kasɔ nɔɔ kamu suoto, keekyo ee kɛɛtɛɛtɛɛ ni yi, <verse eid="1KI 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47" />ni nse beekyisa situ di kasɔ ka suoto beemufũ ma beesifiko nii, beediɛ sikpile lɛma, beetikiti fɔ lekoto di mba niemufũ ma ni kasɔ suoto beebuɛ alɛ, ‘Buɔbla okpile, buololaa bubla, buɔbla asaa di amumu kanya’ ”; <verse eid="1KI 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48" />ni nse beekple bɛɛwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ku situ lɛma simuu ku sɛkla lɛma di balo lɛma kasɔ ka suoto beemufũ ma beesifiko nii, bɛɛpɛ ɔlaa bɛɛkyɔɔ anu di kasɔ ka faata ni bate lɛma, bɛɛkyɔɔ anu di okpoo kplɛ wɔ feediki ni ku olekatakɔ ka letofo lɛta ni Leyooto lɛfɔ, <verse eid="1KI 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49" />ni nu di osi, dile ni kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku lekoto otikiti lɛma, faabla fata ma kafɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50" />Faayɔ fakyɛ batii lɛfɔ, mba niɛbla ni okpile di suoto lɛfɔ; yɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla wɔ bɛɛbla ni di suoto lɛfɔ fakyɛ ma, fata falɛ mba nielenkee ma ni banya ma nyaami; <verse eid="1KI 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51" />diekye mma ninle batii lɛfɔ ku atesaa lɛfɔ nɛ, mba faakpaa faadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ, faadieko ni di abɔɔsaa-nyinakĩisale kpankpa kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52" />“Ta anu lɛfɔ atika di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lekoto otikiti suoto ku batii lɛfɔ Israel lekoto otikiti suoto, obe lele beewi bɛɛlɛɛ fɔ kafɔɔ, faakyɔɔ ma atoko. <verse eid="1KI 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53" />Diekye afɔ niadiki lete lɛma faakyeko nnle mmuu kaayi kamɛ falɛ bale atesaa lɛfɔ amu, fɛ mmle faabuɛ faafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Mose suoto, di obe wɔ di afɔ, O SAATE Kplɛ, faakpaa bate loo faadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Yɛntɛle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54" />Obe wɔ di Solomon laloo ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku diwi-lɛɛ le mmle nimuu ɔta ni SAATE nwu yi, ni aataka di SAATE nwu oleɔta akyikye katũ nɛ, di lɛba le amapɛ ni akunkyi, anwii ni nnɛɛ nɔɔ ankyɔɔ ni osi. <verse eid="1KI 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55" />Ni aataka aata Israel batii bamuu lɛtɔtrɔ ku sɛlɔ siene aabuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="1KI 8:55" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56" />“Baatansa SAATE nwu, nnwɔ nitɔɔta ni batii nɔɔ Israel ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ fɛ mmle aaka ni ntam. Bia ɔlaa onwii di ntam biene nɔɔ nwu mmuu aata aafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Mose suoto diebu, kunaawa ni kaanya. <verse eid="1KI 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57" />SAATE, Yaa loo nwu asiɛko wo fɛ mmle aasiɛko ni bate loo; atandiɛ wo aatɛ ee aayee wo diidii. <verse eid="1KI 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58" />Amunikĩisa situ loo atika di suoto nɔɔ, alɛ buakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ simuu suoto, mmule afiofa nɔɔ, sɛsaabla ku ablasaa ya aata ni bate loo. <verse eid="1KI 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59" />Ta sɛlaa nii se mmle, ntɔɔpɛ ni ɔlaa di SAATE nwu anu sitɛɛtɛɛ SAATE, Yaa loo nwu, kakũ ku kakyɛ, alɛ aabla anta kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ku batii nɔɔ Israel kafɔɔ di mmle diefĩ ni di dii biala kanya, <verse eid="1KI 8:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60" />di mmle di batii bamuu di kasɔ suoto katofo ni alɛ SAATE nwu ninle ni Yaa, di kuonwii nsinnaa nii. <verse eid="1KI 8:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61" />Kafɔɔ biyɔ situ lee simuu bita SAATE, Yaa loo, alɛ buasiɛ nkpa di sɛsaabla nɔɔ kanya, minkyɔɔ ni afiofa nɔɔ atoko fɛ mmle dite ni di obe wɔ mmle kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Olekatakɔ Nwu Kayi-Odiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62" />Ninfɛ di ɔka ku Israel batii bamuu ba niawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ lata ole di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63" />Solomon lata atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta ole aata SAATE nwu: banankyue nkpe afosi-anyɔ-banyɔ, bafoso ku batie kafɔɔ labla nkpe kɔlafa-afosi-anyɔ. Nioso ɔka ku Israel batii bamuu ladiki SAATE nwu olekatakɔ kayi.<verse eid="1KI 8:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale, ɔka lakleklesa kaflɔnkɔ nwu ntɛɛntɛɛ di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ anu. Nfa kafɔɔ aata ɔfiɛ asaaɔta, alesaa asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole lɛla asaaɔta, diekye abɔɔsaa oleɔta akyikye nwu di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ anu lasii obiibii aaklee ni ofiɛ asaaɔta, alesaa asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole lɛla asaaɔta.<verse eid="1KI 8:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65" />Nioso Solomon lale dii di obe nwu kamɛ, di Israel batii bamuu kafɔɔ lawɛ ni ku nnwɔɔ- batii dikudi kplɛ ninwii lakye Lebo Hamat baawa Egipte Kaklenyii. Baale dii nwu di SAATE, Yaa loo anu ayi akuɛnsĩ, baakple baale ayi akuɛnsĩ baaakyakaa, ni di amuu labla ayi lefosi-ana nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 8:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66" />Di kaleesɛ, Solomon ladiki batii nwu osuku. Ninfɛ baawii ɔka lɛtɔtrɔ, ni baasifi ayo lɛma, ku suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ̀ di situ lɛma kamɛ di asaa biene ya amuu di SAATE nwu labla aata ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Dawid ku batii nɔɔ Israel nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 8:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lakple Aadiki Suoto Aatuo Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1" />Obe wɔ di Solomon laloo ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo otofo, aafuo ni kafɔɔ asaa ya aatɛ ni ɔbla amuu ɔbla yi, <verse eid="1KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2" />SAATE nwu lakple aadiki suoto nɔɔ aatuo nwɔ lɛnyɔɔfa fɛ mmle aadiki suoto aatuo nwɔ ni di Gibeon. <verse eid="1KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3" />Ni di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 9:3">“Ntoonu ɔlaa ɔpɛ ku lekoto otikiti lɛfɔ le fatɔɔtɛ ni di anu nii; ntookleklesa olekatakɔ ka mmle feetofo ni, fɛɛyɔ Leyooto nii feetika ni ninfa dinaa ni kaloo. Anu nii ku otu nii kamatika ninfa obe lele.<verse eid="1KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4" />“Afɔ yi, nse fɛɛkyɛ di anu nii di otu wɔ niɛkpa, kuosiɛko ni kamɛ, fɛ mmle di teefɔ Dawid labla nii, fɛɛbla di n-ya lebuɛ ni kanya, fɛɛkyɛ di sisuku nii, feele afiofa nii yi, <verse eid="1KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5" />ni kamase lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ nwu di Israel suoto dinaa ni kaloo, fɛ mmle laka ntam lata ni teefɔ Dawid, labuɛ ni nlɛ, ‘Obe lele otii kamasiɛ di Israel lɛkakpomii suoto.’ <verse eid="1KI 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6" />“Kafɔɔ nse aye ee babisuɔtɔbi lee lekyi kamaa di suoto nii, mananle afiofa nii, bakyɛ di sisuku nii, kafɔɔ beesifi bɛɛlaatɔ bayaa bamba beesumu ma yi, <verse eid="1KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7" />ni kamabudi Israel ndiki di kasɔ ka lɛta ma ni suoto, ni kamasĩ kafɔɔ olekatakɔ ka mmle lekleklesa lɛta ni Leyooto nii. Ni Israel kafɔɔ kamakple okyonsanu ku lɛmansaa di batii bamuu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8" />Nu di kanunua olekatakɔ ka mmle kobuo anu yi, dibabla batii ba bamuu nimafe ni ninfa ɔkpɛ, mamma mambuɛ alɛ, ‘Obe oso di SAATE nwu lɛbla lɛsaa le mmle okle di kasɔ ka mmle ku olekatakɔ ka mmle suoto nkpo?’  <verse eid="1KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9" />Nse batii ntoobuɛ alɛ, ‘Ta batoosĩ ni SAATE, Yaa lɛma wɔ niakpaa ni bate lɛma aadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ, bɛɛkyɛ bakle bayaa bamba bɔɔtɔ, mansumu ma- nkpo oso di SAATE nwu ntɔɔta sɛlaa kpile se mmle simuu lɛwa ma di suoto nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lanii Kanya Ku Hiram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10" />Di alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ kayɛntɛkɔ ya kamɛ di Solomon latofo ni ayo ya mmle nwu anyɔ- SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo yi- <verse eid="1KI 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11" />ninfɛ di Ɔka Solomon layɔ ekpoo afosi-anyɔ di Galilea kasɔ aata Tiro ɔka Hiram nɛ, diekye Hiram latɔɔ sedar ku odum sewoso simuu ku koto sɛɛle kumuu aatoomiɛ nii. <verse eid="1KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12" />Kafɔɔ di Hiram ladie ni di Tiro alɛ ɔɔlaanyu ni sekpoo se di Solomon latɔɔ nii yi, suoto ditayɔɔ nwɔ ku sekpoo nwu. <verse eid="1KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13" />Ni aakaalɛ Solomon alɛ, “Obiloo, sɛmɛn- kpoo ninle nse mmle fɛɛtɛɛ ni nɛ?” Ni aalɛɛ sĩ alɛ Kabul Kasɔ nɛ, leyooto le baatika sĩ diabadu dii le baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle. <verse eid="1KI 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14" />Ninfɛ di Hiram lakyɛnko ɔka Solomon koto sɛɛle ko nialenkee ni bakilo nkpe nna nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ablasaa Ya Di Solomon Lakple Aabla Aakyakaa Nii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15" />N-ya mmle ninle sɛkpɛ sienle se di Ɔka Solomon layɔ aatikika ni di batii suoto aayɔ aatofo ni SAATE nwu olekatakɔ, lɛkayo nɔɔ nimu, seyoyiɛ se niayila siasũ ni nii ku seyoyiɛ se di Yerusalem ku Hasor, Megido ku Geser nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16" />(Farao, Egipte ɔka lakpɛko Geser okpoo aafũ nwu. Aakpee nwu ɔtɔ. Aalo Kanaan batii ba niawɛ ni ninfa, ni aayɔ nwu aata obisankobi nɔɔ wɔ niale ni Solomon ɔsɔfɔ fɛ osiɛsa lɛkyɛsaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">di kale nwu ɔsaabla kanya yi, ɔsanko ote ninta osiɛsa lɛkyɛsaa anta ɔlɔ nɔɔ</char></note> nɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lase Geser okpoo dibudi nɛ.) Aatɛ Kala kasɔ Bet Horon, <verse eid="1KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18" />Baalat ku Tadmor di ɔfaafuu nwu di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto, <verse eid="1KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19" />ku asaa nɔɔ ntɛkɔ sekpoo kplɛ simuu ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ nɔɔ sekpoo- ku lɛsaa lele niakye nwɔ ni di otu alɛ ootofo ni di Yerusalem, Lebanon ku kasɔ ka kamuu suoto aatoole ni sɛka.<verse eid="1KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20" />Batii ba bamuu niabu baasiɛ ni di kasɔ nwu niale Amori batii, Heti batii, Perisi batii, Hewi batii ku Yebusi batii nɛ, (batii ba mmle ditale Israel batii), <verse eid="1KI 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21" />mma niale banantii ba niabu ni di kasɔ nwu suoto di Israel batii ditafuo ni ɔwɔɔsa nɛ- mba mmle di Solomon layɔ aabla balanle ɔkpɛ sienle nɔɔ bablatɛ, fɛ mmle dite ni bia miɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22" />Kafɔɔ Solomon ditabla Israel otii kuonwii ɔlanle; bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ, abaa banɔɔfotii nɔɔ, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ, bakpɛtɛ banɔɔfo, bakeke nɔɔ ba di babɔkɛɛ nnanfi ni kanyabayilatɛ ku bakatɛ nɔɔ baale. <verse eid="1KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23" />Baale kafɔɔ bakpɛntɛ banɔɔfotii di Solomon sɛkpɛ kanya- baabla banɔɔfotii alafa-anɔɔ-afosi-anɔɔ niatoonyu ni batii ba niatɔɔbla ni ɔkpɛ nwu.<verse eid="1KI 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24" />Di Farao obisankobi ladie ni di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu aawa ni Solomon lɛkayo le aatofo aatɔɔ nii, aatofo kafɔɔ seyoyiɛ aasunsa ni.<verse eid="1KI 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25" />Sitiɛ di lɛlɛɛ kamɛ di Solomon nta ofiɛ asaaɔta ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole asaaɔta di oleɔta akyikye ya aapɛ aata ni SAATE nwu, anfiɛ kafɔɔ olufui ku nnya di SAATE nwu anu. Nkpo oso aaloo olekatakɔ nwu sɛsaabla ɔbla.<verse eid="1KI 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26" />Ɔka Solomon kafɔɔ lawola seklo di Esion Geber wɔ nintɛɛtɛɛ ni Elat di Edom, di Lekpo Sɛɛle kotoko. <verse eid="1KI 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27" />Ni di Hiram lakpee batii nɔɔ- oklo bawantɛ ba niatofo ni Lekpo nwu kamɛ- alɛ bakyɛ kanya kanwii ku Solomon batii nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28" />Baawa oklo baakyɛ Ofir kasɔ baalaayɔ koto sɛɛle fɛ bakilo nkpe lefosi-nna baawako Ɔka Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Seba Ɔkasanko Lakyɛ Solomon Nfũ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1" />Obe wɔ di Seba Ɔkasanko lanu ni mmle di Solomon ntoofũ ni leyooto ku mmle di kasiɛ nɔɔ ku SAATE nwu leyooto nte nii yi, ni di ɔsanko nwu lawa aabasɔ nwɔ aanyu ku sɛnɔɔfolaa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2" />Ni di ɔkasanko nwu lakyɛ Yerusalem ku banɔɔfotii dikudi kpinwu- ku kapubapɔnkɔ ba niatuka ni akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa, koto sɛɛlɛ kpinwu ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya- ni di ɔsanko nwu lawa Solomon nfũ aabakakatɛko nwɔ ku sɛlaa se simuu niasiɛ nwɔ ni di disi kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3" />Solomon kafɔɔ ladiki kanya di sɛlaa se simuu aakaalɛ nii; lɛsalɛsaa ditasii osie ɔwɛ ɔta ɔka ku kamɛ ɔkpasa ɔta ɔsanko nwu. <verse eid="1KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4" />Di Seba ɔkasanko nwu lanya ni Solomon ninumbe nimuu ku lɛkayo le aatofo nii, <verse eid="1KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5" />alesaa ya di opunu nɔɔ suoto, banɔɔfotii nɔɔ nsiɛkɔ, bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ akpeele ya baakpee ni, nta banyɛɛnɛtɛ nɔɔ ku ofiɛ asaaɔta wɔ aabla aata ni SAATE nwu di olekatakɔ yi, diabla ɔkasanko nwu ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ ɔka alɛ, “Sɛlaa se lanu ni di kale nii kamu lakyeko ni asaa ya fatɔɔbla ni suoto ku ninumbe lɛfɔ nte nkpo.” <verse eid="1KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7" />Kafɔɔ ntafũ asaa nwu lanu, diediki ntɔɔwa lɛbanya ku anu nii amu. Nwaako, batatɔkɔ mi bia kakyɛ ninya; di ninumbe ku lɛsaawɛ kamɛ yi, fatɔɔwaalɛ sɛlaa se lanu ni fanfa. <verse eid="1KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8" />Nyu mmle di suoto kɔyɔɔ ni batii lɛfɔ! Nyu mmle di suoto kɔyɔɔ ni banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ ba nikonyu fɔ ni obe lele, man-nu ni kafɔɔ ninumbe lɛfɔ! <verse eid="1KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9" />Baatansa SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ, nnwɔ feebuo ni anu, ɛɛyɔ fɔ eesiɛsa ni di Israel lɛkakpomii suoto. Ta SAATE nwu lɛbɔmbɔ le ninaa ni kaloo akpe ɛɛta ni Israel oso eese fɔ ɔka, alɛ faaka lɛka tinini ku sɛsaabla tinini nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10" />Ninfɛ di ɔkasanko nwu lata ɔka koto sɛɛle onutũ fɛ bakilo nkpe-nna, akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa kpinwu ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya nɛ. Diidii kuonwii ditasinwako akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa kpinwu ya mmle okle, fɛ n-ya di Seba ɔkasanko lata ni Ɔka Solomon.<verse eid="1KI 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11" />(Ni di Hiram seklo lakyeko koto sɛɛle di Ofir baawako nɛ; baayɔ kafɔɔ sewoso se niefũ ni kɔya ku afuɔ ya niefũ ni kɔya kpinwu baawako. <verse eid="1KI 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12" />Ɔka layɔ sewoso nwu niafũ ni kɔya aabla asunsaa aata SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛkayo nwu, baabla kafɔɔ bakyitaa ku basanku baata sinu basantɛ. Nioso diidii badisinklaa ee banya sewoso se niefũ ni kɔya diayɔ ni di dii nwu kamaa.)<verse eid="1KI 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13" />Nioso ɔka Solomon lata Seba ɔkasanko nwu asaa ya amuu oomiɛ ni ee aakaalɛ nii, di n-ya aatɔɔ aakyeko ni akasaa nɔɔ kamɛ lakyakaa nii. Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu ku banɔɔfotii nɔɔ lakple baasifi kale nɔɔ kamu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Solomon Lɛsaawɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14" />Di lɛlɛɛ biala Solomon nfũ koto sɛɛle onutũ fɛ bakilo nkpe-afosi-anyɔ-banyɔ, <verse eid="1KI 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15" />di akpooto ya ninkye ni asaa-bayatɛ ku asaa basunsũtɛ ku Arab batii baka ku kasɔ nwu abaa kanyabayilatɛ diesi ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16" />Ɔka Solomon labla koto sɛɛle bɛɛbɛntɛ ni kubiafunsaa kplɛ alafa-anyɔ; kubidifunsaa biala lafũ fɛ koto sɛɛle bakilo bakuɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17" />Aabla kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle bɛɛbɛntɛ ni kubiafunsaa biibii alafa-atiɛ, di kubidifunsaa biala lafũ ni koto sɛɛle bakilo banyɔ. Ni di ɔka layɔ nya aalaatɛ di lɛba le bɔɔlɛɛ ni Lebanon Lepoo Lɛkayo kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔka labla lɛkakpomii kplɛ ku bato anyɛɛ, aayɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa aakakaasa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19" />Lɛkakpomii nwu lawɛ nkatakɔ nkuɔ, kamaa nini kafɔɔ labla munumunu di osi. Di lekpomii nwu sɛlɔɔkɔ nwu nnyɔ yi, nnɛɛ ntikakɔ lawɛ, di kyata layila ni di kabiala ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20" />Bakyata lefosi-banyɔ layila di nkatakɔ nkuɔ nwu disi le ku disi le. Badibla nninkpo okle bata sɛka kalekɔ bamba kukanwii diidii. <verse eid="1KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21" />Koto sɛɛle baayɔ baabla Ɔka Solomon sipũ simuu, leyo kamɛ awansaa amuu di Lebanon Lepoo Lɛkayo nwu kamɛ kafɔɔ lale koto sɛɛle nwaa. Batayɔ koto fututu baabla lɛsalɛsaa, diekye baanyu alɛ koto fututu diedie lɛsalɛsaa di Solomon obe kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22" />Ɔka lawɛ seklo se niatɔɔkyɛ ni lekpo osi manaaya ni asaa ku Hiram seklo. Di alɛɛ atiɛ biala kamɛ seklo nwu nkple sinwa ninwii, batuka ni koto sɛɛle, koto fututu, bato anyɛɛ, bakuo ku basɛ̀.<verse eid="1KI 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23" />Ɔka Solomon lawɛ lɛsaawɛ ku ninumbe aalenkee kasɔ ka mmle baka bule bamuu. <verse eid="1KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24" />Kayi kamuu nkyɛ ɔka Solomon ɔkyɛ manaanu ninumbe le di Yaa lakpee ni di disi nɔɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25" />Lɛlɛɛ biala otii biala niɛwa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ nwako nwɔ lɛkyɛsaa- asaa fɛ koto sɛɛle, koto fututu, akpeele, akpɛsaa, akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa, bapɔnkɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninte ni fɛ pɔnkɔ.<verse eid="1KI 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26" />Di Solomon lasiisa ni bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni ku bapɔnkɔ; aawɛ bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kakpe alafa-ana ku bapɔnkɔ nkpe lefosi-nnyɔ, mma aayɔ aatɛ di bakeke okpoo kplɛ nwu ku Yerusalem kafɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27" />Ɔka nwu lata koto fututu labawɛ di Yerusalem fɛ afuɔ, sedar kafɔɔ labapɔ fɛ kowoso ko manlɛɛ ni sikamɔ-abue awoso di akpenkpe nkpaa. <verse eid="1KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28" />Okyeko baakyeko Solomon bapɔnkɔ Egipte ku Kue kasɔ- ɔka asaa bayatɛ niaya nya baakyeko Kue kasɔ. <verse eid="1KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29" />Manaaya keke wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni onwii di Egipte fɛ koto fututu bakilo bakuɛnsĩ okle, pɔnkɔ onwii kafɔɔ fɛle bakilo banyɔ okle. Mansunsũ ma kafɔɔ manta Heti batii ku Siria batii baka bamuu.<verse eid="1KI 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Solomon Lakyi Di Yaa Kamaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1" />Ɔka Solomon kafɔɔ labɔmbɔ bafɔɔ-sanko kpinwu aakyakaa di Farao obisankobi- mma niale Moab batii, Amon batii, Edom batii, Sidon batii ku Heti batii basanko nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2" />Baakye nnle be di SAATE nwu latɔkɔ ni Israel batii alɛ, “Bitan-yɔ bawo basanko ku mma, diekye nwaako babata situ lee ntika di bayaa lɛma suoto.” Kafɔɔ Solomon lakaa ma di suoto di lɛbɔmbɔ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3" />Aawɛ basɔfɔ ba niale ni baka babisankobi alafa-akuɛnsĩ ku basɔnɔ alafa-atiɛ, ni di basɔfɔ nɔɔ latɔɔ aakyi di SAATE nwu kamaa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4" />Di Solomon lababe nii, basɔfɔ nɔɔ lamunukĩisɔɔ otu baatika di bayaa bamba suoto. Nioso atayɔ otu nɔɔ omuu aata SAATE,Yaa nɔɔ, fɛ mmle di ote Dawid otu late nii. <verse eid="1KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5" />Solomon latikanko Sidon batii Astoret afiɔ-sanko ku Milkom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Leyooto nwu kafɔɔ ninle Molek nɛ</char></note> ya niale ni Amon batii afiɔ ya niale ni diyududusaa diata ni Israel batii. <verse eid="1KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6" />Nioso Solomon labla lɛsaa kpile di SAATE nwu anu; atatikanko SAATE nwu ku otu nɔɔ omuu, fɛ mmle di ote Dawid labla nii.<verse eid="1KI 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7" />Ninfɛ di Solomon latofo katakalekɔ di Yerusalem kufĩ katunkɔ lekpenkpe aata Moab batii afiɔ Kemos ninle ni diyududusaa ku Amon batii afiɔ Milkom ninle ni diyududusaa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8" />Aabla nkpo aata bafɔɔ-sɔfɔ nɔɔ bamuu, ba niafiɛ ni olufui, baata ni kafɔɔ ole baata ni bayaa lɛma nwu.<verse eid="1KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9" />Ni di SAATE nwu lanya ɔblɔ aakpeeko Solomon nɛ, diekye otu nɔɔ lakyi kuadiɛ SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu niadiki suoto aatuo nwɔ ni sɛnyɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10" />Nu di SAATE nwu latĩi Solomon osuku alɛ atantikanko bayaa bamba yi, Solomon ditale SAATE nwu kufiofa. <verse eid="1KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11" />Nioso SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Solomon alɛ, “Ta nkpa lɛfɔ be mmle oso, fananklee ni kanya ninii nii, fale ni afiofa nii ya lata fɔ ni oso yi, nwaako, kamabɛ sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ nfũ ninnɛɛ lɛfɔ nin-yɔ nta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ onwii. <verse eid="1KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12" />Kafɔɔ, ta teefɔ Dawid oso, namabla ni di nkpa lɛfɔ obe kamɛ. Kamabɛ ka nfũ di obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ nnɛɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13" />Kafɔɔ namabɛ sɛka kalekɔ nwu kamuu nfũ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ, kafɔɔ kamatɔɔ kɔna kunwii, ta kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid ku Yerusalem wɔ lediki ni oso.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Balo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14" />Ninfɛ di SAATE nwu lata lo lataka di Solomon suoto nɛ. Nnwɔɔ niale Hadad, Edom otii nwu niakye ni Edom ɔka leyo kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15" />Obe wɔ di Dawid latɔɔkpɛko ni Edom, di Yoab wɔ niale ni bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ lakata aakyɛ alɛ ɔɔlaakookaa ni bakpi yi, ni aalo basuɔtɔ bamuu di Edom nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16" />Yoab ku Israel batii bamuu lasiɛ ninfa awɛntɛ akuɔ, dialaase di obe wɔ baawɔɔsa ni basuɔtɔ bamuu di Edom. <verse eid="1KI 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17" />Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ di Hadad nleole obisɔ, aatoso aasifi Egipte ku Edom batii banɔɔfotii ba niasumu ni ote. <verse eid="1KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18" />Baadie di Midian baasifi Paran. Ninfɛ baakpaa basuɔtɔ di Paran baasifi Farao, Egipte ɔka nfũ di Egipte nɛ. Ni aata Hadad leyo ku kasɔ, aatɔɔ kafɔɔ alesaa nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19" />Hadad latɛ aabuo Farao anu, nioso aayɔ nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ ɔsɔfɔ, Ɔkasanko Tahpenes obilɛma-sankobi, aata Hadad layɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20" />Tahpenes obilɛma-sankobi nwu lalofo obisuɔtɔbi baatika ni leyooto alɛ Genubat, di Tahpenes laklee ni di lɛkayo aatɔɔ ni nɛ. Nfa di Genubat lasiɛ ku Farao babi bamu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21" />Obe wɔ di Hadad lawɛ ni di Egipte, aanu alɛ Dawid ntookpi eesifi bate nɔɔ nfũ, ni kakpɛ kanyayilatɛ Yoab kafɔɔ ntookpi. Ninfɛ di Hadad latɔkɔ Farao alɛ, “Tɛɛ ntɔɔkyɛ, alɛ kakple nsifi kale nii kamu.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22" />Ni di Farao lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe lɛsaa fanawɛ ninfũ oso falɛ fookple fansifi kale lɛfɔ kamu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Ni di Hadad ladiki kanya alɛ, “Lɛsalɛsa, kafɔɔ tɛɛ osuku ninsifi!”<verse eid="1KI 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23" />Ninfɛ di Yaa lata lo bamba lataka di Solomon suoto nɛ. Nnwɔɔ niale Eliada obisuɔtɔbi Reson wɔ niatoso ni di saate nɔɔ Hadadeser, wɔ niale ni Soba ɔka ɔkyɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24" />Ni di Reson lasiisa bakpɛtɛ dikudi, ni aabale tunletɛ di kudu bakpeetɛ dikudi kanya, di obe wɔ di Dawid lawɔɔsa ni Soba bakpɛtɛ nɛ; kudu bakpeetɛ nwu lasifi Damasko, nfa baasiɛ di Reson latoole sɛka di Damasko nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25" />Reson lale lo aata Israel, aatoole sikpile aatɔɔkyakaa di nse di Hadad labla nii, di obe wɔ di Solomon lasiɛ ni nkpa. Nioso Reson lale sɛka di Siria, ni aatookpee Israel kubuɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Wɔ Di Yaa Labuɛ Aatɛ Aata Ni Yeroboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26" />Ninfɛ di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam kafɔɔ lataka aayila di ɔka suoto nɛ. Solomon ɔnɔɔfotii onwii aale, Efraim otii, aakye ni Sereda, ɔya niale kpisɔfɔ wɔ baatɔɔlɛɛ ni Serua nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27" />Nnya mmle kanya aataka aayila ni di ɔka suoto: Solomon lanii seyoyiɛ aakyisa, ni aase ote Dawid okpoo kplɛ seyoyiɛ sebo se niate ni lelolaa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28" />Yeroboam lale osuɔtɔ wɔ niawɛ ni kɔnɛɛ, di Solomon lanya mmle di okosopo nwu kɔbla ni sɛkpɛ nɔɔ yi, ni aayɔ nwɔ aase di sɛkpɛ sienle simuu kanyayilatɛ di Yosef leyo kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Yeroboam latoodie di Yerusalem, ni di Silo Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Ahiya lakyakako nwɔ di osuku nɛ. Aakpee akpeele fɔle. Akyuu lɛma anyɔ lete niadie di kale nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30" />Ni di Ahiya lamufũ akpeele fɔle nwu aakpee ni aabɛbɛɛ kɔkyɛkɔkyɛɛ lefosi-nnyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31" />Ninfɛ di Ahiya latɔkɔ Yeroboam alɛ, “Yɔ kɔkyɛɛ nwu lefosi fata suoto lɛfɔ, diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE , Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Nyu lo, kɔwa sɛka kalekɔ nwu ɔbɛ ofũ di Solomon nnɛɛ, nin-yɔ ana lefosi nta fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32" />Kafɔɔ, ta kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid ku Yerusalem okpoo kplɛ wɔ lediki ni di Israel ana amuu kamɛ oso yi, abawɛ kɔna kunwii. <verse eid="1KI 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33" />Kamabla nle mmle diekye batoosĩ mi, bɛɛkyɛ boosumu Sidon batii afiɔ-sanko Astoret, Moab batii afiɔ Kemos ku Amon batii afiɔ Milkom, beediɛ ɔkyɛ di sisuku nii, ee babla lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni di anu nii, ee baklee sɛsaabla nii ku afiofa nii fɛ mmle di Solomon ote Dawid labla nii.<verse eid="1KI 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34" />“ ‘Kafɔɔ namafũ sɛka kalekɔ nwu kamuu di Solomon nnɛɛ; lese nwɔ sɛka di nkpa nɔɔ ayi amuu kamɛ, ta kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid oso, nnwɔ ladiki ni ku nnwɔ niaklee ni afiofa nii ku sɛsaabla nii. <verse eid="1KI 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35" />Kamafũ sɛka kalekɔ nwu di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nnɛɛ, nin-yɔ ana lefosi nta fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36" />Kamayɔ kɔna kunwii nta obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ, di mmle di kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid kawɛ ni kandiɛ obe lele di anu nii di Yerusalem, okpoo kplɛ wɔ lediki nlɛ kɔtɛ ni Leyooto nii. <verse eid="1KI 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37" />Kafɔɔ, afɔ yi, kamayɔ fɔ, fabale sɛka kafɔɔ di asaa ya amuu di otu lɛfɔ komiɛ ni suoto; fabale ɔka di Israel suoto. <verse eid="1KI 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38" />Nse fɛɛbla di kufiofa lele lekpee fɔ, fɛɛkyɛ di sisuku nii, fɛɛbla kafɔɔ nle ninlɛ ni di anu nii, alɛ feeklee sɛsaabla ku afiofa nii, fɛ mmle di kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid labla nii yi, ni kamasiɛko fɔ. Kamata banantii lɛfɔ nle sɛka manklɛ fɛ mmle labla lata ni Dawid, ni kamayɔ kafɔɔ Israel katoo kasɔ nta fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39" />Kamawakosa Dawid banantii kasɔ, ta nle mmle oso, kafɔɔ diele dinaa ni kaloo.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40" />Ni di Solomon lamiɛ alɛ oolo Yeroboam nɛ, kafɔɔ Yeroboam latoso aasifi Egipte di ɔka Sisak ɔkyɛ. Aasiɛ ninfa dialaase di obe wɔ di Solomon lakpi nii.<verse eid="1KI 11:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41" />Solomon sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba- asaa ya amuu aabla ni ku ninumbe le aadiki aatuo ni nnya yi- bɛɛkpana nya di Solomon sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42" />Solomon lale sɛka di Israel omuu di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-ana. <verse eid="1KI 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43" />Ninfɛ di Solomon lalaatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di ote Dawid okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Rehoboam layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 11:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Katoo Kasɔ Ana Ɔtaka Oyila Di Rehoboam Suoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1" />Ninfɛ di Rehoboam lakyɛ Sekem nɛ, diekye Israel batii bamuu lafe nfa alɛ bɔɔlaase nnwɔɔ Rehoboam sɛka. <verse eid="1KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2" />Obe wɔ di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam lanu ni ɔlaa wɔ mmle, (obe nwu aakple aawɛ di Egipte, lɛba le aatoso aadie ni di Ɔka Solomon ɔkyɛ), ni aakple di Egipte aawa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3" />Nioso baakpee baalaalɛɛ Yeroboam, ni di nnwɔɔ ku Israel dikudi nimuu lakyɛ Rehoboam nfũ baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4" />“Teefɔ letukasa wo atoo nutũle, kafɔɔ nunua kɔkɔlɛ ɔkpɛ sienle nwu ku atoo nutũle nwu eetukasa wo ni, ni bubasumu fɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5" />Ni di Rehoboam ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bitɔɔkyɛ, di ayi atiɛ kamaa biekple biwa ɔkyɛ nii.” Nioso batii nwu lakyɛ baasifi.<verse eid="1KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Rehoboam lakaalɛ banɔɔfo ba niasumu ni ote Solomon di obe aasiɛ ni nkpa nɛ. Aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Lɛ bibaka mi, di mmle kadiki ni batii ba mmle kanya?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7" />Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Nse miɛ fabale kpɛmblatɛ fanta batii ba mmle, feesumu ma, fɛɛkakatɛ di osuku biene kanya fɛɛta ma yi, ni obe lele babale bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8" />Kafɔɔ Rehoboam lasĩ kɔkà nwu di banɔɔfo nwu laka nwɔ nii. Ni aalaakaalɛ bakosopo akyɛ wo nɔɔ ya niatoosumu nwɔ ni nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9" />Aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Be ninle ye disibu? Lɛ buɔtɔkɔ batii ba mmle niɛtɔkɔ mi ni alɛ, ‘Kɔkɔlɛ ni atoo ya di teefɔ letukasa wo ni’?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10" />Bakosopo akyɛ wo nɔɔ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Tɔkɔ batii ba mmle niɛtɔkɔ fɔ ni alɛ, ‘Teefɔ letukasa wo ni atoo nutũle, kafɔɔ ta atoo loo nwu akɔkɔlɛ ni’- tɔkɔ ma falɛ, ‘Lɛnɛɛbi nii biibii nkpe opĩ dilenke teemi ɔtɔ̀. <verse eid="1KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11" />Teemi letukasa ye atoo nutũle; ami kamata nya anwɛ bia onutũ anlenkee. Teemi lapɛ ye ku kowesee; ami kamapɛ ye ku kowesee ko ninfifiɛ ni fɛ nkpakana lɛtaa.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12" />Nioso di ayi atiɛ sɛmaa, Yeroboam ku batii nwu bamuu lakple baakyɛ Rehoboam nfũ, fɛ mmle di ɔka labuɛ ni alɛ, “Bikple biwa ni ɔkyɛ nii di ayi atiɛ sɛmaa.” <verse eid="1KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13" />Ni di ɔka lakakatɛko batii nwu ɔblɔ kanya nɛ. Aasĩ kɔkà ko di banɔɔfo nwu laka nwɔ nii, <verse eid="1KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14" />ni aatikanko bakosopo nwu kɔkà aabuɛ alɛ, “Teemi latukasa ye atoo nutũle; kafɔɔ ami kamata nya anwɛ bia onutũ anlenkee. Teemi lapɛ ye ku kowesee; kafɔɔ ami kamapɛ ye ku kowesee ko ninfifiɛ ni fɛ nkpakana lɛtaa.” <verse eid="1KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15" />Nioso ɔka nwu ditanu batii nwu ɔlaa, diekye sɛsaabla se mmle dikyi nwu lakye SAATE nwu nfũ, alɛ ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu lakakatɛ aafenko ni di Ahiya, Silo otii nwu suoto, aata ni Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam kawa ni kaanya.<verse eid="1KI 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii bamuu lanya alɛ ɔka nwu lesĩ ni ɔlaa lɛma onu yi, ni baatɔkɔ ɔka nwu alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“Kamɛnlekɔ ninkpe wo di Dawid kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Bunaa atesaa di Yese obisuɔtɔbi kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Oo Israel, bikple bisifi ayo lee!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1KI 12:16">Oo Dawid, nyu leyo lɛfɔ nimu disi!"</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1KI 12:16">Nioso Israel batii lasifi ayo lɛma. <verse eid="1KI 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17" />Kafɔɔ Israel batii ba niabu baasiɛ ni di Yuda sekpoo nwu kamɛ yi, Rehoboam lakple aatole sɛka di suoto lɛma.<verse eid="1KI 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔka Rehoboam lakpee Adoram, nnwɔ niayila ni di sɛkpɛ sienle kanya di Israel batii nfũ nɛ, kafɔɔ Israel batii bamuu lasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ baalo. Kafɔɔ ɔka Rehoboam lapɛsɛwa aabuo di keke nɔɔ wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni aatoso aasifi Yerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19" />Nioso Israel lataka baayila di Dawid leyo suoto diɛbadu dii le baakpana ni sɛlaa se mmle.<verse eid="1KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20" />Obe wɔ di Israel batii bamuu lanu alɛ Yeroboam ntookple ni di Egipte, ni baakpee baalaalɛɛ nwɔ baawako dikudi nwu, ni baase nwɔ ɔka di Israel batii bamuu suoto nɛ. Yuda kɔna lete niabu baasiɛ di Dawid leyo kamɛ sɛka kalɔ.<verse eid="1KI 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Semaia Ɔlaa Obuɛ Ɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21" />Obe wɔ di Rehoboam labuo ni Yerusalem, aasiisa Yuda leyo nimuu ku Benyamin kɔna kumuu- bakpɛtɛ nkpe kɔlafa afosi-anɛ- alɛ balaakpɛko Israel leyo, baakple bafũ sɛka kalekɔ nwu bata Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam.<verse eid="1KI 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22" />Kafɔɔ Yaa ɔlaa wɔ mmle lawa kuata Semaia, Yaa otii nwu alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23" />“Tɔkɔ Yuda ɔka, Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam, Yuda ku Benyamin leyo nimuu ku batii bule bamuu falɛ, <verse eid="1KI 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24" />‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Bitankata biakyɛ bialaakpɛko babilee-suɔtɔbi Israel batii nwu. Obiala lee atɔɔkyɛ leyo, diekye ami niɛbla nle mmle.’ ” Nioso baanu SAATE nwu ɔlaa, baakple baasifi ayo lɛma, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ nii.<verse eid="1KI 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeroboam Lakyi SAATE Nwu Kamaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25" />Ninfɛ di Yeroboam latofo oyoyiɛ aakyisa Sekem okpoo di Efraim lɛkpenkpe kale, ni aasiɛ ninfa nɛ. Aadie ninfa aalaabudi Penuel okpoo.<verse eid="1KI 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26" />Ni di Yeroboam labuɛ di disi nɔɔ kamɛ alɛ, “Loobia sɛka kalekɔ nwu nfɛ kamakple sinwa Dawid leyo. <verse eid="1KI 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27" />Nse batii ba mmle lɛkyɛ bɛɛlaata ole di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ di Yerusalem yi, ni babakple man-yɔ dibu manta saate lɛma, Yuda ɔka Rehoboam. Ni babalo mi, mankple mansifi Ɔka Rehoboam nfũ.”<verse eid="1KI 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28" />Di obe wɔ di ɔka nwu lafũ disibu aaloo nii yi, ni aayɔ koto sɛɛle aabla anankyuebi anyɔ nɛ. Ni aatɔkɔ batii nwu alɛ, “Ditoolenkee ye nnɛɛ ku Yerusalem ɔkyɛ. Oo Israel, nnya bayaa lee ba niakpaa ye baadieko ni di Egipte kasɔ.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29" />Ni aayɔ ninwii aase di Betel, aayɔ lɛnyɔɔfa kafɔɔ aase di Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30" />Ni di lɛsaa le mmle labakple okpile nɛ; batii nwu lakyɛ bia Dan baalaasumu ninwii le niawɛ ni ninfa.<verse eid="1KI 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31" />Yeroboam latofo kafɔɔ nfiofa di aba takale, ni aadiki olebatatɛ, olele aakyeko batii nwu bamuu kamɛ nɛ, nu batale Lewi batii.<verse eid="1KI 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baasĩ Betel Kasumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32" />Yeroboam kafɔɔ latɛ dii ole di kɔwɛntɛ nɛnle lefosi dii nɔɔnle, fɛle dii le okle manle ni di Yuda, ni aata ole di oleɔta akyikye suoto nɛ. Nle mmle aatɔɔbla di Betel nɛ, aatɔɔta ole aatɔɔta anankyuebi ya aabla nii. Di Betel kafɔɔ, aase olebatatɛ aata di ntakalekɔ be aabla nii. <verse eid="1KI 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33" />Di kɔwɛntɛ nɛnle, lefosi dii nɔnle suoto, kɔwɛntɛ ko di nnwɔɔ omu aadiki nii, aatɔɔta ole di oleɔta akyikye ya aapɛ ni di Betel. Nioso aatɛ dii ole aata Israel batii, ni baakata baatɔɔkyɛ oleɔta akyikye katũ baalaatɔɔta asaaɔta nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 12:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Otii Wɔ Niakye Ni Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1" />Di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya, Yaa otii onwii lakye Yuda aawa Betel, di Yeroboam layila ni di oleɔta akyikye katũ alɛ ɔɔta ni asaaɔta. <verse eid="1KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2" />Ni di osuɔtɔ nwu lafaa aakakatɛ aayila di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto aabuɛ di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya alɛ: “Afɔ oleɔta akyikye, oleɔta akyikye! Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Babalofo obisuɔtɔbi onwii manta Dawid leyo, manlɛɛ nwɔ Yosia. Di suoto lɛfɔ di SAATE nwu kamayɔ olebatatɛ ba di ntakalekɔ nwu ninta ni asaaɔta ninfũ anta ole nɛ. Manfiɛ batii akufi kafɔɔ di suoto lɛfɔ.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3" />Di dii nwu nkpo kale, Yaa otii nwu lata dituosaa ninwii alɛ: “Nle mmle ninle dituosaa nwu di SAATE nwu lebuɛ ni nɛ: Bababɛ oleɔta akyikye nwu mantɛ, manlɛ ntɔ̀ nwu di suoto ninya manwii.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4" />Di obe wɔ di Ɔka Yeroboam lanu ni Yaa otii nwu lɛkakatɛ di oleɔta akyikye ya di Betel suoto yi, ni di ɔka lananfi kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ di oleɔta akyikye nwu suoto aakyɔɔ osuɔtɔ nwu aabuɛ alɛ, “Bimufũ nwɔ!” Kafɔɔ kɔnɛɛ ko aananfi aakyɔɔ ni Yaa otii nwu lakpi, nioso ɔka nwu ditasinfuo kũ okplesa. <verse eid="1KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5" />Oleɔta akyikye nwu kafɔɔ labɛ aate, ni di ntɔ̀ nimi lanyɛɛnɛ diawii, di dituosaa le di Yaa otii nwu lata ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6" />Ninfɛ di ɔka nwu latɔkɔ Yaa otii nwu alɛ, “Tikiti SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ lekoto, faapɛ ɔlaa fatɛɛ, di kɔnɛɛ nii kukple di akpa ninkũ.” Nioso Yaa otii nwu latikiti SAATE nwu lekoto, ni di ɔka nwu kɔnɛɛ lakple di akpa ninkũ, kuate fɛ mmle kuate ni saa nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7" />Ni di ɔka nwu latɔkɔ Yaa otii nwu alɛ, “Wa buɔkyɛ leyo ninaata fɔ lɛsaa fale, kamata fɔ kafɔɔ lɛkyɛsaa.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8" />Kafɔɔ Yaa otii nwu latɔkɔ ɔka nwu alɛ, “Bia kuntɛ fɛɛtɛɛ asaa ya ninkpe fɔ ni kakyɛ yi, namatikanko fɔ, ee nle alesaa ee nnyi ntu ninfũ. <verse eid="1KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9" />Diekye SAATE nwu ɔlaa lakpee mi kufiofa alɛ: ‘Tanle alesaa ee tannyi ntu ee faakple faafe di osuku wɔ faafe faawa nii.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10" />Nioso osuku bamba aafe, atasinfe aakple di osuku wɔ aafe aawa ni Betel.<verse eid="1KI 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kofole onwii lasiɛ di Betel, ni di babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lawa baabatɔkɔ nwɔ asaa ya amuu di Yaa otii nwu labla ni ninfa dii nwu nɛ. Baatɔkɔ ote lɛma kafɔɔ sɛlaa se aatɔkɔ ni ɔka. <verse eid="1KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12" />Ni di ote lɛma lakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Ɔmɛnsuku aafe?” Ni di babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nwu latuo nwɔ osuku wɔ di Yaa otii nwu niakye ni Yuda lafe ni nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13" />Nioso aatɔkɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ, “Bilolaa bɔkɛɛ nii wɔ nintuka ni atoo bitɛɛ.” Obe wɔ baalolaa bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo baatɔɔ nii, ni aayie aasiɛ <verse eid="1KI 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14" />nwɔ di suoto, ni aati Yaa otii nwu sɛɛmaa nɛ. Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lalaanya Yaa otii nwu nsi di kowoso kplɛ kunwii kalɔ, ni aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Afɔ ninle Yaa otii wɔ niakye ni Yuda nɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Ami nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15" />Nioso ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Wa buɔkyɛ leyo faalaale alesaa.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16" />Ni di Yaa otii nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Namasinkple nkpaamaa, ntikanko fɔ, ee nle alesaa ee nnyi ntu ku afɔ di lɛba le mmle. <verse eid="1KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17" />SAATE nwu ɔlaa latɔkɔ mi alɛ: ‘Tanle alesaa ee tannyi ntu ninfa ee tankple faafe di osuku wɔ faafe faawa nii.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18" />Ninfɛ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kofole nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ami kafɔɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nle, fɛ mmle fale nii. Ni di Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ onwii lɛtɔkɔ mi di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya alɛ: “Kplesa nwɔ fawako leyo lɛfɔ ku nnwɔɔ, alɛ aabale alesaa, aanyi ntu.’ ” (Kafɔɔ ɔkyɔnkyɔ aatɔɔkyɔnkyɔ nwɔ.) <verse eid="1KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19" />Nioso Yaa otii nwu lakple aatikanko ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kofole nwu, aalaale, aanyi ntu di leyo nɔɔ.<verse eid="1KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20" />Di obe wɔ basi ni di opunu katũ, SAATE nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kofole nwu niakplesa ni Yaa otii nwu. <verse eid="1KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21" />Ni aafaa aatɔkɔ Yaa otii nwu niakye ni Yuda aawa ni alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Feesĩ SAATE nwu ɔlaa onu, faale kafɔɔ kufiofa ko di SAATE, Yaa lɛfɔ lata fɔ nii. <verse eid="1KI 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22" />Feekple fɛɛwa fɛɛbale alesaa, feenyi ntu di lɛba le aatɔkɔ fɔ alɛ tanle, faanyi nii. Nkpo oso blɔbakookaa kpi lɛfɔ di bate lɛfɔ kakookaakɔ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23" />Di Yaa otii nwu laloo ni ole ku onyi, ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kofole wɔ niakplesɔɔ ni lalolaa nnwɔɔ omu bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo aatɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24" />Obe wɔ di Yaa otii nwu layefe ni osuku, kyata onwii lakyakako nwɔ di osuku, aalo nwɔ, ni aafuki kpi nɔɔ aatɛ di osuku, ni di bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo ku kyata nwu layila nwɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25" />Ni di batii ba bawo niafe ni ninfa lanya kpi nɔɔ nwu baafuki baatɛ ni ninfa, di kyata layila ni di kpi nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ. Ni baakyɛ baalaabuɛ di okpoo kplɛ wɔ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ kofole nwu lasiɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26" />Obe wɔ di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ wɔ niakplesa ni Yaa otii nwu lanu nwu ni ole, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Yaa otii nwu niasĩ ni SAATE nwu ɔlaa onu. Ni di SAATE nwu ntɔɔyɔ nwɔ ɛɛta kyata nwu, atɔɔbɛbɛɛ nwɔ eelo, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu ɔlaa lafunaa nwɔ ni nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27" />Ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu latɔkɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ, “Bilolaa bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo bitɛɛ,” ni baabla nkpo nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28" />Ninfɛ aakyɛ aalaanya Yaa otii nwu kpi baafuki baatɛ ni di osuku, di bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo ku kyata n-yɛ nwɔ ni di ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. Kyata nwu ditawee kpi nwu ee abɛbɛɛ bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo. <verse eid="1KI 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29" />Nioso ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lakɛnkɛ Yaa otii nwu kpi aatika di bɔkɛɛ nɔɔ wɔ nintuka ni atoo suoto, aakplesa nwɔ aawako okpoo nɔɔ omu, aabawi nwɔ aakookaa. <verse eid="1KI 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30" />Ninfɛ baawi nwɔ baabuɛ alɛ, “Oo obiloo-suɔtɔbi!” Ni baalaakookaa nwɔ di nnwɔɔ ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu omu ɔkya kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31" />Baakookaa nwɔ baaloo nii, ni di ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu latɔkɔ babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ alɛ, “Nse lekpi, biekookaa mi di ɔkya wɔ kamɛ baakookaa ni Yaa otii nwu; biɛtɛ akufi nii di akufi nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32" />Diekye ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ ni di SAATE nwu ɔlaa kanya, aayila ni di oleɔta akyikye ya di Betel suoto, aayila ni kafɔɔ di nfiofa be mmuu di ntakalekɔ nwu suoto di Samaria sekpoo kamɛ kamawa kaanya.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33" />Kafɔɔ bia di nle mmle sɛmaa, Yeroboam ditakyi di sisuku kpile nɔɔ nwu suoto, kafɔɔ aakple aase olebatatɛ aakyeko batii bamuu kamɛ aata ntakalekɔ nwu. Olele niamiɛ alɛ oole oletatɛ yi, aakleklesɔɔ ata ntakalekɔ nwu. <verse eid="1KI 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34" />Nle mmle niale Yeroboam leyo batii okpile wɔ niata ni diabiɛ ni ku kawɔɔ nini di kasɔ ka mmle suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 13:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Yeroboam Obisuɔtɔbi Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1" />Di obe wɔ di Yeroboam obisuɔtɔbi Abigya labuo ni ofiɛ, <verse eid="1KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2" />ni di Yeroboam latɔkɔ ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ omu alɛ, “Kyɛ faalaanyukũ asaa bamba, di mmle manamatofo fɔ ni alɛ Yeroboam ɔsɔfɔ fale ni. Ni faakyɛ Silo. Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Ahiya nkpe ninfa- nnwɔ niatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ kamale ni ɔka di batii ba mmle suoto. <verse eid="1KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3" />Yɔ bloblo akudi lefosi ku kaklo kawo ku bablɔ dikuuku faklee, faakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. Abatɔkɔ fɔ lɛsaa le nimawa ni di osuɔtɔbi nwu suoto.” <verse eid="1KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4" />Nioso Yeroboam ɔsɔfɔ labla fɛ mmle aatɔkɔ nwɔ nii, ni aakyɛ Ahiya leyo di Silo nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 14:4">Di obe nwu kamɛ, Ahiya diloosinnya; anu nɔɔ ntoobiɛ, ta lebe oso. <verse eid="1KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5" />Kafɔɔ SAATE nwu latɔkɔ Ahiya alɛ, “Yeroboam ɔsɔfɔ kɔwa amakaalɛ fɔ ɔlaa di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ suoto, diekye oofiɛ, nioso tɔkɔ nwɔ mmle ku mmle. Nse ɛɛbabuo, abakũ ambla fɛ otii owo dile.”<verse eid="1KI 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6" />Nioso obe wɔ di Ahiya lanu ni ɔsanko nwu nkpaa lɛnafu di kayoko nɔɔ, ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Yeroboam ɔsɔfɔ, buo fawa. Be oso feekũ fɛɛbla mmle? Beekpee mi ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ ku ɔlaa kpile. <verse eid="1KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7" />Kyɛ faalaatɔkɔ Yeroboam falɛ, nnya ɔlaa wɔ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Ami niediki fɔ lekyeko batii nwu kamɛ, lɛbla fɔ tunletɛ di batii nii Israel suoto. <verse eid="1KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8" />Labɛ sɛka kalekɔ nwu di Dawid leyo suoto, layɔ lata fɔ, kafɔɔ faate fɛle kpɛmblatɛ nii Dawid, nnwɔ niale ni afiofa nii, aatikankoe ni ku otu nɔɔ omuu, aatɔɔbla ni nle niasiɛko ni di anu nii. <verse eid="1KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9" />Fatɔɔbla okpile falenke mba bamuu nintoosiɛ ni fiɛ di afɔ. Fɛɛbla bayaa bamba fɛɛta suoto lɛfɔ, afiɔ ya bɛɛbla ni ku abɔɔsaa; fatookpee mi ɔblɔ, feefuki mi feeyu di sɛmaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="1KI 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10" />“ ‘Ta nle mmle oso, kamata ɔlaa kpile nwa di Yeroboam leyo suoto. Kamalo Yeroboam osuɔtɔ yɛntɛle biala ndiki di Israel- ɔlanle ee nnwɔ ninsiko ni suoto. Kamafiɛ Yeroboam leyo fɛ mmle di otii nfiɛ ni sɛsɔ, ninaase di obe wɔ di simuu nloo nii. <verse eid="1KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11" />Baweewee kamawee mba ninle ni Yeroboam bale ba nimakpi ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. Kɔfɛɛfɔ bakansiɛ kafɔɔ kamakyɔkyɔfɛ mba niekpi ni di lepoo kamɛ. SAATE nwu niɛkakatɛ!’ <verse eid="1KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12" />“Afɔ yi, kple fatɔɔkyɛ leyo. Nse feese kɔkpaa di okpoo kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu kamaa, osuɔtɔbi nwu kamakpi. <verse eid="1KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13" />Israel omuu kamawi nwɔ mankookaa nwɔ. Nnwɔɔ lete ninle otii wɔ ninle ni Yeroboam ole babakookaa ni nɛ. Diekye lete nɔɔ ninle Yeroboam leyo kamɛ otii wɔ kamɛ di SAATE, Israel Yaa nwu lɛnyako ni lɛsaa biene nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14" />“SAATE nwu kamase ɔka anta suoto nɔɔ di Israel suoto, nnwɔ nimawɔɔsa ni Yeroboam leyo batii. Nle mmle ninle dii nwu nɛ! Bee-ye? Nwaako, bia kanunua. <verse eid="1KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15" />SAATE nwu kafɔɔ kamananfi Israel kootoko, alɛ dibate fɛle mmle di lɛnwaakɛ nkpankpa ni di ntu kamɛ. Ansifi Israel andiki di kasɔ biene ka mmle aata ni bawa lɛma, ansamiisa ma ankpete di Eufrat okle kamaa, ta baakpee ni SAATE nwu ɔblɔ, baase ni Asera sewoso oso. <verse eid="1KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16" />SAATE nwu kamadiki Israel anta, ta sikpile se di Yeroboam labla ni, aata kafɔɔ Israel labla ni oso.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17" />Ninfɛ di Yeroboam ɔsɔfɔ lataka aasifi Tirsa nɛ. Di obe wɔ di ɔsanko nwu lase ose kɔkpaa di leyo nwu kayokontũ, ni di osuɔtɔbi nwu lakpi nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18" />Ni di Israel batii bamuu lawi nwɔ, baalaakookaa nwɔ, fɛ mmle di SAATE nwu labuɛ aafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Ahiya suoto nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19" />Yeroboam sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, nkpɛ nɔɔ ku mmle aale ni sɛka yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20" />Aale sɛka alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anyɔ, ninfɛ aatɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Nadab layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Rehoboam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21" />Solomon obisuɔtɔbi Rehoboam lale ɔka di Yuda. Alɛɛ afosi-ana-ninwii aafũ fiɛ aabale ɔka, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ lefosi-akuɛnsĩ di Yerusalem, okpoo kplɛ wɔ di SAATE nwu ladiki ni di Israel ana nwu amuu kamɛ, aayɔ Leyooto nɔɔ aatɛ nii. Rehoboam ɔya leyooto niale Naama nɛ, Amon otii aale.<verse eid="1KI 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22" />Ni di Yuda batii labla dikpilesaa di SAATE nwu anu nɛ. Baabla sikpile baalenkee nse di bate lɛma labla nii, baata SAATE nwu sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ ɔblɔ lataka osie kanya. <verse eid="1KI 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23" />Baabla kafɔɔ ntakalekɔ, afiɔtii ku Asera sewoso di lekpenkpe takale biala ku kowoso biala niefukuti ni kalɔ baata suoto lɛma. <verse eid="1KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24" />Bia nfiofa basɔnɔbakpeetɛ basuɔtɔ lawɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto; batii nwu layɔ suoto baakpee di nnle be di SAATE nwu latososa ni di Israel batii anu ayududusaa amuu ɔbla kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25" />Di Ɔka Rehoboam lɛlɛɛ nɔɔnle kamɛ yi, Egipte ɔka Sisak labakpɛko Yerusalem. <verse eid="1KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26" />Aatuka lɛsaawɛ le di SAATE nwu olekatakɔ ku lɛsaawɛ le di lɛkayo aasifiko. Aayɔ lɛsaa biala, di koto sɛɛle kubiafunsaa ya amuu di Solomon labla ni lasiɛ ni kaamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27" />Nioso Ɔka Rehoboam labla abɔɔsaa kubiafunsaa aase di nnya nkpo kanya, ni aayɔ nya aata banyuntɛ ba di lɛkayo kayoko kanyabayilatɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28" />Obe lele di ɔka kɔkyɛ SAATE nwu olekatakɔ yi, banyuntɛ nwu nklee kubiafunsaa nwu, nni sɛmaa, mankplesa nya manaatɛ di banyuntɛ nwu leyo.<verse eid="1KI 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29" />Yeroboam sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya amuu aabla nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30" />Kakpɛ sɛlaa lasiɛ di Rehoboam ku Yeroboam ntɛɛ obe lele. <verse eid="1KI 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31" />Ni di Rehoboam latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, baakookaa nwu ku mma di Dawid Okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. Rehoboam ɔya leyooto niale Naama nɛ; Amon otii aale. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Abigya layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Abigya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1" />Di lefosi lɛlɛɛ nɛnle kamɛ, di Nebat obisuɔtɔbi Yeroboam sɛka ole kamɛ yi, Abigya labale Yuda ɔka, <verse eid="1KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2" />ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ atiɛ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Maaka, Abisalom obisankobi aale.<verse eid="1KI 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3" />Aabla sikpile se simuu di ote labla ni di anu nɔɔ; atayɔ otu nɔɔ omuu aata <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Yaa nɔɔ, fɛ mmle di ɔwa nɔɔ Dawid otu late nii. <verse eid="1KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4" />Kafɔɔ, ta Dawid oso <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Yaa nɔɔ latɔɔ kandiɛ di Yerusalem, aatɔɔ obisuɔtɔbi aayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka, aata Yerusalem lawɛ osie. <verse eid="1KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5" />Diekye Dawid labla nle niasiɛko ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, atasĩ kafɔɔ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu afiofa kukunwii ole di nkpa nɔɔ ayi amuu kamɛ- diediki Uria, Heti otii nwu ɔlaa lete.<verse eid="1KI 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6" />Kakpɛ lasiɛ di Rehoboam ku Yeroboam ntɛɛ di Abigya nkpa osiɛ obe omuu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7" />Di Abigya sɛka ole sɛsaabla bule ku n-ya amuu aabla nii yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. Kakpɛ lasiɛ di Abigya ku Yeroboam ntɛɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8" />Ni di Abigya latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Dawid Okpoo Kplɛ nwu nɛ. Ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Asa layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9" />Di alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ, di Israel ɔka Yeroboam sɛka ole kamɛ yi, Asa labale Yuda ɔka, <verse eid="1KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10" />ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-ana-ninwii nɛ. Ɔwa nɔɔ sanko leyooto niale Maaka nɛ, Abisalom obisankobi aale.<verse eid="1KI 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11" />Asa labla nle niasiɛko ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, fɛ mmle di ote Dawid labla nii. <verse eid="1KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12" />Aatososa kafiofa basɔnɔbakpeetɛ basuɔtɔ nwu di kasɔ nwu suoto. Aalɛ kafɔɔ afiɔtii ya amuu di bate nɔɔ labla ni aawii. <verse eid="1KI 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13" />Aatakatɛ ɔwa nɔɔ sanko Maaka di kayilakɔ nɔɔ fɛ ɔkasanko. Diekye aabla diyududusaa aase afiɔ-sanko Asera owoso. Ni di Asa labudi owoso nwu aatɛ kaasɔ, aafiɛ nwu di Kidron Ɔtaata nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14" />Nu atakpakpaa ntakalekɔ nwu yi, Asa otu omuu latika di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu suoto di nkpa nɔɔ mmuu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15" />Aayɔ koto fututu, koto sɛɛle ku asaa ya di nnwɔɔ ku ote lakleklesa ni baawako <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu olekatakɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16" />Kakpɛ lasiɛ di Asa ku Israel ɔka Baasa ntɛɛ di sɛka ole lɛma simuu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17" />Ni di Israel ɔka Baasa lakata aakyɛ aalaadieko Yuda, aatofo oyoyiɛ aakyisa Rama, aayɔ aatĩi osuku mmle di kuonwii dilɔbafuo ni odie ee abuo di Yuda ɔka Asa kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="1KI 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18" />Ninfɛ di Asa layɔ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle kumuu ko niabu ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu olekatakɔ asaa katɛkɔ ku nnwɔɔ omu lɛkayo kamɛ nɛ. Ni aayɔ kũ aata banɔɔfotii nɔɔ baakyɛnko Tabrimon obisuɔtɔbi Ben-Hadad, aale ni Siria ɔka Hesion obisuɔtɔbi, aatoole ni sɛka di Damasko nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19" />Ni di Ɔka Asa latɔkɔ ma alɛ babuɛ alɛ, “Ta kanya ninii kasiɛ di ami ku afɔ ntɛɛ, fɛ mmle kaasiɛ ni di teemi ku teefɔ ntɛɛ. Nyu lo, lekyesee fɔ akyɛsaa ya ninle ni koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle. Kanunua kplesa kanya ninii lɛfɔ nwu ku Israel ɔka Baasa, di mmle abadiɛ mi ni otikanko.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20" />Ninfɛ di Ben-Hadad latunako Ɔka Asa nɛ. Ni aakpee bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ kanyabayilatɛ di Israel sekpoo nwu suoto nɛ. Ni aalenkee Iyon, Dan, Abel Bet Maaka ku Kinerot omuu di Naftali lakyakaa nii. <verse eid="1KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21" />Di Baasa lanu ni nnwɔ mmle yi, aadiɛ Rama oyoyiɛ nwu otofo, ni aadie aasifi Tirsa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22" />Ninfɛ di Ɔka Asa lata kufiofa di Yuda kasɔ kamuu alɛ- kuonwii diedie kaamɛ- ni baatuka afuɔ ku sewoso se di Baasa latɔɔblako ni ɔkpɛ di Rama ninfa baasifiko nɛ. Ni di Ɔka Asa layɔ nya aabudi Geba okpoo kplɛ nwu di Benyamin ku Mispa nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23" />Di Asa sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba simuu, n-ya aafuo ni ɔbla amuu, n-ya aabla ni amuu ku sekpoo kplɛ se aabudi nii, bɛɛkpana nya beekpee di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. Kafɔɔ di sɛnɔɔfo nɔɔ obe kamɛ, aabuo ofiɛ di nkpaa nɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24" />Ninfɛ di Asa latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ. Ni baakookaa nwɔ ku mma di ote Dawid okpoo kplɛ nwu nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yosafat layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Nadab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25" />Di Yuda ɔka Asa lɛlɛɛ nyɔɔfa kamɛ, ni di Yeroboam obisuɔtɔbi Nadab labale Israel ɔka nɛ. Ninfɛ aale sɛka di Israel suoto alɛɛ anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26" />Aabla dikpilesaa di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, aakyɛ di ote sisuku suoto ku sikpile nɔɔ kamɛ, ni aata Israel kafɔɔ labla sĩ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27" />Ahigya obisuɔtɔbi Baasa wɔ niakye ni Isakar leyo kamɛ lakũ kanwumbe di suoto nɔɔ. Ni aalo Nadab aatɛ di Filisti batii okpoo onwii bɔɔlɛɛ ni Gibeton, di obe wɔ di Nadab ku Israel batii bamuu lamana okpoo nwu baakyi nii. <verse eid="1KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28" />Baasa lalo Nadab di Yuda ɔka Asa lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ, ni di Baasa layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29" />Aakye okye sɛka ole kasɔ, ni aalo Yeroboam leyo kamɛ batii bamuu nɛ. Atadiɛ Yeroboam otii kuonwii ninnwuna nii, kafɔɔ aawɔɔsa bamuu, di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa kanya ka aata aafenko ni di kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Ahigya, Silo otii nwu suoto- <verse eid="1KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30" />ta sikpile se di Yeroboam labla ni, aata Israel kafɔɔ labla ni oso, ta ku nle aakpee ni <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu ɔblɔ oso.<verse eid="1KI 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31" />Di Nadab sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya aabla ni amuu, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32" />Kakpɛ lasiɛ di Asa ku Israel ɔka Baasa ntɛɛ di sɛka ole lɛma simuu obe kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Baasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33" />Di Yuda ɔka Asa lɛlɛɛ tiefa kamɛ yi, Ahigya obisuɔtɔbi Baasa labale Israel omuu ɔka di Tirsa, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ afosi anyɔ-ana nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34" />Ni aabla dikpilesaa di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu nɛ, aakyɛ di Yeroboam sisuku suoto ku sikpile nɔɔ suoto aata Israel labla ni nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 15:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Hanani obisuɔtɔbi, Yehu di Baasa suoto alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2" />“Latakatɛsa fɔ di kudù kamɛ, ni labla fɔ tunletɛ di batii nii Israel suoto nɛ. Kafɔɔ faakyɛ di Yeroboam sisuku suoto, ni faata batii nii Israel labla okpile, baakpee mi ɔblɔ ku sikpile lɛma nwu ɔbla. <verse eid="1KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3" />Nioso nfɛ kamawɔɔsa Baasa ku leyo nɔɔ batii, kamabla leyo lɛfɔ kafɔɔ fɛle Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam lele okle. <verse eid="1KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4" />Baweewee kamawee mba ninle ni Baasa bale beekpi ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. Bakansiɛ ba di kɔfɛɛfɔ kafɔɔ kamakyɔkyɔfɛ mba niekpi ni di lepoo kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5" />Di Baasa sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, n-ya aabla ni ku nse aafũ ni leyooto yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6" />Ni di Baasa latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Tirsa nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ela layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7" />Diɛkyakaa nii, <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuafe di Hanani obisuɔtɔbi, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yehu suoto kuata Baasa ku leyo nɔɔ batii, ta akpilesaa ya amuu aabla ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, aakpee nwɔ ni ɔblɔ ku asaa ya aabla nii, diabakple fɛle Yeroboam leyo batii- ta ku mmle kafɔɔ aawɔɔsa nini oso.<verse eid="1KI 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Ela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8" />Di Yuda ɔka Asa alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-dikuɔnle kamɛ, Baasa obisuɔtɔbi, Ela labale Israel ɔka, ni aale sɛka di Tirsa alɛɛ anyɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9" />Ni di ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔ onwii, Simri wɔ niale ni bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ aata ni bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni dikuu lakũ kanwumbe di suoto nɔɔ. Ela nnwɔɔ aawɛ di Tirsa di obe nwu kamɛ aatoosiɛ ni nta di Arsa leyo, osuɔtɔ wɔ niayila ni di lɛkayo onyu kanya di Tirsa. <verse eid="1KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10" />Ni di Simri lalabuo Arsa leyo aasafɔ Ela aalo nwɔ aatɛ, di Yuda ɔka Asa alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-dikuɛnsinle kamɛ nɛ. Ninfɛ aayila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11" />Di Simri lasiɛ osiɛ di lɛkakpomii aakye ni sɛka ole kasɔ, ni aalo Baasa leyo kamɛ batii bamuu nɛ. Atabu bia osuɔtɔ onwii, kuntɛ ɔnantii ee siɛwo. <verse eid="1KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12" />Nioso Simri lawɔɔsa Baasa leyo kamɛ batii bamuu, di mmle kanya di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu lakakatɛ ni di Baasa suoto aafenko ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Yehu suoto- <verse eid="1KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13" />ta sikpile se simuu di Baasa ku obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ela labla ni, baata Israel kafɔɔ labla ni oso, baakpee ni <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu ɔblɔ ta afiɔ lɛma nwu ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ suoto oso.<verse eid="1KI 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14" />Di Ela sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku n-ya amuu aabla nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Simri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15" />Di Yuda ɔka Asa alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ dikuɛsinle kamɛ yi, Simri lale sɛka di Tirsa ayi akuɛnsĩ. Ni di Israel bakpɛtɛ labasiɛ baakaako Filisti batii okpoo Gibeton nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16" />Obe wɔ di Israel bakpɛtɛ ba di kasiɛkɔ nwu lanu alɛ Simri lakũ ni kanwumbe di ɔka suoto, aalo nwɔ nii, ni di dii nwu nkpo kale, baayɔ bakpɛtɛ kanyayilatɛ Omri baase ɔka di Israel batii bamuu suoto di kasiɛkɔ nwu ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17" />Ninfɛ di Omri ku Israel batii ba bamuu niawɛ ni di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ ladie di Gibeton okpoo, ni baalaamana Tirsa okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18" />Obe wɔ di Simri lanya alɛ batoofũ ni okpoo kplɛ nwu yi, ni aasifi lɛkayo katanikokɔ nwu kamɛ aalaakpee lɛkayo nwu ɔtɔ aakyisa suoto nɛ. Nioso aakpi, <verse eid="1KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19" />ta sikpile se aabla ni oso. Aabla okpile di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, aakyɛ di Yeroboam sisuku suoto, ku sikpile se aabla ni, aata Israel kafɔɔ labla nii.<verse eid="1KI 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20" />Di Simri sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba ku ɔtaka oyila nɔɔ wɔ aabla nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Omri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21" />Ninfɛ di Israel batii lasɛ di akudi anyɔ nɛ; kakyɛ kanwii layila Ginat obisuɔtɔbi, Tibni kamaa alɛ ale ɔka, kakyɛ nyɔɔfa kafɔɔ layila Omri kamaa. <verse eid="1KI 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22" />Kafɔɔ Omri batikankotɛ lawɛ osie baalenkee Ginat obisuɔtɔbi, Tibni bale. Nioso Tibni lakpi, ni di Omri labale ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23" />Di Yuda ɔka Asa alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-ninwii kamɛ yi, Omri labale Israel ɔka, ni aale sɛka alɛɛ lefosi-anyɔ nɛ, alɛɛ akuɔ nɔɔ di Tirsa. <verse eid="1KI 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24" />Ni di Omri laya Samaria lekpenkpe di Semer ɔkyɛ ku koto fututu bakilo afosi-akuɛnsĩ nɛ. Ni aabudi okpoo kplɛ onwii di lekpenkpe nwu osi, aayɔ lekpenkpe nwu saate kofole Semer leyooto aatika nwu alɛ Samaria.<verse eid="1KI 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25" />Kafɔɔ Omri labla nle niale ni okpile di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, ni aabla okpile aalenkee mba bamuu niale nwɔ ni katũ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26" />Aakyɛ di Nabat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam sisuku simuu ku sikpile nɔɔ se aata Israel labla ni kamɛ. Nkpo oso baakpee <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu ɔblɔ ku afiɔ lɛma ya ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ suoto. <verse eid="1KI 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27" />Di Omri sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, n-ya aabla ni ku asaa ya suoto aafuo ni ɔbla suoto yi, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28" />Ni di Omri latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ, ni baakookaa nwɔ di Samaria nɛ. Ninfɛ di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ahab layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29" />Di Yuda ɔka Asa alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-lɛnɛnle kamɛ yi, Omri obisuɔtɔbi, Ahab labale Israel ɔka. Ni aale seka di Samaria di Israel suoto alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ-anyɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30" />Omri obisuɔtɔbi Ahab labla sikpile di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu aalenkee mba niale nwɔ ni katũ obiala. <verse eid="1KI 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31" />Aanyu alɛ lɛsaa biibii lete diale alɛ aabla Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam sikpile nwu okle, kafɔɔ aayɔ kafɔɔ Sidon batii ɔka Etbaal obisankobi, Yesebel aayɔ, ni aakyekasɔ aatoosumu Baal nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32" />Aapɛ oleɔta akyikye aata Baal di Baal olekatakɔ ka aatofo ni di Samaria. <verse eid="1KI 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33" />Ahab kafɔɔ lase Asera owoso, ni aabla asaa kpinwu aayɔ aakpee <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu ɔblɔ, alɛ ɔblɔ kufiɛ nwɔ kulenkee Israel baka bamuu ba niale nwɔ ni katũ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34" />Di Ahab obe kamɛ yi, Hiel wɔ niakye ni Betel lase Yeriko nwu letofo. Aase nwu ni lɛsɔse, obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ kasale Abiram lakpi, aakpee ni n-yoko ninwu kafɔɔ yi, obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ bisɔnle Segub lakpi, di ɔlaa wɔ kanya di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu labuɛ aafenko ni di Nun obisuɔtɔbi, Yosua suoto.<verse eid="1KI 16:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Bakwakwalobi Lanyu Elia Kanya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1" />Ninfɛ di Elia, Tisbi otii nwu niakye ni Tisbi di Gilead latɔkɔ Ahab alɛ, “Di <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu, nnwɔ kosumu ni nkpe ni nkpa yi, kanto ee oblokyi dilɔbasinwɛ di alɛɛ asɛɛ ya nikɔwa ni kamɛ, diediki lekple lebuɛ fiɛ di kanto kamanɔɔ.,”<verse eid="1KI 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Elia alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3" />“Die ninfũ, faakyɔɔ anu kufĩ katunkɔ lɛkyɛ, faalaawofa di Kerit Kɔwɛ kamɛ, di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4" />Fabanyi ntu di kaklenyii nwu, ntoodiki kafɔɔ bakwakwalobi kanya nlɛ banyu fɔ kanya ninfa.”<verse eid="1KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5" />Nioso Elia labla fɛ mmle di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ nii. Aasifi aalaasiɛ ninfa di Kerit Kɔwɛ nwu di Yordan kufĩ katunkɔ. <verse eid="1KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6" />Ni di bakwakwalobi lawako nwɔ bloblo ku sina di olese, bloblo ku sina di kɔtɔɔfɔ, ni aanyi ntu di kaklenyii nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elia Ku Kpisɔfɔ Nwu Di Sarefat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7" />Di obe owo sɛmaa kaklenyii nwu lasɔɔ, ta kanto disinnɔɔ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto oso. <verse eid="1KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Elia alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9" />“Die wla fasifi Sarefat di Sidon faalaasiɛ ninfa. Ntɔɔtɔkɔ kpisɔfɔ onwii ninfa nlɛ ata fɔ alesaa.” <verse eid="1KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10" />Nioso aasifi Sarefat. Obe wɔ di Elia labadu ni okpoo nwu kayoko yi, kpisɔfɔ onwii lawɛ ninfa aatoomiɛ ni ntɔɔni. Ni di Elia lalɛɛ ɔsanko nwu aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Wakoe ntu kɛɛkɛɛ di kakuikuii kamɛ ninnyi.” <verse eid="1KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11" />Di ɔsanko nwu latoofe ni ntu nwu ɔyɔ, ni di Elia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lekoto, wakoe bloblo kakyɛɛ kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Nwaako, di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu, Yaa lɛfɔ lɛnya akpe ni nkpa yi, bloblo kuonwii nnaa mi- nnaafũ kɔnɛɛ kamɛ diyii lete niebu mi di letoo kamɛ ku nnɔfɔ kafui di lɛtaase kamɛ. Ntɔɔni nsɛɛ kɔsɛsɛɛ nsifiko leyo ninaawa lelesaa nta ami omu ku obisuɔtɔbi nii, alɛ buale nya- munkpi.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13" />Ni di Elia latɔkɔ ɔsanko nwu alɛ, “Tanyɛkɛ. Tɔɔkyɛ leyo faalaabla fɛ mmle feebuɛ ni. Kafɔɔ kasa bloblo kakudi ɔbla di nnaafũ be ninkpe fɔ ni kamɛ fawakoe, fiɛ nfɛ faabla lɛsaa lewo fata suoto lɛfɔ ku obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ. <verse eid="1KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14" />Diekye nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: “ ‘Nnaafũ dilɔbaloo di letoo, nnɔfɔ dilɔbaloo di lɛtaase kafɔɔ, diɛlaase di obe wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamata kanto nnɔɔ ni di kasɔ nwu suoto.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu lasifi aalaabla fɛ mmle di Elia latɔkɔ nwɔ ni nɛ. Nioso alesaa lawɛ dii biala aata Elia ku ɔsanko nwu ku leyo nɔɔ batii. <verse eid="1KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16" />Diekye nnaafũ ditaloo di letoo nwu, nnɔfɔ kafɔɔ ditaloo di lɛtaase nwu kafɔɔ, ta di ɔsanko nwu lanu ni <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa wɔ di Elia labuɛ ni oso.<verse eid="1KI 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17" />Di obe owo sɛmaa, ɔsanko wɔ nimba ni leyo nwu obisuɔtɔbi labuo ɔfiɛ. Ɔfiɛ nwu kanya latɔɔtaka katoo, lɛyɛntɛle, aabadiɛ onwuna. <verse eid="1KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18" />Ni di ɔsanko nwu lakaalɛ Elia alɛ, “Yaa otii, ɔmɛnlaa ninsi munko fɔ ntɛɛ? Ɔwa fɛɛwa falɛ fɔɔbanyumasɛɛ sikpile nii, fanlo obisuɔtɔbi nii?”<verse eid="1KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19" />Ni di Elia labuɛ alɛ, “Yɔ obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ nwu fatɛɛ.” Ni aafũ nwɔ di ɔya nnɛɛ, aakpaa nwɔ aasifiko leyo le di osi di nfũ aasiɛ nii, ni aayɔ nwɔ aatensa di atensaa nɔɔ suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20" />Ni aapɛ ɔlaa aata <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu aabuɛ alɛ, “Oo <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Yaa nii, fɛɛyɔ ɔlaa kpile kafɔɔ fɛɛwako di kpisɔfɔ wɔ mmle ɔkyɛ nsi ni, fanta obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ nkpi?” <verse eid="1KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21" />Ninfɛ aafuu di osuɔtɔbi nwu suoto sitiɛ simu nɛ, aapɛ ɔlaa aata <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu alɛ, “Oo <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Yaa nii, ta osuɔtɔbi wɔ mmle nkpa dikple diwa nwɔ kamɛ!”<verse eid="1KI 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22" />Ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu lanu Elia ɔlaa ɔpɛ, aata ninwuna lakple diabuo di osuɔtɔbi nwu kamɛ, ni aawɛ nkpa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23" />Ninfɛ di Elia lakɛnkɛ obisɔ nwu, aasooko nwɔ aawako kasɔ leyo nwu nɛ. Ni aayɔ nwɔ aata ɔya aabuɛ alɛ, “Nyu, obisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ ntɔɔwɛ nkpa!”<verse eid="1KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24" />Ninfɛ di ɔsanko nwu latɔkɔ Elia alɛ, “Mianwu nfɛ letofo nlɛ Yaa otii fale nɛ, alɛ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa wɔ niekye ni kanya lɛfɔ nle onukwale.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Elia Ku Baal Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1" />Di obe kpinwu sɛmaa, di lɛlɛɛ tiɛfa kamɛ, <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Elia alɛ: “Kyɛ faalaadiki suoto fatuo Ahab, ni kamata kanto nnɔɔ di kasɔ nwu suoto.” <verse eid="1KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2" />Nioso Elia lakyɛ aalaadiki suoto aatuo Ahab.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:2">Kɔka kanya latɛ kuawɛ osie di Samaria, <verse eid="1KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3" />ni di Ahab lalɛɛ Obadia wɔ niale ni lɛkayo nɔɔ nyuntɛ nɛ. (Obadia lale ofũ onutɛ nwaa di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4" />Di obe nwu Yesebel latoolo ni <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ yi, Obadia layɔ Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ kɔlafa aalaawofasa di efuɔntuu ɛnyɔ kamɛ. Afosi-anɔɔ di obiala kamɛ, ni aatɔɔta ma alesaa ku ntu nɛ.) <verse eid="1KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5" />Ni di Ahab latɔkɔ Obadia alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaafenfe di kasɔ nwu suoto ku ntu ntaakɔ ku sɛtaata simuu. Loobia bubawɛ sɛfa sewo munta bapɔnkɔ ku babɔkɛɛ ba ninte ni fɛ bapɔnkɔ nwee di mmle baawɛ ni nkpa, di mmle munamalo ni babɔkɛɛ loo kuonwii.” <verse eid="1KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6" />Nioso baasɛ kasɔ nwu babakyi nii, Ahab lafe di kakyɛ kanwii, Obadia kafɔɔ lafe di kakyɛ bamba.<verse eid="1KI 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7" />Di Obadia lakyɛ ni di osuku, ni di Elia lakyakako nwɔ nɛ. Obadia latofo nwɔ, ni aawakasɔ aase katũ kaasɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Saate nii Elia, nwaako afɔ omu dile?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8" />Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Yii, tɔɔkyɛ faalaatɔkɔ saate lɛfɔ falɛ, ‘Elia ntɔɔwa nfũ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9" />Ni di Obadia lakaalɛ alɛ, “Ɔmɛnkpile lɛbla, fiɛ fɔɔyɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ fankpee di Ahab nnɛɛ falɛ alo mi? <verse eid="1KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10" />Nwaako di <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Yaa lɛfɔ nkpe ni nkpa, kale ee sɛka kalekɔ kukanwii nnaa di saate nii diikpee otii alɛ alaawolaa fɔ nii. Nse kafɔɔ kale ee sɛka kalekɔ kawo lebuɛ alɛ fanaa ninfa yi, anta ma manka ntam alɛ baanya fɔ. <verse eid="1KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11" />Kafɔɔ nunua nfɛ fɔɔtɔkɔ mi falɛ ntɔɔkyɛ ni saate nii nfũ ninaatɔkɔ nwɔ nlɛ, ‘Elia ntɔɔwa nfũ.’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12" />Nin-ye nfũ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu Ninwuna kamakpaa fɔ ansifiko nii, nse lesifi lediɛ fɔ. Nse lɛkyɛ lɛlaatɔkɔ Ahab, fiɛ anaanya fɔ, ni Ahab kamalo mi. Kafɔɔ ami kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntoosumu <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu diayɔ ni bia sekosopo nii obe kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13" />Saate nii, fadinu lɛsaale labla ni, di obe wɔ di Yesebel latoolo ni <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ? Layɔ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ kɔlafa lawofasa di efuɔntuu ɛnyɔ kamɛ, afosi-anɔɔ di obiala kamɛ, lata ma kafɔɔ alesaa ku ntu. <verse eid="1KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14" />Ninfɛ di nunua fɔɔtɔkɔ mi falɛ ntɔɔkyɛ ninaatɔkɔ saate nii nlɛ, ‘Elia ntɔɔwa nfũ nɛ.’ Abalo mi!”<verse eid="1KI 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15" />Ni di Elia labuɛ alɛ, “Di <char style="nd">Saate </char> wɔ Ninlenke ni nkpe ni nkpa, nnwɔ kosumu nii, nwaako kamadiki suoto nii ntuo Ahab miɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elia Lakyɛ Kamel Kobokote Osi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16" />Nioso Obadia lakyɛ aalaakyakako Ahab aatɔkɔ nwɔ, ni di Ahab lakyɛ aalaakyakako Elia nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17" />Obe wɔ di Ahab lanya ni Elia, ni di Ahab lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Afɔ Israel kudu-kpeetɛ, afɔ nɛ?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18" />Ni di Elia labuɛ alɛ, “Ninkpee kudu di Israel, kafɔɔ afɔ ku teefɔ leyo batii niadiki kudu. Aye nintoosĩ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu afiofa, biɛkyɛ bitikanko Baal. <verse eid="1KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19" />Nunua lɛɛ Israel batii bamuu baabakyakakoe di Karmel Kobokote osi. Faakpaa Baal ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ alafa-ana-afosi-anɔɔ nwu ku Asera ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ alafa-ana nwu fawako, mba ninle ni alesaa di Yesebel opunu suoto.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20" />Nioso Ahab lata kanya aafenko di Israel kasɔ kamuu, ni di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu labasi di Karmel Kobokote osi nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21" />Ni di Elia lalayila di batii nwu anu, ni aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Ɔmɛmbe bibakpankpa di ɛlaa ɛnyɔ be mmle nntɛɛ minaase? Nse <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ninle Yaa, bitikanko nwɔ. Kafɔɔ nse Baal ninle Yaa yi, bietikanko nwɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">Kafɔɔ batii nwu ditabuɛ ɔlaa kuonwii.<verse eid="1KI 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22" />Ninfɛ di Elia latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Ami ninle <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu, Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ wɔ lete niebu ni nɛ, kafɔɔ Baal nkpe ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ alafa-ana-afosi anɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23" />Bimiɛ banankyue-suɔtɔ banyɔ bata wo. Ta ma badiki onwii bata suoto lɛma, baata ma balo nwɔ, baabubudi nwɔ pitipiti, baayɔ batika di ntɔɔni suoto, kafɔɔ batankpee mi ɔtɔ. Amii kamabla nankyue-suɔtɔ nwu nyɔɔfa, nin-yɔ nwɔ ntika di ntɔɔni suoto, kafɔɔ nɔmakpee mi ɔtɔ. <verse eid="1KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24" />Ni biɛlɛɛ yaa lee leyooto, ami kafɔɔ kamalɛɛ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu leyooto. Ni yaa wɔ nimatuna ni ku ɔtɔ yi- nnwɔɔ ninle- Yaa nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Ninfɛ di batii nwu bamuu labuɛ alɛ, “Nnwɔ feebuɛ ni nlɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25" />Ni di Elia latɔkɔ Baal ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ alɛ, “Bikasa banankyue-suɔtɔ nwu onwii odiki ɔbla, diekye, aye nimpɔ bilenke. Bilɛɛ yaa lee leyooto, kafɔɔ bitankpee ɔtɔ.” <verse eid="1KI 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26" />Nioso baayɔ nankyue-suɔtɔ nwu baata ma ni baabla nkpo nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:26">Ninfɛ baalɛɛ Baal leyooto, diayɔ ni di oyita dialaadu ni kakũ, baafaa baabuɛ alɛ, “Oo Baal, tuna fata wo!” Kafɔɔ atatuna; kuonwii ditakpee ma kanya. Ni baatũ baakyi oleɔta akyikye ya baapɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27" />Di kakũ yi, Elia lakye kasɔ aatɔɔma ma alɛ, “Bifaa osie kanya! Nwaako yaa ale! Loobia oobu disi osie kanya ee anaa kayaa ee eefe osuku. Loobia ɔɔkyɔsĩi, ni dikpeni biɛsɛnkɛsɔɔ.” <verse eid="1KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28" />Nioso baafafaa osie kanya, baakyankya bawo ku mpamii ku akplɔ lɛma, fɛ mmle di ɔsaabla lɛma late nii, dialaase di obe wɔ di ntɔ lɛma ladie nii. <verse eid="1KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29" />Kakũ lafe, kafɔɔ baanwini baatoobiá osie kanya, dialaase di obe wɔ manta ni kɔtɔɔfɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">obe nwu kabla fɛ kɔtɔɔfɔ alomu etiɛ kamɛ </char></note> ole. Kafɔɔ kuonwii ditatuna, kuonwii ditakpee ma kanya, kuonwii ditakyɔɔ ma atoko.<verse eid="1KI 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30" />Ninfɛ di Elia latɔkɔ batii nwu bamuu alɛ, “Biwa ɔkyɛ nii ninfũ.” Ni baawa ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, ni aalolaa <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu oleɔta akyikye ya niabibiɛ ni nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31" />Ni di Elia layɔ afuɔ lefosi-anyɔ, ninwii diata ni kɔna biala niakye ni Yakob kamɛ. Nnwɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata ni alɛ, “Leyooto lɛfɔ nimale ni Israel.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32" />Elia layɔ afuɔ nwu aapɛ oleɔta akyikye di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu leyooto kamɛ. Ni aakutu okplo kplɛ nikaklee ni ntu fɛ bakpokiti kplɛ batiɛ aakyisa oleɔta akyikye nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33" />Ni aakpee ntɔɔni nwu, aabubudi nankyue-suɔtɔ nwu pitipiti aayɔ aatika di ntɔɔni nwu suoto nɛ. Ninfɛ aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Biyiisa ɛpɔɔlɔ ɛna ku ntu, biɛnyɛɛnɛ mi bikpete di asaaɔta nwu ku ntɔɔni nwu suoto.”<verse eid="1KI 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34" />Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Bikple bibla nkpo,” ni baakple baabla nkpo nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:34">Aakple aadiki kanya alɛ, “Bibla nkpo ditiɛfa,” ni baabla nkpo ditiɛfa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35" />Ntu nwu lasoo diamana oleɔta akyikye nwu diakyi, bia diayii sɛkplo nwu.<verse eid="1KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36" />Di oleɔta obe nwu kamɛ yi, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Elia lanafu aawa sitũ, ni aapɛ ɔlaa alɛ: “Oo <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Abraham, Isak ku Israel Yaa, ta batofo miɛ alɛ afɔ ninle Yaa di Israel, ni di ami nle kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, ni lɛbla asaa ya mmle amuu di kanya lɛfɔ didiki kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37" />Tuna fatɛɛ, Oo <char style="nd">Saate </char>, tuna fatɛɛ, di batii ba mmle batofo alɛ afɔ, O <char style="nd">Saate </char>, ninle Yaa, nni oso fookple famunikĩisa situ lɛma fanwako nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔtɔ lakpa kuabafiɛ oleɔta nwu, ntɔɔni, afuɔ ku kɔtɛ nwu, kuasɔɔsa kafɔɔ ntu nwu di okplo nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39" />Di batii nwu bamuu lanya ni nle mmle yi, baase ntũ kaasɔ baabuɛ alɛ, “<char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu- nnwɔɔ ninle Yaa nɛ! <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu- nnwɔɔ ninle Yaa nɛ!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40" />Ninfɛ di Elia latɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Bimumfũ Baal ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ. Bitanta kuonwii lasifi!” Baamufũ ma, ni di Elia lata baasooko ma baasifiko Kison Ɔtaata, ni aalaalo ma ninfa nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41" />Ni di Elia latɔkɔ Ahab alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ, faalaale, faanyi, diekye kanto kplɛ kɔkpanko suoto.” <verse eid="1KI 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42" />Nioso Ahab lasifi aalaale, aanyi, kafɔɔ Elia lakata aasifi Karmel Kobokote nsintɛɛ, aalaawakasɔ, ni aayɔ anu nɔɔ aakpee di akunkyi nɔɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43" />Ni aatɔkɔ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ alɛ, “Kyɛ faalaanyu lekpo nwu lɛkyɛ.” Ni aakata aakyɛ aalaanyu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Ni aabuɛ alɛ, “Lɛsaalɛsaa nnaa ninfa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Sikuɛnsĩ di Elia labuɛ alɛ, “Kple fakyɛ faalaanyu.”<verse eid="1KI 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44" />Ni di dikuɛsinle, kpɛmblatɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Lelokonkyɛ biibii fɛ otii kɔnɛɛ kɔtaka kankye lekpo nwu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Nioso Elia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Tɔɔkyɛ faalaatɔkɔ Ahab falɛ, ‘Ninii babɔkɛɛ lɛfɔ di keke suoto, faasoo fasifi fiɛ di kanto atĩi fɔ osuku.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45" />Di obe nwu kamɛ, kolo ku alokonkyɛ niawɔfɔ, afɛɛfɔ niataka, kanto kplɛ lasoosa. Ni di Ahab lasiɛ keke nɔɔ aasifi Yesreel okpoo kplɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 18:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46" />Ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu osie labuo di Elia suoto, ni asosoosa akpeele nɔɔ aakpee di ofiami nɔɔ, aatoso aale Ahab katũ aafe di osuku aasiifi Yesreel okpoo kplɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 18:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Elia Latoso Aasifi Horeb Kobokote Osi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1" />Ninfɛ di Ahab latɔkɔ Yesebel lɛsaa biala le di Elia labla ni ku mmle aalo ni Baal ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ nwu bamuu ku kapamii nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2" />Nioso Yesebel lakpee tɔkyɛntɛ di Elia nfũ alɛ, “Bayaa nwu bananfi mi kootoko, bia ditɛ diwɛ osie nwaa, nse kɔsɛɛ nuakpa okle nimbla nkpa lɛfɔ dite fɛle onwii lɛma nle okle.”<verse eid="1KI 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3" />Elia layɛkɛ, ni aatoso aafũ nkpa nɔɔ nɛ. Obe wɔ aadu ni Beerseba di Yuda, aadiɛ kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ninfa. <verse eid="1KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4" />Kafɔɔ nnwɔɔ omu aakyɛ dii kufĩ osuku aasifi ɔfaafuu. Ni aakyɛ aalaasiɛ di lɛkambe kowoso kunwii oyududu kalɔ, aapɛ ɔlaa alɛ akpi nɛ. Aabuɛ alɛ, “<char style="nd">Saate </char>, ntɔɔnya kayi lɛpɔɔsa, diki mi ninwua; ninlɛ nlenke bawa nii.” <verse eid="1KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5" />Ninfɛ aaklɛ aate di kowoso nwu kalɔ, aakyɔsĩi nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:5">Nfanwu ni di Yaa tɔkyɛntɛ onwii lakpanko nwɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Taka faale alesaa.” <verse eid="1KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6" />Ni aanyunyu aakyiko, ni aanya bloblo dikudi beefiɛ ni di atɔkɔnii kpankpa suoto ku ntu dikuuku di disi nɔɔ ɔlɔɔkɔ nɛ. Ni aale, aanyi, ni aakple aaklɛ aate nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7" />
    <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu tɔkyɛntɛ lakple aawa lɛnyɔɔfa aabaakpanko nwɔ aabuɛ alɛ, “Taka faale alesaa, diekye osuku nwu leloolo fɔ ku ɔkyɛ.” <verse eid="1KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8" />Nioso aataka aale, aanyi. Alesaa nwu lakpee nwɔ osie, aakyɛ ayi afosi-ana ku nkyɛ afoso-ana dialaase di obe wɔ aadu ni Horeb, Yaa kobokote nwu. <verse eid="1KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9" />Nfa aalaabuo di ofuɔntuu onwii kamɛ aalaate ku kakyɛ nwu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1KI 19:9">
    <char style="nd">Saate </char> Nwu Ladiki Suoto Aatuo Elia</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:9">Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Elia alɛ, “Elia, obe fɔɔbla ninfũ?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10" />Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Latɛ lawɛ okyiini lata <char style="nd">Saate </char> Wɔ Ninlenke nii. Israel batii ntoosĩ kanya ninii lɛfɔ nwu, beebibiɛ oleɔta akyikye lɛfɔ nwu, beelo Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ lɛfɔ nwu ku kapamii. Lete nii niebu, kafɔɔ nunua boomiɛ alɛ balo ami kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11" />Ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu latɔkɔ Elia alɛ, “Die faalaayila di kobokote nwu di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu. Diekye <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu nfɛ komiɛ alɛ abafe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Ninfɛ di afɛɛfɔ kplɛ ku osie labɛbɛɛ abokote nwu, aabibiɛ afuɔnkpaa nwu di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu. Kafɔɔ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ditasiɛ di afɛɛfɔ nwu kamɛ. Di afɛɛfɔ nwu sɛmaa, kasɔ latũkũ, kafɔɔ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ditasiɛ di kasɔ otũkũ nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12" />Di kasɔ otũkũ nwu sɛmaa, ɔtɔ niawa, kafɔɔ <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ditasiɛ di ɔtɔ nwu kamɛ. Ni di ɔtɔ nwu kamaa, sɛwɛɛwɛɛ buɛɛ niawa. <verse eid="1KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13" />Obe wɔ di Elia lanu ni sɛlɔ nwu, ni aananfi aakpeele nɔɔ aatĩi anu nɔɔ, ni aadie aalaayila di ofuɔntuu nwu kanya nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:13">Ni di sɛlɔ sinwii lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Elia, obe fɔɔbla ninfũ?”<verse eid="1KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14" />Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Latɛ lawɛ okyiini lata <char style="nd">Saate </char> Wɔ Ninlenke nii. Israel batii ntoosĩ kanya ninii lɛfɔ nwu, beebibiɛ oleɔta akyikye lɛfɔ nwu, beelo Yaa ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ lɛfɔ nwu ku kapamii. Lete nii niebu, kafɔɔ nunua boomiɛ alɛ balo ami kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15" />Ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kple fafe di osuku wɔ faafe faawa ni, faasifi Damasko Ɔfaafuu. Nse feedu nfa, faapɛ Hasael ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka fata Siria. <verse eid="1KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16" />Faapɛ kafɔɔ Nimsi obisuɔtɔbi, Yehu ɔfɔɔ fɛ ɔka fata Israel. Faapɛ kafɔɔ Safat wɔ niekye ni Abel Mehola obisuɔtɔbi, Elisa ɔfɔɔ, aayila fɔ kamaa fɛ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ. <verse eid="1KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17" />Yehu kamalo olele nietoso Hasael kapamii, Elisa kafɔɔ kamalo olele nietoso Yehu kapamii. <verse eid="1KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18" />Kafɔɔ lebu batii nkpe nkuɛnsĩ di Israel- mba bamuu akunkyi ninadiwakasɔ bata ni Baal, ku mba bamuu nnya ninadifĩfiɔ nwɔ ni akpoo.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa Lɛlɛɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19" />Nioso Elia ladie ninfa aakyɛ aalaanya Safat obisuɔtɔbi, Elisa. Aatoofuu kasɔ ku banankyue lefosi-banyɔ baapɛ ni akpo siimu. Ni di nnwɔɔ omu aatɔɔka mba baapɛ ni akpo banyɔ baakaasa ni baawo lefosi-ɔnyɔɔfa nɛ. Ninfɛ di Elia lakata aakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, ni aafuki akpeele nɔɔ aatika di Elisa suoto nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20" />Ni di Elisa ladiɛ banankyue nɔɔ, aatoso aatikanko Elia aabuɛ alɛ, “Tɛɛ nnaafĩfiɔ teemi ku yaami akpoo ninkla ma fiɛ nfɛ nin-wa nimatikanko fɔ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">Ni di Elia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Obe lɛbla fɔ, kple fatɔɔkyɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21" />Nioso Elisa ladiɛ nwɔ aakple aasifi. Ni aamufũ banankyue nɔɔ nwu aapɛ ni akpo siimu aalo nɛ. Aafiɛ kasɔ akpɛnsaa nwu aawa sina nwu aata batii lawee. Ninfɛ di Elisa ladie aatikanko Elia, ni aabakple kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Siria Lakpɛko Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1" />Ninfɛ di Siria ɔka Ben-Hadad lasiisa bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu nɛ. Baka afosi-atiɛ-banyɔ lakyakaa ku bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke lɛma ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii, ni baakata baakyɛ baalaamana Samaria okpoo kplɛ nwu baakyi, baadieko nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2" />Ni di Ben-Hadad lakpee batɔkyɛntɛ Israel ɔka Ahab nfũ di okpoo kplɛ nwu alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Ben-Hadad kobuɛ ni alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3" />‘Kole mi di koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle lɛfɔ nwu nle, basɔfɔ biene ku babi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nle mi bale.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4" />Ni di Israel ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Saate nii ɔka, fɛ mmle feebuɛ ni kanya. Ami ku asaa ya amuu ninkpe mi nii yi, ale fɔ ale.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5" />Batɔkyɛntɛ lakple baawa baababuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di Ben-Hadad kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Lakpee nlɛ babafũ koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle lɛfɔ, basɔfɔ lɛfɔ ku babi lɛfɔ bawakoe. <verse eid="1KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6" />Kafɔɔ kɔsɛɛ nuakpa okle kamakpee banɔɔfotii nii mamakpɛnkpɛ lɛkayo lɛfɔ ku banɔɔfotii lɛfɔ ayo kamɛ. Babafũ lɛsaa biala niefũ fɔ ni kɔya, mantuka nya mansifiko.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7" />Ninfɛ di Israel ɔka lalɛɛ kasɔ nwu banɔɔfo bamuu aatɔkɔ ma alɛ, “Binyu mmle di osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle komiɛ ni kaloosa! Aakpee alɛ babafũ basɔfɔ nii ku babi nii, koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle nii, ntasĩ nwɔ ɔta.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8" />Ni di banɔɔfo nwu ku batii nwu bamuu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Tan-nu nwɔ ɔlaa ee faatuna ko nwɔ di asaa ya ɔɔkaalɛ nii.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9" />Nioso aatɔkɔ Ben-Hadad batɔkyɛntɛ nwu alɛ, “Bilaatɔkɔ saate nii ɔka bilɛ, ‘Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamabla di asaa kasale ya amuu faakaalɛ ni kanya, kafɔɔ n-ya mmle fɔɔkaalɛ ni nnya, nintuna.’ ” Ni di batɔkyɛntɛ nwu lasifi baalaayɔ ntale baakyɛnko Ben-Hadad nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10" />Ninfɛ di Ben-Hadad lata kanya bamba Ahab alɛ: “Bayaa nwu bakaalɛ mi, bia bata ditɛ diwɛ osie nwaa, nse kudù ko nimabu ni di Samaria kapɔ kun-yii bakpɛtɛ nii biala kɔnɛɛ kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11" />Ni di Israel ɔka ladiki kanya alɛ, “Bitɔkɔ nwɔ bilɛ: ‘Otii wɔ ninkpee ni akpɛsaa nɔɔ ankyɛ ni kakpɛ, atankanta fɛle otii wɔ ninkyɛ ni kakpɛ ankple anwa amadiki akpɛsaa nɔɔ nwu antɛ ni.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12" />Ben-Hadad lanu kanya ka mmle di obe wɔ di nnwɔɔ ku baka nwu latoonyi ni nta di akpaayo lɛma kamɛ, ni aatɔkɔ bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ alɛ: “Bilolaa suoto biɛlaadieko ma.” Nioso baalolaa suoto alɛ bɔɔlaadieko okpoo kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="1KI 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab Lalenkee Ben-Hadad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13" />Nfanwu, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ onwii lawa aabatɔkɔ Israel ɔka Ahab alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Fɔɔnya bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ le mmle? Kamayɔ ni nkpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ miɛ, ni fabatofo falɛ ami ninle <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14" />Ni di Ahab lakaalɛ alɛ, “Kafɔɔ owe nimabla nle mmle?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ, ‘Kale dikudi kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ bakosopo nimabla ni.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Ni aakaalɛ alɛ, “Ni owe nimakye kakpɛ nwu kasɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu ladiki kanya alɛ, “Afɔ nimakye kasɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15" />Nioso Ahab lalɛɛ kale dikudi kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ basokopo, alafa-anyɔ-afosi-atiɛ-banyɔ. Ninfɛ aasiisa Israel batii bule, bamuu labla nkpe nkuɛnsĩ. <verse eid="1KI 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16" />Ni baadie ku kakũ nwu, di obe wɔ di Ben-Hadad ku baka afosi-atiɛ-banyɔ ba niabla ni onwii ku nnwɔɔ lasiɛ ni di akpaayo lɛma kamɛ baatoosiɛ ni nta. <verse eid="1KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17" />Kale dikudi kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ bakosopo nwu niakasa odie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:17">Ni di kasɔ balantɛ ba di Ben-Hadad lakpee ni kɔtɔ labatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Bakpɛtɛ lekye Samaria bɔɔwa.”<verse eid="1KI 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18" />Ni di Ben-Hadad labuɛ alɛ, “Nse atoko ɔkyɛ ole bɔɔwako yi, biemufũ ma ku nkpa; nse kakpɛ kafɔɔ bɔɔwako yi, biemufũ ma ku nkpa.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19" />Ni di kale dikudi kakpɛ kanyabayilatɛ bakosopo nwu lakyɛ baadie di okpoo kplɛ nwu, di bakpɛtɛ lɛma latikanko ma ni sɛɛmaa, <verse eid="1KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20" />ni di obiala lalo lo nɔɔ nɛ. Di obe nwu kamɛ, Siria batii latoso, ni di Israel batii latikanko ma nɛ. Kafɔɔ Siria ɔka, Ben-Hadad latoso aasifi di pɔnkɔ suoto ku bapɔnkɔ basiɛtɛ nɔɔ bawo. <verse eid="1KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21" />Israel ɔka lakpɛ, ni aafũ bapɔnkɔ ku bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii, ni aalo Siria batii kpinwu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22" />Nni kamaa, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lawa Israel ɔka nfũ aabatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Siensa bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ, faanyu lɛsaa le dikaatɛ bɛɛbla ni, diekye di kabienle ka nikɔwa nii, Siria ɔka kamakple andieko fɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Siria Batii Ladieko Israel Lɛnyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23" />Ninfɛ di Siria ɔka banɔɔfotii laka nwɔ baabuɛ alɛ, “Bayaa lɛma nle akpenkpe bayaa. Nkpo oso baasiiwo osie nɛ. Kafɔɔ nse buɔkpɛko ma di sɛtaata yi, nwaako bubawɛ osie munlenkee ma. <verse eid="1KI 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24" />Bibla mmle: Bikyisa baka bamuu di nyilakɔ lɛma, biɛyɔ banɔɔfotii bamba bise di nyilakɔ lɛma. <verse eid="1KI 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25" />Dikpe ni biese kafɔɔ bakpɛtɛ fɛle mba niakpi ye ni- bapɔnkɔ di bapɔnkɔ lɛpɔ kanya, bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kafɔɔ di bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kanya- di mmle buafuo ni Israel ɔkpɛko di sɛtaata nwu. Ni nwaako, bubawɛ osie munlenkee ma.” Ni aatunako ma, aadiki kɔkpaa di mmle diasiɛko ni kanya nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26" />Di kabienle ka niawa nii, Ben-Hadad lasiisa Siria bakpɛtɛ, ni baakata baakyɛ Afek baalaakpɛ Israel nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27" />Obe wɔ kafɔɔ baasiisa ni Israel batii, baata ma ni alesaa asaa yi, baadie baakyɛ baalaakyakako ma. Israel bakpɛtɛ lasiɛ baakyɔɔ Siria bakpɛtɛ anu, fɛle batie di akudi biibii anyɔ, di obe wɔ di Siria bakpɛtɛ kafɔɔ layii ni kale nwu.<verse eid="1KI 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28" />Ninfɛ di Yaa otii nwu labatɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni: ‘Ta di Siria batii lenyu alɛ, <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu nle ni akpenkpe yaa, ni ananle ni sɛtaata yaa oso yi, kamayɔ bakpɛtɛ dikudi kplɛ le mmle nkpee di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ. Ni fabatofo falɛ ami ninle <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29" />Ayi akuɛnsĩ amu baasiɛ baakyɔɔ bawo anu, ni di dii kuɛnsinle suoto kakpɛ nwu lasɔ nɛ. Israel bakpɛtɛ laloloo Siria bakpɛtɛ ba ninkyɛ ni ninkpaa, nkpe kɔlafa di dii ninwii kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30" />Babule lɛma latoso baabuo di Afek okpoo kplɛ kamɛ, ninfɛ di oyoyiɛ labiɛ kuapɛ batii lɛma nkpe afosi-anyɔ nkpe nkuɛnsĩ nɛ. Ni di Ben-Hadad latoso aasifi okpoo kplɛ nwu aalaawofo di leyo ninwii kamɛ, kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31" />Ni di banɔɔfotii nɔɔ latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nyu, buonu bulɛ Israel leyo baka nle nyaami banyatɛ. Bita bukyɛ Israel ɔka nfũ, buominisa aboko di sɛtɔ loo, buominisa sikũ di asi loo. Loobia abafũ ye nkpa.”<verse eid="1KI 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32" />Baayɔ aboko baaminisa sɛtɔ lɛma, baaminisa sikũ di asi lɛma, ni baakyɛ Israel ɔka nfũ baalaatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Ben-Hadad alɛ; ‘Lekoto tɛɛ nsiɛ nkpa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Ni di Israel ɔka lakaalɛ alɛ, “Eekple akpe nkpa? Obiloo-suɔtɔbi ale.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33" />Ni di Ben-Hadad batii nwu layɔ ɔlaa nwu fɛ kɔkpaa didiki biene kule nɛ, nioso baapɛsɛwa baakafɔ ɔlaa nɔɔ nwu baabuɛ alɛ, “Yii, obilee-suɔtɔbi Ben-Hadad!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Ni di ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “Bilaakpaa nwɔ biwako.” Di Ben-Hadad ladie aawa nii, Ahab latɔɔ aakata aabuo di keke nɔɔ wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni kamɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34" />Ninfɛ di Ben-Hadad latɔkɔ Ahab alɛ, “Kamakplesa sekpoo kplɛ se di teemi lafũ ni di teefɔ nfũ nta fɔ. Fantɛ asaa kasunsũkɔ lɛfɔ amu di aba nwu di Damasko, fɛ mmle di teemi labla ni di Samaria.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Ni di Ahab labuɛ alɛ, “Di kanya ninii oso yi, kamadiɛ fɔ fansifi.” Nioso aabla kanya ninii ku nnwɔɔ, ni aadiɛ Ben-Hadad aasifi nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Onwii Latɛ Ahab Kolò</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35" />Di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa kanya yi, Yaa ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ onwii obisuɔtɔbi latɔkɔ oklopo nɔɔ alɛ, “Safɔ mi ku lɛkpɛsaa lɛfɔ.” Kafɔɔ osuɔtɔ nwu lasĩ.<verse eid="1KI 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36" />Nioso Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Ta fanaanu ni <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa oso yi, nse feedie odie di ɔkyɛ nii, kyata kamalo fɔ.” Di osuɔtɔ nwu lasifi nii, kyata lakyakako nwɔ, ni aalo nwɔ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37" />Ni di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lanya osuɔtɔ bamba, ni aatɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Lekoto, safɔ mi.” Nioso osuɔtɔ nwu lasafɔ nwɔ, aatika nwɔ kakɔ. <verse eid="1KI 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lasifi aalaayila di osuku kotoko aasoko ɔka nɛ. Aakyɛlɛnsa asaa di suoto nɔɔ, aayɔ dibula aaninii disi diatĩi anu nɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39" />Di ɔka nwu latoofe nii, Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lalɛɛ nwɔ aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lakyɛ kakpɛkɔ kasienlekɔ, ni di otii onwii lawa ɔkyɛ nii ku otii onwii baamufũ ni aawako aababuɛ alɛ, ‘Toonyu osuɔtɔ wɔ mmle. Nse eeyu, ni nkpa lɛfɔ fabayɔ fanta nkpa nɔɔ disi, ee fabata koto fututu fɛ bakilo afosi-atiɛ-bana.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40" />Obe wɔ di ninu lasɛɛ ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, oofe ni katoo ku kala yi, osuɔtɔ nwu layɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Ni di Israel ɔka nwu labuɛ alɛ, “Afɔ omu niebuɛ nwu, nioso nni ninle letoko nanfi lɛfɔ nɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41" />Ninfɛ di Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nwu lapɛsɛwa aafukiti dibula nwu aaninii ni disi ku anu nɔɔ, ni di Israel ɔka latofo nwɔ alɛ Yaa ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ onwii ale nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42" />Ni aatɔkɔ ɔka nwu alɛ, “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: ‘Afɔ feediɛ osuɔtɔ wɔ latɛ nlɛ aakpi ni lesifi. Nkpo oso nkpa lɛfɔ ninle diɛta nkpa nɔɔ, batii lɛfɔ bata ni batii nɔɔ.’ ” <verse eid="1KI 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43" />Ni di Israel ɔka nwu lakatu anu, aanya ɔblɔ aasifi lɛkayo nɔɔ di Samaria nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 20:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Nabot Nta Awosobi Kofe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1" />Obe owo sɛmaa, ɔlaa onwii lawa di nta awosobi kofe ko niale ni Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu kole suoto. Nta awosobi kofe nwu lawɛ di Yesreel, kuakaako ni Samaria ɔka Ahab lɛkayo. <verse eid="1KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2" />Ni di Ahab latɔkɔ Nabot alɛ, “Yɔ nta awosobi kofe lɛfɔ nwu fatɛɛ, nin-yɔ mbla kutu ablasaa kɔba, ta kuɔkaako ni lɛkayo nii oso. Buɔkyɛlɛnsa, ninta fɔ nta awosobi kofe ko ninlɛ kulenke ni, ee nse dilɛ fɔ, kamata fɔ kɔya lele kuofũ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3" />Kafɔɔ Nabot ladiki kanya alɛ, “<char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ata dikyɛ diokyo alɛ kayɔ bate nii atesaa nta fɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4" />Nioso Ahab lasifi leyo, aakatu anu, aanya ɔblɔ ta Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu labuɛ ni alɛ, “Namayɔ bate nii atesaa nta fɔ ni oso.” Ni aalaate di atensaa nɔɔ suoto, aamunikĩisa anu aakyɔɔ oyoyiɛ, aasĩ alesaa ole nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5" />Ni di ɔsɔfɔ Yesebel lawa aabakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Obe oso fɔɔnya ɔblɔ osie kanya nkpo? Obe oso fonoole alesaa?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6" />Ni aatɔkɔ ɔsɔfɔ alɛ, “Ta latɔkɔ ni Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu nlɛ, ‘Sunsũ nta awosobi kofe lɛfɔ fatɛɛ; ee nse dilɛ fɔ, kamata fɔ nta awosobi kofe bamba nkyisa.’ Kafɔɔ Nabot labuɛ alɛ, ‘Namayɔ nta awosobi kofe nii nta fɔ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7" />Ni di ɔsɔfɔ Yesebel labuɛ alɛ, “Diele afɔ nikole sɛka di Israel suoto? Taka faale alesaa! Nya otu. Kamafũ Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu nta awosobi kofe nta fɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8" />Nioso ɔsanko nwu lakpana akũ di Ahab leyooto kanya, aayɔ ɔka nwu nsũ lɛtɛsaa aatika, ni aayɔ aakyɛnko okpoo banɔɔfo ku banɔɔfotii ba niasiɛ ni di Nabot okpoo kplɛ nwu ku nnwɔɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9" />Di akũ nwu kamɛ, ɔsanko nwu lakpana alɛ:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="1KI 21:9">“Bitɛ dii baanii kanya, biɛta Nabot kasiɛkɔ kplɛ asiɛ di batii nwu kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10" />Kafɔɔ bita atiipɛ anyɔ basiɛ bakyɔɔ Nabot anu, baabudi nwɔ kanya alɛ ɛɛkpaani Yaa ku ɔka, akyuu lɛma anyɔ. Biɛkpaa nwɔ bidieko bilaasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ bilo.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11" />Nioso okpoo banɔɔfo ku banɔɔfotii ba niasiɛ ni di Nabot okpoo kplɛ nwu labla fɛ mmle di Yesebel labuɛ ni di akũ ya aakpana aata ma ni kanya. <verse eid="1KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12" />Baatɛ kanya onii nwu, ni baasiɛsa Nabot di kasiɛkɔ kplɛ di batii nwu kamɛ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13" />Ninfɛ di atiipɛ anyɔ nwu labasiɛ baakyɔɔ Nabot anu, baabuɛ ɔlaa baatika nwɔ di suoto, di batii nwu anu baabuɛ alɛ, “Nabot lakpaani Yaa ku ɔka, akyuu lɛma nwu anyɔ.” Nioso baakpaa nwɔ baadieko di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ baalaasafɔ nwɔ afuɔ baalo. <verse eid="1KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14" />Ninfɛ baata Yesebel kanya alɛ, “Batɔɔsafɔ Nabot afuɔ, nioso aatookpi.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15" />Di Yesebel lanu onu alɛ batɔɔsafɔ ni Nabot afuɔ beelo nii, ni aatɔkɔ Ahab alɛ, “Taka faalaayɔ Nabot, Yesreel otii nwu nta awosobi kofe ko aasĩ ni osunsũ ɔta fɔ. Aasinsi nkpa, kafɔɔ atookpi.” <verse eid="1KI 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16" />Obe wɔ di Ahab lanu alɛ Nabot ntookpi nii, ni aataka, aasoo aakyɛ aalaayɔ Nabot nta awosobi kofe nwu nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Elia, Tisbi otii nwu alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18" />“Soo fakyɛ faalaakyakako Israel ɔka Ahab, nnwɔ nikole ni sɛka di Samaria. Kanunua nfɛ akpe di Nabot nta awosobi kofe kamɛ, nfa atɔɔkyɛ alɛ ɔɔlayɔ kũ nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19" />Tɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni: Diele otii fatoolo, ni faatoofũ atesaa nɔɔ nɛ?’ Ni faatɔkɔ nwɔ falɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ: Di lɛba le di baweewee laya ni Nabot ntɔ yi, nfa di baweewee kamaya ntɔ lɛfɔ nɛ- nwaako, ntɔ lɛfɔ!’ ”<verse eid="1KI 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20" />Ni di Ahab latɔkɔ Elia alɛ, “Lo nii, nioso fatabanyɛɛ!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Ni di Elia latuna alɛ, “Ntɔbanya fɔ, diekye fatoosunsũ suoto lɛfɔ fɛɛta okpile di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu. <verse eid="1KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21" />‘Nfɛ kɔmawako ɔlaa kpile di suoto lɛfɔ. Kamawɔɔsa banantii lɛfɔ, kamalo kafɔɔ Ahab osuɔtɔ yɛntɛle biala, ndiki di Israel- ɔlanle ee nnwɔ ninsiko ni suoto. <verse eid="1KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22" />Kamabla leyo lɛfɔ ninte fɛle Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam lele okle, ku Ahigya obisuɔtɔbi, Baasa lele okle. Diekye fatookpee mi ɔblɔ, fɛɛta kafɔɔ Israel lɛbla okpile.’<verse eid="1KI 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23" />“Di Yesebel suoto yi, <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu lebuɛ alɛ, ‘Baweewee nimabɛbɛɛ Yesebel di Yesreel seyoyiɛ suoto.’<verse eid="1KI 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24" />“Baweewee kamawee mba ninle ni Ahab bale, beekpi ni di okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ. Kɔfɛɛfɔ bakansiɛ kafɔɔ kamakyɔkyɔfɛ mba niekpi ni di lepoo kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25" />(Otii kuonwii ditawɛ diidii, fɛle Ahab, aayɔ suoto nɔɔ aasunsũ aata ni sikpile ole di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, di ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ Yesebel lakpee nwɔ alɛ abla nii. <verse eid="1KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26" />Ahab labla ayududusaa aatikanko afiɔ, fɛle mmle di Amori batii ba di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu latososa aadiki ni di Israel anu.)<verse eid="1KI 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27" />Obe wɔ di Ahab lanu ni Elia sɛlaa se mmle, aabɛbɛɛ akpeele nɔɔ, aaminisa leboko ni aanii kanya nɛ. Aatoote di leboko kamɛ, aakyɛ aatookyi sɛnyaami kanya.<verse eid="1KI 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa lawa kuata Elia, Tisbi otii nwu alɛ: <verse eid="1KI 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29" />“Fatɔɔnya mmle di Ahab ntɔɔwakosa ni suoto nɔɔ kasɔ di anu nii? Ta atɔɔwakosa ni suoto nɔɔ kasɔ oso yi, namasinta ɔlaa kpile wɔ mmle kuwa di obe nɔɔ kamɛ. Kafɔɔ kamata nwu kunwa di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ obe kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ Mikaia Lasĩ Ɔlaa Aata Ahab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1" />Fɛ alɛɛ atiɛ kamɛ, kakpɛ kukanwii ditawɛ di Siria ku Israel ntɛɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2" />Kafɔɔ di lɛlɛɛ tiefa kamɛ, Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lasoo aakyɛ aalaanya Israel ɔka. <verse eid="1KI 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3" />Ni di Israel ɔka latɔkɔ banɔɔfotii nɔɔ alɛ, “Bieye bilɛ Ramot Gilead okpoo kplɛ nwu ole wo kule, ni munɔɔbla lɛsalɛsaa bulɛ buokple munfũ nwu di Siria ɔka nnɛɛ nɛ?”<verse eid="1KI 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4" />Nioso Ahab lakaalɛ Yehosafat alɛ, “Fabatikankoe munaakpɛko Ramot Gilead?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Ni di Yohosafat ladiki aatɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Nte fɛ mmle fate nii, batii nii fɛ batii lɛfɔ, bapɔnkɔ nii fɛ bapɔnkɔ lɛfɔ.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5" />Kafɔɔ Yehosafat lakple aatɔkɔ Israel ɔka alɛ, “Le katũ fawolaa kamɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu nfũ fiɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6" />Nioso Israel ɔka lalɛɛ ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ aasiisa- baabla fɛ basuɔtɔ alafa-ana- ni aakaalɛ ma alɛ, “Nkyɛ ninaakpɛko Ramot Gilead ɛɛ, sɛɛ ndiɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Ni baadiki kanya alɛ, “Kyɛ, diekye <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamayɔ nwu ankpee di ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7" />Kafɔɔ Yehosafat lakaalɛ alɛ, “<char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaabuɛtɛtɛ nnaa ninfũ, buakyɛ munaawolaa ni kamɛ?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8" />Ni di Israel ɔka latɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Osuɔtɔ onwii lekple eebu, nnwɔɔ ɔkyɛ buafuo <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamɛ owolaa okyeko nɛ. Kafɔɔ lekyidi nwɔ, diekye diidii ambuɛ ɔlaa biene kuonwii di suoto nii, kafɔɔ obe lele okpile. Nnwɔɔ ninle Imla obisuɔtɔbi, Mikaia nɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Ni di Yehosafat labuɛ alɛ, “Ɔka atambuɛ ɔlaa nwu.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9" />Nioso Israel ɔka lalɛɛ ɔnɔɔfotii nɔɔ onwii aatɔkɔ alɛ, “Laalɛɛ Imla obisuɔtɔbi, Mikaia fawoko kanunua.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10" />Ni di Israel ɔka ku Yuda ɔka Yehosafat laklee akasaa lɛma baasiɛ di akakpomii lɛma suoto di kakpaa di Samaria kayoko kanya, di obe wɔ di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamuu latoobuɛ sɛlaa baatɔɔtɛ ni di anu lɛma. <verse eid="1KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11" />Ninfɛ di Kenaana obisuɔtɔbi, Sedekaia labla abɔɔsaa akya aabuɛ alɛ: “Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kobuɛ ni alɛ, ‘N-ya mmle fabayɔ fantukusa Siria batii nwu ninaase ni di obe wɔ babawɔɔ ni nɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12" />Ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamba nwu bamuu latoobuɛ ɔlaa nwu onwii baatɔɔtɛ. Baatoobuɛ alɛ, “Laadieko Ramot Gilead, fabalɛnkee. Diekye <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamayɔ nwu ankpee di ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13" />Ni di tɔkyɛntɛ wɔ niakyɛ aalalɛɛ ni Mikaia latɔkɔ nwɔ alɛ, “Nyu, ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamba nwu kobuɛ lelenkee mantɛ fɛ otii onwii manta ɔka. Nioso ta ɔlaa lɛfɔ kukaatɛɛ ku olema, faakakatɛ diɛkyɛkyɛ nwɔ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14" />Kafɔɔ Mikaia labuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu lɛnya akpe ni nkpa, kamatɔkɔ nwɔ ɔlaa wɔ lete di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu lɛtɔkɔ mi nii.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15" />Obe wɔ aababuo nii, ɔka nwu lakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Mikaia, bukyɛ bulaakpɛko Ramot Gilead ɛɛ, sɛɛ ndiɛ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Ni aadiki kanya alɛ, “Laakpɛko Ramot Gilead, fabalɛnkee. Diekye <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamayɔ nwu ankpee di ɔka nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16" />Ni di ɔka lakaaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Sɛsɛ ninta fɔ faka ntam fatɔkɔ mi falɛ onukwale lete fababuɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu leyooto kamɛ?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17" />Ninfɛ di Mikaia labuɛ alɛ, “Lanya Israel omuu lɛsasami bakpete di akpenkpe nwu osi fɛle bafoso ba ninaa ni kpatɛ. Ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu labuɛ alɛ, ‘Batii ba mmle nnaa saate. Bita obiala lɛma atɔɔkyɛ leyo di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18" />Ninfɛ di Israel ɔka latɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Ntatɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ diidii ambuɛ lɛsaa biene kuninwii di suoto nii, kafɔɔ dikpile lete?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19" />Ni di Mikaia lakple aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, “Nioso nu <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa: Lanya <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu nsi di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto, di osi bakpɛtɛ bamuu n-yɛ beekyi nwɔ ni di oletanɛɛkyɛ nɔɔ ku ɔmɛntukyɛ nɔɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20" />Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu labuɛ alɛ, ‘Owe nimakyɔnkyɔ Ahab ankyɛ anaadieko Ramot Gilead, anaawɛ kukpi nɔɔ ninfa?’ </para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:20">“Otii onwii kobuɛ mmle, ɔbamba kafɔɔ kobuɛ ɔbamba. <verse eid="1KI 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21" />Yɛntɛyɛntɛ, ninwuna ninwii ladie diawa sitũ, diabayila di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu diabuɛ alɛ, ‘Ami kamakyɛ nnaakyɔnkyɔ nwɔ.’<verse eid="1KI 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22" />Ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu lakaalɛ alɛ, “ ‘Di ɔmɛnsuku suoto?’ </para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Ni diabuɛ alɛ, “ ‘Kamadie nkyɛ ninaale sɛlaa ku afunu ninwuna di Ahab ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ bamuu n-nya kamɛ.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Ninfɛ di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu labuɛ alɛ, “ ‘Fabalenkee nwɔ ku kakyɔnkyɔ. Tɔɔkyɛ faalaabla nkpo.’<verse eid="1KI 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23" />“Nioso, kanunua, <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ntɔɔyɔ sɛlaa ku afunu ninwuna eekpee di ɔlaababuɛtɛtɛ lɛfɔ bamuu n-nya kamɛ. <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ntoobuɛ alɛ ɔlaa kpile kamawa fɔ di suoto.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24" />Ninfɛ di Kenaana obisuɔtɔbi, Sedekia lakyɛ aalaapɛ Mikaia kɔnɛɛ kootokosi aakaalɛ nwɔ alɛ, “Ɔmɛnsuku suoto di ninwuna nwu di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu kamɛ lafe fiɛ aadie mi kaamɛ aabakakatɛ aata fɔ?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25" />Ni di Mikaia ladiki kanya alɛ, “Fabanya di dii le fabalaawofa ni di leyo le kamɛ kamɛ.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26" />Ninfɛ di Israel ɔka labuɛ alɛ, “ Bikpaa Mikaia biekplesa nwɔ bisifiko Amon okpoo kplɛ nwu nyuntɛ ku ɔka obisuɔtɔbi, Yoas ɔkyɛ, <verse eid="1KI 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27" />biɛtɔkɔ ma bilɛ, ‘Nnya ɔlaa wɔ di ɔka kobuɛ ni alɛ: Biyɔ otii wɔ mmle bitɛ di leyo katenkɔ, bitantɔɔ kafɔɔ lɛsalɛsaa dilenkee bloblo ku ntu, dilaase di obe wɔ kamakple ni buɛɛ.’ ”<verse eid="1KI 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28" />Ni di Mikaia labuɛ alɛ, “Nse feekple fɛɛwa buɛɛ yi, ni <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ditakakatɛ afenko di suoto nii.” Ninfɛ aabuɛ aakyakaa alɛ, “Aye batii ba mmle bamuu, bitɛ sɛlaa nii nsũ!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahab Kukpi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29" />Nioso Israel ɔka ku Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lakyɛ baalaadieko Ramot Gilead. <verse eid="1KI 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30" />Ni di Israel ɔka latɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Kamakyɛ kakpɛ kamɛ ku akpeele ya manamatofo mi nii, kafɔɔ afɔ klee akasaa lɛfɔ.” Nioso Israel ɔka lakpee akpeele bamba, aamunikĩisa suoto, ni aasifi kakpɛ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31" />Ni di Siria ɔka latɔkɔ bakeke nɔɔ ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ afosi-atiɛ-banyɔ alɛ, “Bitankpɛko kuonwii, ɔnɔɔfo ee obisɔ, diediki Israel ɔka.” <verse eid="1KI 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32" />Obe wɔ di bakeke nwu bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ lanya ni Yehosafat, baabuɛ alɛ, “Nwaako nnya Israel ɔka.” Nioso baamunikĩi alɛ bɔɔkpɛko nwɔ, kafɔɔ obe wɔ di Yehosafat lafaa ni kakpɛ nɔɔ lɛfaa yi, <verse eid="1KI 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33" />ni di bakeke nwu bakpɛtɛ kanyabayilatɛ lanya alɛ ditale Israel ɔka, ni baadiɛ nwɔ otikanko nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34" />Kafɔɔ otii onwii lataa kɔtaa nɔɔ ko, ni kualaatofo Israel ɔka di akpɛsaa nɔɔ sebo nwu nɛ. Ni di ɔka nwu latɔkɔ keke nɔɔ kantɛ alɛ, “Munikĩi faaka mi fadieko di kakpɛkɔ kamɛ. Diekye batootika mi kakɔ.” <verse eid="1KI 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35" />Dii nwu kale kamuu kakpɛ kanya lawɛ osie, ni baamufũ ɔka nwu baaklee di keke nɔɔ nwu kamɛ, aakyɔɔ ni Siria batii anu nɛ. Kakɔ nɔɔ nwu ntɔ lasoo diate di keke nwu kasɔ, ni aakpi ku kɔtɔɔfɔ nwu nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36" />Di kufĩ nfɛ kɔmɛɛ nii, kanya ladie di Israel bakpɛtɛ nwu kamɛ kaafenko alɛ: “Osuɔtɔ biala asifi okpoo nɔɔ; osuɔtɔ biala asifi kasɔ nɔɔ!”<verse eid="1KI 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37" />Nioso ɔka nwu lakpi, ni baakpaa nwɔ baawako Samaria baabakookaa nwɔ ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38" />Baafoto keke nwu di ntu lɛpanta ninwii di Samaria, (di lɛbale di basɔnɔkpeetɛ nkpe ni ntu). Ni di Baweewee labayanya ntɔ nɔɔ nwu, fɛ mmle di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu ɔlaa labuɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39" />Di Ahab sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, di n-ya aabla ni amuu nkyaka nii, lɛkayo le aatofo alolaa ni ku to anyɛɛ, sekpoo kplɛ se aatofo seyoyiɛ aakyisa nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Israel baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40" />Ahab latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Ahasia layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Ɔka Yehosafat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41" />Ni di Israel ɔka lɛlɛɛ naafa kamɛ yi, Asa obisuɔtɔbi, Yehosafat labale Yuda ɔka nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42" />Yehosafat lafũ alɛɛ afosi-atiɛ-anɔɔ fiɛ aabale ɔka. Ni aale sɛka di Yerusalem alɛɛ afosi-anyɔ- anɔɔ nɛ. Ɔya leyooto niale Asuba, Silhi obisankobi aale. <verse eid="1KI 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43" />Aakyɛ di ote Asa sisuku kanya, atadiɛ sĩ aatɛ; aabla nle niasiɛko ni di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu. Kafɔɔ atakyisa ntakalekɔ nwu, ni di batii lakple baalaatɔɔta sele, baatɔɔfiɛ olufui ninfa nɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44" />Yehosafat kafɔɔ lasiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ ku Israel ɔka.<verse eid="1KI 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45" />Di Yehosafat sɛka ole sɛsaabla bamba, asaa ya aafũ ni leyooto ku nkpɛ be aakpɛ nii, bɛɛkpana nya di Yuda baka sekofolaa kukũ kamɛ. <verse eid="1KI 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46" />Aawɔɔsa nfiofa basɔnɔbakpeetɛ basuɔtɔ ba niabu ni di kasɔ nwu ninfa, bia di ote Asa sɛka olebee sɛmaa. <verse eid="1KI 22:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47" />Di Yehosafat obe nwu kamɛ ɔka ditawɛ di Edom; okpoo nyuntɛ niatoo nyu nwu.<verse eid="1KI 22:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48" />Ninfɛ di Yehosafat lata baabla seklo se nimatɔɔkyɛ ni Ofir manaatootuka ni koto sɛɛle nɛ. Kafɔɔ diidii sitakyɛ di ntu osi- diekye sialalaa di Esion Geber. <verse eid="1KI 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49" />Di obe nwu kamɛ Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Ahasia latɔkɔ Yehosafat alɛ, “Ta batii nii batikanko batii lɛfɔ di ntu osi,” kafɔɔ Yehosafat lasĩ.<verse eid="1KI 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50" />Ninfɛ di Yehosafat latɛ ɔnyɛɛ ku bate nɔɔ nɛ, ni baakookaa nwɔ ku mma di Dawid okpoo kplɛ kamɛ nɛ. Ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Yehoram layila nwɔ kaanya fɛ ɔka nɛ.<verse eid="1KI 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Ɔka Ahasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51" />Di Yuda ɔka Yehosafat lefosi lɛlɛɛ-kuɛsinle kamɛ yi, Ahab obisuɔtɔbi, Ahasia labale Israel ɔka di Samaria. Aale sɛka di Israel suoto alɛɛ anyɔ. <verse eid="1KI 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52" />Aale sikpile di <char style="nd">Saate </char> nwu anu, diekye aakyɛ di ote ku ɔya sisuku kanya ku Nebat obisuɔtɔbi, Yeroboam sisuku kanya, aata Israel labla okpile. <verse eid="1KI 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53" />Aatɔ, aasumu Baal, ni aakpee <char style="nd">Saate </char>, Israel Yaa nwu ɔblɔ, fe mmle di ote labla ni okle.<verse eid="1KI 22:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22" />
</usx>